nt.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/b1ccf52f2a62f779e62fc08b6dbadcb94c535b33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T06:19:00Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T06:19:00Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"message":"Rewrite the About prose in concrete terms\n\nReplaces \"engineering excellence\", \"measurable business impact\" and\n\"Fortune 500 clients\" — phrases that could sit on any engineer''s page —\nwith what the work actually is.\n\nAdapted from the About section of the LinkedIn profile, which was\nsharper than what the site carried, but keeping the specifics LinkedIn\nomits: the 1,000+ issuing banks, and what was actually built at Walmart\nand Infosys rather than \"mobile applications\" and \"distributed systems\".","tree":{"sha":"03d702c571903fe48068de5e1be75b0a2c4b01b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/trees/03d702c571903fe48068de5e1be75b0a2c4b01b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/commits/b1ccf52f2a62f779e62fc08b6dbadcb94c535b33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/b1ccf52f2a62f779e62fc08b6dbadcb94c535b33","node_id":"C_kwDOBJ21jdoAKGIxY2NmNTJmMmE2MmY3NzllNjJmYzA4YjZkYmFkY2I5NGM1MzViMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/5cc27d1f96a70a6adeeb5eb637456e2e8b500fe2","sha":"5cc27d1f96a70a6adeeb5eb637456e2e8b500fe2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/5cc27d1f96a70a6adeeb5eb637456e2e8b500fe2"}],"sha":"b1ccf52f2a62f779e62fc08b6dbadcb94c535b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/b1ccf52f2a62f779e62fc08b6dbadcb94c535b33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/5cc27d1f96a70a6adeeb5eb637456e2e8b500fe2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T05:27:15Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T05:27:15Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"message":"Retire the three Start Bootstrap typefaces\n\nThe page was loading five families and running two type systems at\nonce: Kaushan Script, Montserrat and Droid Serif from the 2013 Agency\ntemplate, alongside the Inter and IBM Plex Mono added during the\nrebuild. Inter and IBM Plex Mono now carry the whole page.\n\n- Montserrat -> Inter: headings, nav, buttons, ledger figures\n- Droid Serif -> Inter: hero eyebrow and section subheadings, italics kept\n- Kaushan Script -> IBM Plex Mono: the wordmark\n\nThe wordmark moving to mono is the one deliberate choice here. The\nledger''s captions are already set in that face, so the name now shares\na voice with the part of the page that is actually his rather than\nsitting in a script face the template happened to ship.\n\nMono needed its own metrics: the script face''s 2em would have run the\nwordmark off the nav, so it is 16px / 19px at the wide breakpoint,\nweight 500, with a touch of tracking. The mobile hero eyebrow was\nKaushan and would have become mono-italic; it now matches the desktop\nbreakpoint at Inter italic.\n\nThree families dropped from the Google Fonts request.","tree":{"sha":"ccc650f2c21fdfc623d986b0f522ffba26f6bb69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/trees/ccc650f2c21fdfc623d986b0f522ffba26f6bb69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/commits/5cc27d1f96a70a6adeeb5eb637456e2e8b500fe2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/5cc27d1f96a70a6adeeb5eb637456e2e8b500fe2","node_id":"C_kwDOBJ21jdoAKDVjYzI3ZDFmOTZhNzBhNmFkZWViNWViNjM3NDU2ZTJlOGI1MDBmZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/b1981166a55dd118a3af1f9d09a3fa7e5dc96080","sha":"b1981166a55dd118a3af1f9d09a3fa7e5dc96080","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/b1981166a55dd118a3af1f9d09a3fa7e5dc96080"}],"sha":"5cc27d1f96a70a6adeeb5eb637456e2e8b500fe2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/5cc27d1f96a70a6adeeb5eb637456e2e8b500fe2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/b1981166a55dd118a3af1f9d09a3fa7e5dc96080/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T05:14:20Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T05:14:20Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"message":"Fix ledger rows staying blank after an anchor jump\n\nClick PROJECTS or EDUCATION in the nav and you could land mid-section\non an empty screen: heading, rule, then nothing.\n\nThe observer uses threshold 0.15 with a -12% bottom rootMargin, which\nleaves a band where a row is on screen but does not qualify to reveal.\nA row is only unobserved once it reveals, so those rows stayed observed\n— but nothing re-evaluates them while the page sits still, and the\n3-second safety net had long since fired. A deep link or a nav click\nwith no subsequent scroll left the section blank indefinitely.\n\nAdds a catch-up pass that reveals anything actually in the viewport,\nwith no stagger, wired to hashchange, resize and load, plus a run on\nfirst paint when the URL carries a hash. The scroll animation is\nunchanged: rows below the fold still rule in one at a time, and\nprefers-reduced-motion still skips the whole thing.\n\nVerified across seven anchor jumps — every row in the viewport reveals,\nand only 3 of 10 are revealed at rest, so the effect still works.","tree":{"sha":"acd3428a222f014d7b23acc7874e7a993dee0594","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/trees/acd3428a222f014d7b23acc7874e7a993dee0594"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/commits/b1981166a55dd118a3af1f9d09a3fa7e5dc96080","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/b1981166a55dd118a3af1f9d09a3fa7e5dc96080","node_id":"C_kwDOBJ21jdoAKGIxOTgxMTY2YTU1ZGQxMThhM2FmMWY5ZDA5YTNmYTdlNWRjOTYwODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/4daebc3504947d1e4811e298f08a0c9c662f4d23","sha":"4daebc3504947d1e4811e298f08a0c9c662f4d23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/4daebc3504947d1e4811e298f08a0c9c662f4d23"}],"sha":"b1981166a55dd118a3af1f9d09a3fa7e5dc96080","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/b1981166a55dd118a3af1f9d09a3fa7e5dc96080"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/4daebc3504947d1e4811e298f08a0c9c662f4d23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T04:52:09Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T04:52:09Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"message":"Replace the template yellow with a navy slate palette\n\nThe site inherited #fed136 from Start Bootstrap''s Agency theme. It was\nalso Visa-adjacent, which is the wrong association on a page whose job\nis moving off Visa.\n\nChrome #27374D, ground #DDE6ED, accent #3FC1C9 on dark and #0F4C75 on\nlight. Hairlines (#C3D0DA) and the ledger''s unit-labels (#4A5F73) take\ntheir own tones from the same ramp, so the neutrals read as chosen\nrather than inherited.\n\nColours are from the two most-liked navy/slate palettes on Color Hunt.\nEvery pair was measured rather than eyeballed: accent-on-chrome 5.57:1,\ndeep-accent-on-ground 7.19:1, unit-labels 5.23:1, ground-text-on-chrome\n9.55:1 — all clear WCAG AA. The old link gold was 2.38:1 on white and\nthe template yellow 1.46:1, so this is a large accessibility gain as\nwell as a visual one.\n\nOnly the two stylesheets change; no markup was touched.","tree":{"sha":"db47290273cda2a288b4c92edb583d0f712fef41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/trees/db47290273cda2a288b4c92edb583d0f712fef41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/commits/4daebc3504947d1e4811e298f08a0c9c662f4d23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https: