m/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/743a4b3d7c0462fe8efdfa8007236edf02253462/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T23:51:55Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T23:51:55Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"message":"Rebuild Education as a ledger; add the Stanford certificate\n\nReuses .ledger-row/.ledger-figure/.ledger-body from Featured Projects, so\nthe two sections cannot drift apart — no new CSS. Year in the left margin,\ncredential type as the mono label, awarding institution on the stack line.\nledger-reveal.js selects .ledger-row globally, so the rows pick up the\nhairline draw with no JS change.\n\nThe Stanford IT Project Management certificate (2022) was on the résumé\nbut missing from the site; worded identically here so the two cannot\ncontradict each other. Ordered most recent first, matching the Timeline\nsection above.\n\n.edu-grid and .edu-sub are left in components.css, now unused, to keep\nthis revertible.","tree":{"sha":"46f41dc1987d02d5619fa954e3b4914e2783fb2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/trees/46f41dc1987d02d5619fa954e3b4914e2783fb2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/commits/743a4b3d7c0462fe8efdfa8007236edf02253462","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/san