usetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/94ac2bd165ec15ddc65f47d5c41107516730c996/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T23:51:45Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T23:51:45Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"message":"Add a local CSS fallback for when the Bootstrap CDN is blocked\n\nposition:fixed on the navbar, the container widths and the grid were\ndefined only by bootstrap.min.css on cdn.jsdelivr.net. With that host\nunreachable the navbar drops into document flow as an unstyled bullet\nlist over the hero. Corporate networks at banks, payment processors and\nsecurity vendors routinely block public CDNs, which is exactly the\naudience this site is for.\n\nLinked before the CDN stylesheet on purpose: identical specificity means\nBootstrap wins whenever it loads, so a normal page load is unchanged.\nValues are from Bootstrap 3.4.1 — re-sync if that version is bumped.","tree":{"sha":"c3956afe33ff405051a3ce12a4d747f31d8df49d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/trees/c3956afe33ff405051a3ce12a4d747f31d8df49d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/commits/94ac2bd165ec15ddc65f47d5c41107516730c996","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.c