om/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/2901c75d9ce3eb4abcfdca2a7bf5905a44b3d19a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T08:01:42Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T08:01:42Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"message":"Rotating deadpan hero; personal eyebrow\n\nThe hero read like a LinkedIn headline. It now cycles six matched\nheadline/sub-line pairs every six seconds, in a dry register that uses the\nplatform''s real constraints as the joke: no canary, no rollback, one\nenvironment.\n\n- The <h1> in the HTML source stays fixed at \"The rollback plan is to not be\n  wrong.\" That is what search engines index, what link-preview scrapers fetch,\n  and what a visitor without JavaScript sees. The rotation paints over it; it is\n  a layer, not the source of truth.\n- Headline and sub-line move as a pair, so a punchline never lands on top of an\n  unrelated backing line.\n- Eyebrow is now \"Staff Engineer at Visa. Cricket captain on weekends.\" The\n  credential survives; the stiffness does not.\n- Pauses on hover and keyboard focus (WCAG 2.2.2), does not run under\n  prefers-reduced-motion, and stops while the tab is hidden.\n- Heights are reserved from the tallest pair so swapping never nudges the page.\n  The reservation re-runs on document.fonts.ready: measured against the fallback\n  face it under-reserved and every swap shifted the layout by 25px. Now 3.","tree":{"sha":"11ffb65bbdd02b8bd91e0fd3c408371b3b936e0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/trees/11ffb65bbdd02b8bd91e0fd3c408371b3b936e0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/commits/2901c75d9ce3eb4abcfdca2a7bf5905a44b3d19a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/2901c75d9ce3eb4abcfdca2a7bf5905a44b3d19a","node_id":"C_kwDOBJ21jdoAKDI5MDFjNzVkOWNlM2ViNGFiY2ZkY2EyYTdiZjU5MDVhNDRiM2QxOWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/3f686ae9f527681b12437d9dc3449e15a35f5505","sha":"3f686ae9f527681b12437d9dc3449e15a35f5505","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/3f686ae9f527681b12437d9dc3449e15a35f5505"}],"sha":"2901c75d9ce3eb4abcfdca2a7bf5905a44b3d19a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/2901c75d9ce3eb4abcfdca2a7bf5905a44b3d19a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/3f686ae9f527681b12437d9dc3449e15a35f5505/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T04:19:36Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T04:19:36Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"message":"Remove the Twitter profile link\n\nDropped from the header social row and from the JSON-LD sameAs array. LinkedIn\nand GitHub remain.\n\nThe twitter:card meta tags are deliberately kept. Despite the name they do not\nlink to any profile - they are what makes the page unfurl with a title,\ndescription and preview image when the URL is shared, on X and on everything\nelse that reads those tags.","tree":{"sha":"c567df7f5a4542046a6be8c3cdd3728ef3d9e749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/trees/c567df7f5a4542046a6be8c3cdd3728ef3d9e749"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/commits/3f686ae9f527681b12437d9dc3449e15a35f5505","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/3f686ae9f527681b12437d9dc3449e15a35f5505","node_id":"C_kwDOBJ21jdoAKDNmNjg2YWU5ZjUyNzY4MWIxMjQzN2Q5ZGMzNDQ5ZTE1YTM1ZjU1MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/c48c860a7f9f8a97367f66bfd85d6718aabc5328","sha":"c48c860a7f9f8a97367f66bfd85d6718aabc5328","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/c48c860a7f9f8a97367f66bfd85d6718aabc5328"}],"sha":"3f686ae9f527681b12437d9dc3449e15a35f5505","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/3f686ae9f527681b12437d9dc3449e15a35f5505"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/c48c860a7f9f8a97367f66bfd85d6718aabc5328/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T04:12:34Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T04:12:34Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"message":"Rebuild the timeline; add the hero claim line, scrim and ledger reveal\n\nTimeline\n- Seven entries with circular photographs become six date-rail rows, the same\n  structure the ledger uses. Five of those images were 200x200 stock building\n  shots upscaled into 150px circles, and the Visa logo appeared twice; none of\n  them said anything about the work. Section drops from ~2,500px to ~1,480px\n  and the page from 9,500 to 7,815.\n- Order flipped to newest first. The current role used to sit at the bottom of\n  a 2,500px section, so a visitor had to scroll all of it to learn what he does\n  now. Labelled \"Most recent first\".\n- The four-month \"Systems Engineer Trainee\" entry is merged into the main\n  Infosys row, matching the resume, which carries one Infosys entry.\n- The image files are untouched on disk; they are simply no longer referenced.\n\nHero\n- Adds the strongest claim available and one that appeared nowhere on the site:\n  \"Inline on the authorization path - 100% of traffic - No canary.\" 7.4:1.\n- A left-weighted scrim so the headline stops running across the portrait. The\n  image is unchanged; only the type''s ground is darkened. Vertical on mobile,\n  where the layout stacks.\n\nLedger reveal\n- Each Featured Projects row is ruled in as it enters: the hairline draws left\n  to right, then the content settles. It echoes the section''s own line rather\n  than decorating, which is why there is no count-up on the figures.\n- Drawn with transform:scaleX on a pseudo-element. Animating background-size\n  from a length to a percentage reported 0% and never rendered.\n- Does nothing under prefers-reduced-motion or without IntersectionObserver,\n  and a 3s fallback reveals anything at or above the fold if the observer never\n  fires. A missed animation costs nothing; a blank section would not.","tree":{"sha":"a691004df6f837c6d5beebd0d81b52855ceea616","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/trees/a691004df6f837c6d5beebd0d81b52855ceea616"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/commits/c48c860a7f9f8a97367f66bfd85d6718aabc5328","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/c48c860a7f9f8a97367f66bfd85d6718aabc5328","node_id":"C_kwDOBJ21jdoAKGM0OGM4NjBhN2Y5ZjhhOTczNjdmNjZiZmQ4NWQ2NzE4YWFiYzUzMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/d693781f841d37bfcba947d772687bdd9d1f61a6","sha":"d693781f841d37bfcba947d772687bdd9d1f61a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/d693781f841d37bfcba947d772687bdd9d1f61a6"}],"sha":"c48c860a7f9f8a97367f66bfd85d6718aabc5328","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/c48c860a7f9f8a97367f66bfd85d6718aabc5328"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/d693781f841d37bfcba947d772687bdd9d1f61a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T03:56:21Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T03:56:21Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"message":"Restructure Projects, Recognition, Education and About Me\n\nProjects, Recognition and Education keep the site''s own palette and Montserrat\nheadings; only what sits inside them changed.\n\n- Featured Projects is now a ledger: seven rows, each led by the number it\n  moved (6 teams, 130/130, 9,000 analyst-hours, 8.34M requests, 12 sec, 85+\n  pages, 62%). Replaces four icon tiles. Earlier Projects is untouched, with\n  its screenshots and repo links intact.\n- Recognition and Education rebuilt on rules rather than icon circles.\n- About Me drops the \"Impact & Achievements\" column: five of its six bullets\n  restated the ledger, 250 words apart in a different format. Now two columns.\n  The 62% claim lived only there, so it became the seventh ledger row rather\n  than being lost.\n- Removed three decorative Font Awesome glyphs (an \"i\", a laptop, a diamond)\n  and six emoji bullets.\n- Dropped justified text from four blocks. CSS has no hyphenation, and the\n  columns are ~35 characters wide, so justification only made rivers.\n- Résumé button off Bootstrap''s .btn-info cyan and onto the site gold with\n  dark text: 10.9:1. It was the only element on the page outside the palette.\n- Tech Stack labels #fed136 -> #8a711d. The brand gold is 1.46:1 on white;\n  the replacement is the same 46-degree hue darkened to 4.71:1.\n- Added IBM Plex Mono to the existing single fonts request for data labels.","tree":{"sha":"042d819bfb3375179727d0bed600dd75aaafbc68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/trees/042d819bfb3375179727d0bed600dd75aaafbc68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/commits/d693781f841d37bfcba947d772687bdd9d1f61a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer