_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/092909f17cb735b9622e4cde1b18e90d9ee9c2fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T03:56:07Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T03:56:07Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"message":"Fix unreadable text: hero headline and nav active pill\n\nTwo contrast failures, both shipped earlier today.\n\n- The hero headline was invisible. Converting <div class=\"intro-heading\"> to\n  <h1> for the missing-h1 fix made it match the global \"h1,h2,... {color:#222}\"\n  rule directly, which beats the white it had been inheriting from header.\n  Result: #222 on a near-black hero, roughly 1.2:1. Now white at 20.6:1.\n- The active nav pill was white on #fed136 gold: 1.46:1, against a 4.5 minimum.\n  #222 on the same gold is 10.9:1.","tree":{"sha":"6306751a24f1a0b1c586bd27b8e352e8d4931392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/trees/6306751a24f1a0b1c586bd27b8e352e8d4931392"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/commits/092909f17cb735b9622e4cde1b18e90d9ee9c2fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/092909f17cb735b9622e4cde1b18e90d9ee9c2fb","node_id":"C_kwDOBJ21jdoAKDA5MjkwOWYxN2NiNzM1Yjk2MjJlNGNkZTFiMThlOTBkOWVlOWMyZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/b18108d7ce166f1a38810160d5328b647207ca75","sha":"b18108d7ce166f1a38810160d5328b647207ca75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/b18108d7ce166f1a38810160d5328b647207ca75"}],"sha":"092909f17cb735b9622e4cde1b18e90d9ee9c2fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/092909f17cb735b9622e4cde1b18e90d9ee9c2fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/b18108d7ce166f1a38810160d5328b647207ca75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T22:47:52Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T22:47:52Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"message":"Connect the contact form to Formspree\n\nThe endpoint was still the placeholder YOUR_FORM_ID, so every submission failed\nafter passing validation.\n\n- Endpoint set to https://formspree.io/f/xqpzvqgp\n- Explicit Accept: application/json header. Without it Formspree answers an AJAX\n  POST with a 302 to its own thank-you page instead of JSON.\n- 422 responses now surface Formspree''s field-level messages instead of the\n  generic failure text.\n- Added a _gotcha honeypot field, hidden from humans and from assistive tech,\n  so Formspree drops bot submissions before they reach the inbox.","tree":{"sha":"ec2a33544e545de8cddcd31f5d624eba5415a24a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/trees/ec2a33544e545de8cddcd31f5d624eba5415a24a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/commits/b18108d7ce166f1a38810160d5328b647207ca75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/b18108d7ce166f1a38810160d5328b647207ca75","node_id":"C_kwDOBJ21jdoAKGIxODEwOGQ3Y2UxNjZmMWEzODgxMDE2MGQ1MzI4YjY0NzIwN2NhNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commit/504bed5a4531294ad40ccd780c5511f6a84e6803","sha":"504bed5a4531294ad40ccd780c5511f6a84e6803","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/504bed5a4531294ad40ccd780c5511f6a84e6803"}],"sha":"b18108d7ce166f1a38810160d5328b647207ca75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/b18108d7ce166f1a38810160d5328b647207ca75"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/commits/504bed5a4531294ad40ccd780c5511f6a84e6803/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T21:55:47Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T21:55:47Z","email":"santanu.setu@gmail.com","name":"Santanu Chakraborty"},"message":"Head hygiene, a real social card, and content rewrites\n\n- Added rel=canonical. GitHub Pages serves the page at both / and /index.html.\n- Collapsed four separate Google Fonts requests into one; five stylesheets in\n  the head instead of eight.\n- Added SRI to jquery-easing, the only remaining unpinned CDN script.\n- og:image and twitter:image were an abstract background texture. Replaced with\n  a real 1200x630 card carrying name, title, focus and URL, plus image:alt and\n  explicit dimensions. og:type is now \"profile\".\n- map-image.webp 237 KB -> 74 KB. The size was in the alpha channel, not the\n  quality setting; renders identically.\n- Education blurbs were four paragraphs about SJSU''s acreage and BIT''s founding\n  year. Rewritten to say what he studied and what he did.\n- README rewrote: it still described him as \"Senior Systems Engineer at Infosys\"\n  and \"Android Developer intern\", listed only 2015 student projects, and linked\n  a Facebook profile that was removed from the site earlier today.","tree