t to\n  tdcommons.org. None of it was on the site before.\n- Section order is now Profile, Projects, Recognition, Timeline, Education.\n  A degree ranking above a decade of work read as a new-grad layout. Background\n  alternation adjusted to match.\n- The hero headline is now the page''s h1; the page previously had none at all.\n- Favicon set added (SC monogram, site palette) plus a web manifest. There was\n  no favicon and no link tag.\n- CTA reads \"Résumé\" instead of \"Hire Me\".\n- Contact section now states availability instead of thanking visitors.\n- Added robots.txt, sitemap.xml and a styled 404 page.","tree":{"sha":"b46fe35c4b1033dafe8582db1725fbea4e5d7c83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/trees/b46fe35c4b1033dafe8582db1725fbea4e5d7c83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santanusetu/santanusetu.github.io/git/commits/a3b4c80d8d8fac1752ed65a0a6b5fb90ca48bc0a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9577484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santanusetu","id":9577484,"login":"santanusetu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Nzc0ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santanusetu","user_view_type":