it/a134252af660177ee550d77418a3db28c2e20197","node_id":"C_kwDOBL_HbNoAKGExMzQyNTJhZjY2MDE3N2VlNTUwZDc3NDE4YTNkYjI4YzJlMjAxOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/commit/e474d9fe870c5bda61fc538f8732853b7ca7f3e7","sha":"e474d9fe870c5bda61fc538f8732853b7ca7f3e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/commits/e474d9fe870c5bda61fc538f8732853b7ca7f3e7"}],"sha":"a134252af660177ee550d77418a3db28c2e20197","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/commits/a134252af660177ee550d77418a3db28c2e20197"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32600934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xXBJXx","id":32600934,"login":"xXBJXx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjAwOTM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/commits/e474d9fe870c5bda61fc538f8732853b7ca7f3e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T15:41:10Z","email":"issi.dev.iobroker@gmail.com","name":"Issi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T15:41:56Z","email":"issi.dev.iobroker@gmail.com","name":"Issi"},"message":"chore: release v6.1.0\n\n* (xXBJXx) VIS 1 widget: added the cleaning settings, dock station, map selection, do-not-disturb and next-timer sections of the VIS 2 widget, a configurable history length, manager-specific auto-fill of the state attributes, translated state and error texts in all languages, SVG icons instead of Unicode symbols, and a layout that follows the widget width\n* (xXBJXx) Removed 115 unused duplicate translation keys of the widget texts\n* (xXBJXx) Completed the Spanish, French, Italian, Dutch, Polish, Portuguese, Russian, Ukrainian and Chinese translations of the Admin configuration and both widgets; they previously showed English texts\n* (xXBJXx) VIS 2 widget: added water level, mop mode and carpet mode controls, dock station status and actions, map selection and reload, and a schedule section with do-not-disturb, next timer and timer switches; every control appears only when the robot provides the matching state, and the instance selection also finds the Viomi and Dreame state names\n* (xXBJXx) Reworked the VIS 2 widget: it follows the VIS 2 theme with an optional accent color, lays itself out by its own width, fills all state attributes from the selected instance, detects rooms automatically, takes suction levels and status texts from the adapter states, confirms resets in a dialog, and has a configurable history length\n* (xXBJXx) VIS 1 widget: respect the configured widget size instead of forcing 1280x800 and label the map image correctly\n* (xXBJXx) Upgraded the Admin configuration and the VIS 2 widget to React 19, MUI 9, and `@iobroker/gui-components` 10 so the widget keeps working with upcoming VIS 2 releases while staying compatible with the current VIS 2\n* (xXBJXx) Updated `qs` to 6.16 and the VIS 2 type definitions and Module Federation tooling to their current versions","tree":{"sha":"6bee9db9aa024b22b42eae93d2541f9dace2f9e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/git/trees/6bee9db9aa024b22b42eae93d2541f9dace2f9e2"},"url":"https://api.