/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T17:38:17Z","email":"issi.dev.iobroker@gmail.com","name":"Issi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T17:38:17Z","email":"issi.dev.iobroker@gmail.com","name":"Issi"},"message":"chore: release v6.0.1\n\n* (xXBJXx) Remove install-time and prepublish build hooks, build explicitly in CI, and disable unsupported GitHub installations (#1223)\n* (xXBJXx) Start directly from `build/main.js` and generate Admin/VIS bundles for npm packages instead of tracking build output in Git\n* (xXBJXx) Verify script-free package installation, generated UI assets, direct startup, and Compact Mode\n* (xXBJXx) Remove unused Chai test plugins, add VS Code metadata schema support, and annotate the optional Canvas dependency for the repository checker (#1222)\n* (xXBJXx) Allow Dependabot updates of GitHub Actions and dependency versions without failing the package policy tests (#1235)\n* (xXBJXx) Restore the \"Add Alexa/IoT states\" option in the Admin configuration so `control.pauseResume` is no longer deleted on every start\n* (xXBJXx) Fix the `getCleaningSummary` message, which sent a consumable reset instead of requesting the cleaning summary\n* (xXBJXx) Answer the legacy `send` message only once and no longer forward it to the device manager\n* (xXBJXx) Reject map updates with a clear error when neither the Xiaomi Cloud map nor Valetudo is enabled instead of leaving the request pending\n* (xXBJXx) Track every pending internal delay separately so all of them are cancelled on unload, and remove a duplicated `control.goTo` definition\n* (kosmix1980) Apply the room fan, water and mop settings through miIO before queued and repeated room cleanings start instead of racing them against the start command (#1231)\n* (kosmix1980) Keep the native multi-pass segment cleaning lockout only for the current run instead of persisting it after a single error (#1231)\n* (xXBJXx) Continue starting the cleaning with a warning when a fan, water or mop parameter command fails","tree":{"sha":"40a4d867bdcad7d54de876ddfdf6b91e839408d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/git/trees/40a4d867bdcad7d54de876ddfdf6b91e839408d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/git/commits/9b851934c100e82f00f0dd16c515b533e0f4e9c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32600934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xXBJXx","id":32600934,"login":"xXBJXx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjAwOTM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/commit/9b851934c100e82f00f0dd16c515b533e0f4e9c8","node_id":"C_kwDOBL_HbNoAKDliODUxOTM0YzEwMGU4MmYwMGYwZGQxNmM1MTViNTMzZTBmNGU5Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/commit/f84692823a01fe0111213aae2e0abc56d891ce6b","sha":"f84692823a01fe0111213aae2e0abc56d891ce6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/commits/f84692823a01fe0111213aae2e0abc56d891ce6b"}],"sha":"9b851934c100e82f00f0dd16c515b533e0f4e9c8","url":"https: