sage exactly once instead of responding and then\n  forwarding it to the device manager as well.\n- Send get_clean_summary for the getCleaningSummary message instead of a\n  consumable reset.\n- Reject MapHelper.updateMap with a clear error when neither the cloud map nor\n  Valetudo is enabled instead of leaving the promise pending.\n- Keep a separate timeout handle per pending delay so close() cancels all of\n  them.\n- Remove the duplicated control.goTo definition from the object catalog and\n  update the reviewed catalog digest.\n- Add regression tests, the translation key in all languages, README entries,\n  and changelog lines.","tree":{"sha":"9e117bea56edbde2c6816afd8bb0002003271fb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/git/trees/9e117bea56edbde2c6816afd8bb0002003271fb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/git/commits/5f632c44f657ae774264821359822185cb8c7100","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32600934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xXBJXx","id":32600934,"login":"xXBJXx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjAwOTM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx","user_view_type":"p