oker@gmail.com","name":"Issi"},"message":"test: allow Dependabot action and dependency updates in package policy tests (#1235)\n\nThe package policy tests pinned exact dependency version strings and exact\nmajor versions of the GitHub Actions used in the workflow. Dependabot bumped\nioBroker/testing-action-check to v2, which turned the upstream CI red.\n\nAssert caret ranges and minimum majors instead of exact versions, and accept\nany current major of the official ioBroker and GitHub actions while still\nrejecting the retired ones.","tree":{"sha":"485bc84d79cbd3d037649c3fc8d3fdf2bb6f2a2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/git/trees/485bc84d79cbd3d037649c3fc8d3fdf2bb6f2a2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/git/commits/623192c2a773f69f4344e323a0b7fc3c14093cca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32600934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xXBJXx","id":32600934,"login":"xXBJXx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjAwOTM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xXBJXx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.mihome-vacuum/commit/62319