,"verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/4bc779a639deb54be33f16fc1c816214a6b807c2","node_id":"C_kwDOBMB9P9oAKDRiYzc3OWE2MzlkZWI1NGJlMzNmMTZmYzFjODE2MjE0YTZiODA3YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/d475f2e60535486edec74e4cc456abf5a9a63de5","sha":"d475f2e60535486edec74e4cc456abf5a9a63de5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/d475f2e60535486edec74e4cc456abf5a9a63de5"}],"sha":"4bc779a639deb54be33f16fc1c816214a6b807c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/4bc779a639deb54be33f16fc1c816214a6b807c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963573?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidfirst","id":1963573,"login":"davidfirst","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1NzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/d475f2e60535486edec74e4cc456abf5a9a63de5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:33:51Z","email":"davidnet@gmail.com","name":"David First"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:33:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): bump lodash to 4.18.1 and proxy-addr to 2.0.8 for security (#10775)\n\nSecurity scans found two vulnerable dependencies. This change updates\nthem.\n\n- lodash 4.17.21 has prototype pollution and code injection\nvulnerabilities (CVE-2025-13465, CVE-2026-2950, CVE-2021-23337,\nCVE-2026-4800). The workspace policy and the override pinned this\nversion. Both now use 4.18.1. Published `@teambit/*` packages will then\ndeclare the fixed version. The override stays, because external\ndependencies (older `@teambit/*` versions and verdaccio) still pin\n4.17.21.\n- `@teambit/component-id` 1.2.5, `@teambit/legacy-bit-id` 1.1.4 and\n`@teambit/react.ui.component-highlighter` 0.2.9 do not use lodash. The\npolicy now uses these versions. New overrides collapse all 1.x copies of\ncomponent-id and legacy-bit-id to one version, to prevent duplicate\nclasses at runtime.\n- proxy-addr 2.0.7 has a critical vulnerability (GHSA-jqcg-44mw-7w3h).\nexpress pulls this version. All express versions in use accept 2.0.8, so\nthe lockfile update is sufficient. No override is necessary.","tree":{"sha":"8dbee36fceec6fd5da87f657dddd9dbccf97e180","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/8dbee36fceec6fd5da87f657dddd9dbccf97e180"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/d475f2e60535486edec74e4cc456abf5a9a63de5","verification":{"payload":"tree 8dbee36fceec6fd5da87f657dddd9dbccf97e180\nparent 363a3570b894c381d1816e3c87a1af30f6c3ffcf\nauthor David First <davidnet@gmail.com> 1791405231 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791405231 +0000\n\nfix(deps): bump lodash to 4.18.1 and proxy-addr to 2.0.8 for security (#10775)\n\nSecurity scans found two vulnerable dependencies. This change updates\nthem.\n\n- lodash 4.17.21 has prototype pollution and code injection\nvulnerabilities (CVE-2025-13465, CVE-2026-2950, CVE-2021-23337,\nCVE-2026-4800). The workspace policy and the override pinned this\nversion. Both now use 4.18.1. Published `@teambit/*` packages will then\ndeclare the fixed version. The override stays, because external\ndependencies (older `@teambit/*` versions and verdaccio) still pin\n4.17.21.\n- `@teambit/component-id` 1.2.5, `@teambit/legacy-bit-id` 1.1.4 and\n`@teambit/react.ui.component-highlighter` 0.2.9 do not use lodash. The\npolicy now uses these versions. New overrides collapse all 1.x copies of\ncomponent-id and legacy-bit-id to one version, to prevent duplicate\nclasses at runtime.\n- proxy-addr 2.0.7 has a critical vulnerability (GHSA-jqcg-44mw-7w3h).\nexpress pulls this version. All express versions in use accept 2.0.8, so\nthe lockfile update is sufficient. No override is necessary.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxqyvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkaQQAB2+1UDIf5ltlYr5o69GtxrJ\nzbeHCJUjNof3aFpoQ61D2ZeRf0pwi6530XRuQw/ZnZPOk78Ln5gAVwCzdrMzzyWA\nFxKXfS9Muzy16kc845gb+3EEWjIoOpavi85lDJBwDGHHguuU+qmbXKEKEj2lFI83\nboH1tV9Ik8cz5/kmK8Coroe5QCH6pshn7GenfBJwtYgz11rm/ts5QHxqf/m/Vrq2\nqxDbvuibZmC1WSvb3rCUz4Drrqy8EyssMqGa8SSkmjJlPhpfqE6aVREHJZsjqSjk\ncIpnl9fg/Bz/O6SXzNvkDVxvlslVS4818Av0A/x4Jg/OVgQo11gIustssjR4aV53\nRzz4Uo67FMtY+kDbP0fCiShAuOir3nGkVA498xZ2fI/6C5vZ/U1LmcUUlDwiEGsV\nFJAt7WjxyxzjEHf0BwyXoWRWYBCd15A/aSEgFTpZ0eWNuWwIm5SQ1xSiw+wssXXT\nDmGBIefLd6X5AdTukMNV2ODj6vXDSTo2G1U1lq3xxuGcLhCxWw4WXyvEKJICSdza\nMW4bPFJ57nzQ3teoSrJHSGpaBIPgoUqq63Ne/bTWf12zotlD6n4rZU+0pLtX8JEX\nfS+O+W3tcfBR0CBYui/XeKP9c94+B888WEa3S9W30kUDqrWizlrfXgcKluoonetK\nM+HMMqjyjvZ+NE3hZdHw\n=IDe9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T20:33:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/d475f2e60535486edec74e4cc456abf5a9a63de5","node_id":"C_kwDOBMB9P9oAKGQ0NzVmMmU2MDUzNTQ4NmVkZWM3NGU0Y2M0NTZhYmY1YTlhNjNkZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/363a3570b894c381d1816e3c87a1af30f6c3ffcf","sha":"363a3570b894c381d1816e3c87a1af30f6c3ffcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/363a3570b894c381d1816e3c87a1af30f6c3ffcf"}],"sha":"d475f2e60535486edec74e4cc456abf5a9a63de5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/d475f2e60535486edec74e4cc456abf5a9a63de5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/363a3570b894c381d1816e3c87a1af30f6c3ffcf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:40:04Z","email":"bit-ci[bot]@bit.cloud","name":"Bit CI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:40:04Z","email":"bit-ci[bot]@bit.cloud","name":"Bit CI"},"message":"bump teambit version to 2.2.93 [skip ci]","tree":{"sha":"31aaaeb323ec97b89f0a15cd66419b4a417da462","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/31aaaeb323ec97b89f0a15cd66419b4a417da462"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/363a3570b894c381d1816e3c87a1af30f6c3ffcf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/363a3570b894c381d1816e3c87a1af30f6c3ffcf","node_id":"C_kwDOBMB9P9oAKDM2M2EzNTcwYjg5NGMzODFkMTgxNmUzYzg3YTFhZjMwZjZjM2ZmY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/2e79fabdf2c6a6fa47c8bd259dfeb37373214eed","sha":"2e79fabdf2c6a6fa47c8bd259dfeb37373214eed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/2e79fabdf2c6a6fa47c8bd259dfeb37373214eed"}],"sha":"363a3570b894c381d1816e3c87a1af30f6c3ffcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/363a3570b894c381d1816e3c87a1af30f6c3ffcf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1927579?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zkochan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zkochan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zkochan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zkochan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zkochan","id":1927579,"login":"zkochan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5Mjc1Nzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zkochan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zkochan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zkochan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zkochan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zkochan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zkochan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/2e79fabdf2c6a6fa47c8bd259dfeb37373214eed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:08:20Z","email":"z@kochan.io","name":"Zoltan Kochan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:08:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(pnpm): keep the pnpmfileChecksum in the dependencies graph (#10772)\n\n## Proposed Changes\n\n- Store the lockfile''s `pnpmfileChecksum` in the dependencies graph, and\nwrite it back when a lockfile is restored from the graph. Since #10748,\ninstalls pass `readPackageHookChecksum: ''bit-1''`. A restored lockfile\nhad no checksum, so the engine treated it as resolved with other\nreadPackage hooks and resolved everything again.\n- `DependenciesGraph.pnpmfileChecksum` is optional. The schema version\nstays the same, so graphs saved before this change still load. `merge()`\nkeeps the checksum only when both graphs have the same value, and so\ndoes the merge into an existing lockfile in\n`dependenciesGraphToLockfile`.\n- A graph saved without a checksum gets none in the restored lockfile,\nso pnpm resolves it again. I didn''t fall back to the current `''bit-1''`,\nbecause the hooks changed what they do to dependency manifests after\ngraphs started being stored: removing `@teambit/harmony` from every\ndependency was added in #9662, after schema 2.0 graphs. An old graph can\nhold resolutions the current hooks wouldn''t produce.\n- Bump `@pnpm/napi` to 12.10.1. It includes pnpm/pnpm#16662: `rebuild()`\nnow checks only the lockfile''s `patchedDependencies` against the\noptions. Before, it failed with `ERR_PNPM_LOCKFILE_CONFIG_MISMATCH` on\nany lockfile that recorded a `pnpmfileChecksum`, whatever\n`readPackageHookChecksum` was passed. That broke the dry-run install\nfollowed by `rebuild()` on restored lockfiles (fusepm in Ripple CI).\n- The lockfile was regenerated with this repo''s Bit. It changes only the\n`@pnpm/napi` entries, records `pnpmfileChecksum: bit-1` in place of\n`untrackedPnpmfileReadPackageHook: true`, and dedupes one peer provider\n(`commands-provider` 0.0.52 to 0.0.51).\n\nOnce this is released, fusepm''s temporary workaround that adds\n`pnpmfileChecksum` to the lockfile before `rebuild()` can be removed.\n\n### Tests\n\n- `dependencies-graph.spec.ts`: serialize/deserialize, an old graph\nwithout the field, `merge` with matching and conflicting checksums.\nThese ran locally: 11 passing.\n- `lockfile-deps-graph-converter.spec.ts`: lockfile → graph → lockfile\nkeeps the checksum, and a graph without one stays without one.\n- `pnpm.package-manager.spec.ts`: `mergeGraphLockfileIntoExisting` keeps\na matching checksum and drops a conflicting or missing one.\n- I couldn''t run the two pnpm spec files locally: outside the env''s test\nrunner, importing them pulls in a UI package that plain Node can''t load.\nThey rely on CI. `npm run lint` passes.\n- Checked directly against `@pnpm/napi` 12.10.1: `rebuild()` passes on a\nlockfile whose `pnpmfileChecksum` is `bit-1`, another value, or missing,\nwhatever `readPackageHookChecksum` is passed.\n\n---\nWritten by an agent (Claude Code, claude-opus-5-5).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec196c7890229092c8716da017698633b79594ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/ec196c7890229092c8716da017698633b79594ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/2e79fabdf2c6a6fa47c8bd259dfeb37373214eed","verification":{"payload":"tree ec196c7890229092c8716da017698633b79594ab\nparent 8133f9b3ce039c3d3244a8f1966807a44bcd8d6d\nauthor Zoltan Kochan <z@kochan.io> 1791320900 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791320900 +0200\n\nfix(pnpm): keep the pnpmfileChecksum in the dependencies graph (#10772)\n\n## Proposed Changes\n\n- Store the lockfile''s `pnpmfileChecksum` in the dependencies graph, and\nwrite it back when a lockfile is restored from the graph. Since #10748,\ninstalls pass `readPackageHookChecksum: ''bit-1''`. A restored lockfile\nhad no checksum, so the engine treated it as resolved with other\nreadPackage hooks and resolved everything again.\n- `DependenciesGraph.pnpmfileChecksum` is optional. The schema version\nstays the same, so graphs saved before this change still load. `merge()`\nkeeps the checksum only when both graphs have the same value, and so\ndoes the merge into an existing lockfile in\n`dependenciesGraphToLockfile`.\n- A graph saved without a checksum gets none in the restored lockfile,\nso pnpm resolves it again. I didn''t fall back to the current `''bit-1''`,\nbecause the hooks changed what they do to dependency manifests after\ngraphs started being stored: removing `@teambit/harmony` from every\ndependency was added in #9662, after schema 2.0 graphs. An old graph can\nhold resolutions the current hooks wouldn''t produce.\n- Bump `@pnpm/napi` to 12.10.1. It includes pnpm/pnpm#16662: `rebuild()`\nnow checks only the lockfile''s `patchedDependencies` against the\noptions. Before, it failed with `ERR_PNPM_LOCKFILE_CONFIG_MISMATCH` on\nany lockfile that recorded a `pnpmfileChecksum`, whatever\n`readPackageHookChecksum` was passed. That broke the dry-run install\nfollowed by `rebuild()` on restored lockfiles (fusepm in Ripple CI).\n- The lockfile was regenerated with this repo''s Bit. It changes only the\n`@pnpm/napi` entries, records `pnpmfileChecksum: bit-1` in place of\n`untrackedPnpmfileReadPackageHook: true`, and dedupes one peer provider\n(`commands-provider` 0.0.52 to 0.0.51).\n\nOnce this is released, fusepm''s temporary workaround that adds\n`pnpmfileChecksum` to the lockfile before `rebuild()` can be removed.\n\n### Tests\n\n- `dependencies-graph.spec.ts`: serialize/deserialize, an old graph\nwithout the field, `merge` with matching and conflicting checksums.\nThese ran locally: 11 passing.\n- `lockfile-deps-graph-converter.spec.ts`: lockfile → graph → lockfile\nkeeps the checksum, and a graph without one stays without one.\n- `pnpm.package-manager.spec.ts`: `mergeGraphLockfileIntoExisting` keeps\na matching checksum and drops a conflicting or missing one.\n- I couldn''t run the two pnpm spec files locally: outside the env''s test\nrunner, importing them pulls in a UI package that plain Node can''t load.\nThey rely on CI. `npm run lint` passes.\n- Checked directly against `@pnpm/napi` 12.10.1: `rebuild()` passes on a\nlockfile whose `pnpmfileChecksum` is `bit-1`, another value, or missing,\nwhatever `readPackageHookChecksum` is passed.\n\n---\nWritten 