aspect.\n\nCycles baseline: 66 → 55 components, 353 → 271 edges. The new\ncomponent-compare → dev-files edge follows the DI order, and is inside a\ncycle only because dev-files still is.","tree":{"sha":"0ef3a5fd84f9b19712f94fe4f978348d0519b05b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/0ef3a5fd84f9b19712f94fe4f978348d0519b05b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/4fddbcac974ebbe167022e315f29d950480b29fc","verification":{"payload":"tree 0ef3a5fd84f9b19712f94fe4f978348d0519b05b\nparent 993f1b1e32acfc7e25f5a61869d1f76c537bfd31\nauthor David First <davidnet@gmail.com> 1791305023 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791305023 +0000\n\nrefactor: decouple schema and component-compare from formatter, typescript and tester (#10769)\n\nPhase 2, step 3. Removes three imports that point against the dependency\norder. The formatter and tester slot registrations stay as they are.\n\n- schema: `SchemaExtractorOptions.formatter` uses a narrow\n`SnippetFormatter` type (the only method the extractor calls), instead\nof `Formatter` from `@teambit/formatter`.\n- schema: the deprecated `schemaTransformers`/`apiTransformers` params\nof `getSchema()` are typed `unknown[]` and still forwarded to the env,\nso it no longer imports `@teambit/typescript`. No caller in the repo\npasses them.\n- component-compare: reads the test files from dev-files instead of\ndepending on the tester aspect.\n\nCycles baseline: 66 → 55 components, 353 → 271 edges. The new\ncomponent-compare → dev-files edge follows the DI order, and is inside a\ncycle only because dev-files still is.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxSU/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApboQAHHX4GoD9srSxOTyIkrqcwRp\naLf31uxc0RVY88e5dF25IU8m2YU1fRXjFrv50X/m8JzC2rcB7NiMjBxubhNqFRYu\ngGwTgGHQJrG9cGmELZfTIjXs8jYfy4laXwh9CF1hoO4HjDvk2RJ1ED4J/pAbOj3y\ntvYmywxcyzXMp8xHc8/2S87X0gLzMsemA9fDbFBFueSgGAzW3rD7vvurud8teoA/\nMmg2wXXFsXZS37LViFGCo4hQsFrAtogEtI9Z4oqcoPe0xSbwO3nOv+sfdA