se\n`oxlint-linter` 2.0.8.\n\nWith `oxlint-linter` 2.0.5, each component kept the full Oxlint output\nof the build, which includes the warnings of all the components in the\nbuild. Bit stored it two times in each Version. In this repository, one\nVersion can contain more than 700KB of lint output. With 2.0.8, each\ncomponent keeps only its own diagnostics and a short summary.\n\nEnvs: `core-aspect-env` 2.1.2, `node-babel-mocha` 2.1.2,\n`node-typescript-mocha` 2.1.2, `core-react-env` 1.0.2,\n`teambit.node/node` 4.1.2.\n\n\n`mdx-env` is not bumped: it uses ESLint, and adding its components to\nthis build made the CI `bit ci pr` run out of memory.","tree":{"sha":"85f90fdff87b3fcc6e3abc5fcd98ec68cfa6e18f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/85f90fdff87b3fcc6e3abc5fcd98ec68cfa6e18f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/c2b285558fea409ca035b9d24c7cc5c6bba15475","verification":{"payload":"tree 85f90fdff87b3fcc6e3abc5fcd98ec68cfa6e18f\nparent 02368fe526e2872e70ab468de8b9aea1c6b35397\nauthor David First <davidnet@gmail.com> 1791233755 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791233755 -0400\n\nchore(envs): update envs to pick up oxlint-linter 2.0.8 (#10766)\n\nUpdate the workspace envs to their latest versions. The new envs use\n`oxlint-linter` 2.0.8.\n\nWith `oxlint-linter` 2.0.5, each component kept the full Oxlint output\nof the build, which includes the warnings of all the components in the\nbuild. Bit stored it two times in each Version. In this repository, one\nVersion can contain more than 700KB of lint output. With 2.0.8, each\ncomponent keeps only its own diagnostics and a short summary.\n\nEnvs: `core-aspect-env` 2.1.2, `node-babel-mocha` 2.1.2,\n`node-typescript-mocha` 2.1.2, `core-react-env` 1.0.2,\n`teambit.node/node` 4.1.2.\n\n\n`mdx-env` is not bumped: it uses ESLint, and adding its components to\nthis build made the CI `bit ci pr` run out of memory.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----