g{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidfirst","id":1963573,"login":"davidfirst","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1NzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/fc9ea46ef605d147187392210811af9ca8783bb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T18:59:51Z","email":"davidnet@gmail.com","name":"David First"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T18:59:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(envs): stop importing service types in the legacy env interfaces (#10765)\n\nPhase 2, step 2. The legacy getter-style interfaces in\n`envs/environment.ts` (`CompilerEnv`, `BuilderEnv`, `LinterEnv`, ...)\nimported types from 13 service aspects, all of which depend on envs.\n\nThey are now deprecated and empty (they extend `Environment`, which\nalready allows any member), so existing envs that implement or import\nthem keep compiling. Each deprecation note points to the handler-style\nreplacement in the service aspect (e.g. `CompilerEnv` from\n`@teambit/compiler`). `getSchemaExtractor` is removed from `Environment`\nfor the same reason, and `GetNpmIgnoreContext` moves to `@teambit/pkg`.\n\nCycles baseline: 70 → 69 components, 401 → 384 edges.","tree":{"sha":"9cfaf10d5c9708ace9941bc3369835403ff24b7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/9cfaf10d5c9708ace9941bc3369835403ff24b7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/fc9ea46ef605d147187392210811af9ca8783bb4","verification":{"payload":"tree 9cfaf10d5c9708ace9941bc3369835403ff24b7a\nparent 31ce39c9c5f687bffd600928568a15601893ca15\nauthor David First <davidnet@gmail.com> 1791226791 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791226791 -0400\n\nrefactor(envs): stop importing service types in the legacy env interfaces (#10765)\n\nPhase 2, step 2. The legacy getter-style interfaces in\n`envs/environment.ts` (`CompilerEnv`, `BuilderEnv`, `LinterEnv`, ...)\nimported types from 13 service aspects, all of which depend on envs.\n\nThey are now deprecated and empty (they extend `Environment`, which\nalready allows any member), so existing envs that implement or import\nthem keep compiling. Each deprecation note points to the handler-style\nreplacement in the service aspect (e.g. `CompilerEnv` from\n`@teambit/compiler`). `getSchemaExtractor` is removed from `Environment`\nfor the same reason, and `GetNpmIgnoreContext` moves to `@teambit/pkg`.\n\nCycles baseline: 70 → 69 components, 401 → 384 edges.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw/OnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFkMQAHs5RSbqnLlyYtXvzGiDFuyL\nUQXRpep7vi3W3afv4mNmhAdyqE1wO1esPHBcoMRLG7VPIa4MhSwVDShEB79Zt2KU\nd4ErMTmnmKerVt68AJKYyC5ufy9DnnPTpg2RiWqAGGrohRprZVcX54lbErsnY+0A\n+0LeuG8VNAGlleEYT89E0lnVCbwFsJ6GC2fhDlaWeDeHsbGYqTK1buKnMH314nUt\nJw4FtSKT2nS/RxMa6+oiFiHNWpts4ma9CgpZHKGNrDIacISOfKxP7iK2DGQcGe/J\n3ekKiJTjYO6iqb/Qdx1ftAJhotQjMT2CeaiH+1d5QGBtc9oJrhOGRIUSNV81Mikb\nT/ZkvPGsQumWRzFdk4BJzgQLo0H8QfDvYo82/H22NUqzKkSvfvUGhDFDL2GRWAYh\n2nHA+pJqee53f4i1727l+XKlRc+S6Rt84csWFdaagtzV86HozG+RKtl0HPFhO6HR\n+/tlpZbVAUj0wm5owanc6pDLqtneH+uyZ5pELs6V6LfBrOTByUYaVTkRL8+z+Kio\nvEtAMcrSI6q2yJrg5iXPPAk+gtmcjP0VRGIa/1m7Xhgx0TbaQFUx/XaHBohR50fu\n6fjdzHmFl/N6FYo+pJ03zzMnClsm/KlA0FNrRy4F2C/uU1pxvNeRpXsqelqiy6fK\nIt8w/RnzdI+5AWeOk9CS\n=e6d+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T18:59:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercont