omment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:58:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: move misplaced types to break circular dependencies (#10764)\n\nPhase 2, step 1: move types used across aspects to the lower aspect, so\nthe lower one no longer imports from the one above it.\n\n- `RegularCompDescriptor` moves to the component model (envs re-exports\nit)\n- `EnvJsoncPatterns` moves to envs (dev-files re-exports it)\n- `WatchOptions` and `CheckTypes` move to workspace (watcher re-exports\nthem)\n- graphql and react-router import `SSR` from\n`@teambit/react.rendering.ssr` directly, instead of through ui\n- compiler reads `.compilers` without importing the `MultiCompiler` type\n\nCycles baseline: 70 → 67 components, 401 → 370 edges.","tree":{"sha":"257b1a8954c2ff16bb8038565c156362e773d8f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/257b1a8954c2ff16bb8038565c156362e773d8f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/d20c565a18d7104b5fddde620cbf87a733b79e14","verification":{"payload":"tree 257b1a8954c2ff16bb8038565c156362e773d8f8\nparent 85cd11a4569cc3445ebd99d060753cc184311241\nauthor David First <davidnet@gmail.com> 1791219522 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791219522 +0000\n\nrefactor: move misplaced types to break circular dependencies (#10764)\n\nPhase 2, step 1: move types used across aspects to the lower aspect, so\nthe lower one no longer imports from the one above it.\n\n- `RegularCompDescriptor` moves to the component model (envs re-exports\nit)\n- `EnvJsoncPatterns` moves to envs (dev-files re-exports it)\n- `WatchOptions` and `CheckTypes` move to workspace (watcher re-exports\nthem)\n- graphql and react-router import `SSR` from\n`@teambit/react.rendering.ssr` directly, instead of through ui\n- compiler reads `.compilers` without importing the `MultiCompiler` type\n\nCycles baseline: 70 → 67 components, 401 → 370 edges.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATUR