users/davidfirst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidfirst","id":1963573,"login":"davidfirst","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1NzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/d17509c2d61e14265076822d207e81cdc61d4e76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:46:22Z","email":"davidnet@gmail.com","name":"David First"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:46:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: move misplaced utilities to break circular dependencies (#10750)\n\nRemoves three import edges that close cycles:\n\n- `ui` → `webpack`: the rspack configs resolve `path-browserify` and\n`process/browser` directly instead of importing `fallbacks` from\n`@teambit/webpack`.\n- `preview` → `react`: preview ships its own copy of the 21-line mdx\npre-loader, the same way react already inlines it.\n- `new-component-helper` → `component-writer`:\n`incrementPathRecursively` moves to `@teambit/toolbox.path.path`, a leaf\nthat `new-component-helper` already imports; `@teambit/component-writer`\nstill re-exports it.\n\nCycles go from 76 components / 473 edges to 75 / 448 (`react` leaves the\nmain group); the baseline is lowered accordingly.\n\nAlso sets the env of `harmony/modules/runtimes` to `node-babel-mocha`,\nmatching the other `modules/*` components.","tree":{"sha":"5219435af2bece70430a86297d5c9a3dd9df7e4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/5219435af2bece70430a86297d5c9a3dd9df7e4e"},"url":"