er, install,\nimporter, forking, ui and git from there, and warns about deprecated\nstarters. That pulled all of them into `generator`, while `compiler` and\n`install` depend on `generator` (to register templates), closing cycles.\n\nThis moves `bit new` (`NewCmd`, `WorkspaceGenerator`,\n`generateWorkspaceTemplate`) as-is into a new core aspect,\n`teambit.generator/workspace-starter`, which depends on `generator`.\n`generator` keeps the templates and exposes `getBitApi()` for it, and no\nlonger depends on `deprecation`.\n\n`forking` and `refactoring` leave the cycle: 76 → 74 components, 473 →\n451 edges; the baseline is lowered. The CLI reference only changes in\ncommand order.\n\n`GeneratorMain.generateWorkspaceTemplate` is removed; nothing in this\nrepo called it besides `bit new`.","tree":{"sha":"5651d28fe8cf1226e07e633d98d6b63d28f3b8ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/5651d28fe8cf1226e07e633d98d6b63d28f3b8ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/520ccd4fd9820d22d2e0bada46687e126249849a","verification":{"payload":"tree 5651d28fe8cf1226e07e633d98d6b63d28f3b8ae\nparent 714a37b2e32707f1abc113376093a382971d2bf6\nauthor David First <davidnet@gmail.com> 1790977916 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790977916 +0000\n\nrefactor(generator): move bit new to a workspace-starter aspect (#10752)\n\n`bit new` reloads bit in the new workspace and drives compiler, install,\nimporter, forking, ui and git from there, and warns about deprecated\nstarters. That pulled all of them into `generator`, while `compiler` and\n`install` depend on `generator` (to register templates), closing cycles.\n\nThis moves `bit new` (`NewCmd`, `WorkspaceGenerator`,\n`generateWorkspaceTemplate`) as-is into a new core aspect,\n`teambit.generator/workspace-starter`, which depends on `generator`.\n`generator` keeps the templates and exposes `getBitApi()` for it, and no\nlonger depends on `deprecation`.\n\n`forking` and `refactoring` leave the cycle: 76 → 74 components, 473 →\n451 edges; the baseline is lowered. The CLI reference only changes in\ncommand order.\n\n`GeneratorMain.generateWorkspaceTemplate` is removed; nothing in this\nrepo called it besides `bit new`.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwCd8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPscQABBIkSM353gj87Cus9rPv/Ty\nbx0mSxKQpJ1dP4FYwjQ1DygIW6zxtzYU/IEzFM5DCLsPcLYlhrk3pf47fIvB8XPA\n/uYlTn/oYWm+Zb5mu/4b0GwNJoJQ01lkReHDg6hQ3wY8JBPLhh4eMa2HupVE5aFq\njFZ8woKlXywRL3ij/6bnRXMQHoLJsWtC0goJqVPqiPQDORyoXiV0HF62W3qTLdQL\nJYrlYKwa5+f5cF6B86H9vjkbN5jV/VwHTI1+PAQmhs+o87A5QkksJNH1htII9ORb\n1EH0IfitYPddl82YIDVt73+TmR8KtCqgep3Js17EAUFbHemSnxCjuH5AxzNYRVl+\nAta4JgaoFzHZKF7YxgK9krNqw9IeV+z4iQngax3sPjLZcB3XpU4gEv87Y4C4gJHX\nFoSKbBQy3pJAy96+pfeCIDqT9iT7GhP4J7hFfiu8Zh2amvQxB0rKBRQuP8zq+MHP\nxzOC4tOUUOPEuqvbY6hddg1BSKW9M9QQEF2yWVZuljewVRKT6/IGVXDBLyaanS4c\nrFFxSxJlvw1/kt4/wIJGt9H7T54xv5bqk8pFOeifNxmlEISI3i9ky9Meo6QGiKA0\n/x8qMJQu1CvC42yfN02fKsZ8wFciIX8F1Vt4CstZ4Y366oOvkUVUWmQShsSggc8w\nc9q0QDlmbsl1cPPZ3Iz4\n=ZH6C\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T21:51:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/520ccd4fd9820d22d2e0bada46687e126249849a","node_id":"C_kwDOBMB9P9oAKDUyMGNjZDRmZDk4MjBkMjJkMmUwYmFkYTQ2Njg3ZTEyNjI0OTg0OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/714a37b2e32707f1abc113376093a382971d2bf6","sha":"714a37b2e32707f1abc113376093a382971d2bf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/714a37b2e32707f1abc113376093a382971d2bf6"}],"sha":"520ccd4fd9820d22d2e0bada46687e126249849a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/520ccd4fd9820d22d2e0bada46687e126249849a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/714a37b2e32707f1abc113376093a382971d2bf6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:23:16Z","email":"bit-ci[bot]@bit.cloud","name":"Bit CI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:23:16Z","email":"bit-ci[bot]@bit.cloud","name":"Bit CI"},"message":"bump teambit version to 2.2.82 [skip ci]","tree":{"sha":"73d83b30058b0106d9ef952bb19c0cc49ffb681e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/73d83b30058b0106d9ef952bb19c0cc49ffb681e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/714a37b2e32707f1abc113376093a382971d2bf6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/714a37b2e32707f1abc113376093a382971d2bf6","node_id":"C_kwDOBMB9P9oAKDcxNGEzN2IyZTMyNzA3ZjFhYmMxMTMzNzYwOTNhMzgyOTcxZDJiZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/b529c962e08751fc1f675b05deaa1292cc184e0b","sha":"b529c962e08751fc1f675b05deaa1292cc184e0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/b529c962e08751fc1f675b05deaa1292cc184e0b"}],"sha":"714a37b2e32707f1abc113376093a382971d2bf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/714a37b2e32707f1abc113376093a382971d2bf6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963573?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidfirst","id":1963573,"login":"davidfirst","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1NzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/b529c962e08751fc1f675b05deaa1292cc184e0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:48:06Z","email":"davidnet@gmail.com","name":"David First"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:48:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(install): run the deps-cache invalidation check once and retry listing it on transient fs errors (#10756)\n\nFollow-up to #10746. With 2.2.73 (which includes #10746), `bit import`\non Windows can still fail with `EPERM: operation not permitted, scandir\n...\\.bit\\cache\\components\\deps\\index-v5\\..` thrown from `cacache.ls`.\n\nThe cause: components load in parallel and each one calls\n`ComponentLoader.invalidateDependenciesCacheIfNeeded()`. The\n`_shouldCheckForClearingDependenciesCache` flag was turned off only\nafter the awaits, so every concurrent loader ran the check. Some deleted\nthe deps cache while others were listing it. #10746 added retries to the\ndelete side only. On Windows, a `readdir` of a directory that is pending\ndeletion fails with EPERM, and the list side didn''t handle that. The\ndebug log shows two \"invalidating dependencies cache\" lines 3ms apart\nright before the failure.\n\nChanges:\n- `ComponentLoader`: the invalidation check runs once. The flag is\nturned off synchronously and concurrent callers await the same in-flight\npromise. If the check fails, the flag is reset so a later call retries.\n- `FsCache.listDependenciesDataCache`: retries EPERM/EBUSY/ENOTEMPTY\nwith the same linear backoff as `deleteAllDependenciesDataCache`,\nthrough a shared helper. This also covers deletions by another process\nor by `dependencies-loader`.\n\nTests: new unit specs for both. They fail on the old code (5 concurrent\nchecks instead of 1; EPERM not retried) and pass with the fix.","tree":{"sha":"5c93b508890a287f73ff127ca5b33bdd4b9acf08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/5c93b508890a287f73ff127ca5b33bdd4b9acf08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/b529c962e08751fc1f675b05deaa1292cc184e0b","verification":{"payload":"tree 5c93b508890a287f73ff127ca5b33bdd4b9acf08\nparent 45614a9344f07036dfba101000bcab6e95d01c33\nauthor David First <davidnet@gmail.com> 1790970486 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790970486 +0000\n\nfix(install): run the deps-cache invalidation check once and retry listing it on transient fs errors (#10756)\n\nFollow-up to #10746. With 2.2.73 (which includes #10746), `bit import`\non Windows can still fail with `EPERM: operation not permitted, scandir\n...\\.bit\\cache\\components\\deps\\index-v5\\..` thrown from `cacache.ls`.\n\nThe cause: components load in parallel and each one calls\n`ComponentLoader.invalidateDependenciesCacheIfNeeded()`. The\n`_shouldCheckForClearingDependenciesCache` flag was turned off only\nafter the awaits, so every concurrent loader ran the check. Some deleted\nthe deps cache while others were listing it. #10746 added retries to the\ndelete side only. On Windows, a `readdir` of a directory that is pending\ndeletion fails with EPERM, and the list side didn''t handle that. The\ndebug log shows two \"invalidating dependencies cache\" lines 3ms apart\nright before the failure.\n\nChanges:\n- `ComponentLoader`: the invalidation check runs once. The flag is\nturned off synchronously and concurrent callers await the same in-flight\npromise. If the check fails, the flag is reset so a later call retries.\n- `FsCache.listDependenciesDataCache`: retries EPERM/EBUSY/ENOTEMPTY\nwith the same linear backoff as `deleteAllDependenciesDataCache`,\nthrough a shared helper. This also covers deletions by another process\nor by `dependencies-loader`.\n\nTests: new unit specs for both. They fail on the old code (5 concurrent\nchecks instead of 1; EPERM not retried) and pass with the fix.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwAp2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACH8QAHJ5oDOH8cL/cJGxgjpTahVx\nmT03BncUpWB8Wf1o+3rWBYwA4hG1itQDtaiqFmNb0nqUrxiRd7dAgy2PdH40PkVS\nhY1o1bzgDxoY/D5wFpbO1IJb4+KG+FnVJMMzVWg/duK++uGtSsS+/DM0ALrvdAAT\n4/cYG//yj8ioYmaoyBn0dtMtTHK9ZLzr6qpQK1TzzIcKV32Fx9Hnn1y0oLxqP2fY\nr0P+cBxKV3nMVM6DXu9TFeovpLln/LwcPqgmJwpjrKKAcMIYrFxqJtjOZBEVIvMS\njWm8+dWlmCK+vmB9oTJJCgUse98Q8Jl258Wc87GGCXMFZjzpFmPtXpVsMyY0uWzc\nHIEQKDyCNyxQG2VB8kIwP8fg7oey43cn67mbrtY+ElF9lr3pgBWztq6mr/pV/7l9\nPznkMc0rUu2Y6c2qOa4RE5V7b/FW4JXsceI4aKJDNIIKEIDTQDRiBSNuFSdNc+jW\nJgus5Gpmqh88pUVLlr84+XcH41aGmwrqBjneevg2qEl6/Y1gq/fTOJxSJF9FNEM5\nuhNjHSbyww2yKWU7r89lPVUGkT/R/pvh9FpiVgFMEyju0Mo69odeThs1xa2TmXxn\nBww/g8jVvw1tqQgjd3DeyoYJMmkKagcKPqQb8bPH/qx0FgiTRHFIPGCCw6KPM5k/\nhPF/YbZ4vGMMDq7NkZT2\n=XxlP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T19:48:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/b529c962e08751fc1f675b05deaa1292cc184e0b","node_id":"C_kwDOBMB9P9oAKGI1MjljOTYyZTA4NzUxZmMxZjY3NWIwNWRlYWExMjkyY2MxODRlMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/45614a9344f07036dfba101000bcab6e95d01c33","sha":"45614a9344f07036dfba101000bcab6e95d01c33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/45614a9344f07036dfba101000bcab6e95d01c33"}],"sha":"b529c962e08751fc1f675b05deaa1292cc184e0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/b529c962e08751fc1f675b05deaa1292cc184e0b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/45614a9344f07036dfba101000bcab6e95d01c33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:17:22Z","email":"bit-ci[bot]@bit.cloud","name":"Bit CI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:17:22Z","email":"bit-ci[bot]@bit.cloud","name":"Bit CI"},"message":"bump teambit version to 2.2.81 [skip ci]","tree":{"sha":"bdaf07f8a258e8c453934ce632127f1941dfc061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/bdaf07f8a258e8c453934ce632127f1941dfc061"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/45614a9344f07036dfba101000bcab6e95d01c33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/45614a9344f07036dfba101000bcab6e95d01c33","node_id":"C_kwDOBMB9P9oAKDQ1NjE0YTkzNDRmMDcwMzZkZmJhMTAxMDAwYmNhYjZlOTVkMDFjMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/4e9267fe52977650d9561b169804d1868c9166da","sha":"4e9267fe52977650d9561b169804d1868c9166da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/4e9267fe52977650d9561b169804d1868c9166da"}],"sha":"45614a9344f07036dfba101000bcab6e95d01c33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/45614a9344f07036dfba101000bcab6e95d01c33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963573?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidfirst","id":1963573,"login":"davidfirst","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1NzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/4e9267fe52977650d9561b169804d1868c9166da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:41:02Z","email":"davidnet@gmail.com","name":"David First"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:41:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(export): speed up export of components with many objects (#10745)\n\nExport of a component with many objects is slow. We measured the export\nof one component with 12,000 objects:\n\n| | old | new |\n|---|---|---|\n| macOS client, HTTP remote (`bit start`) on macOS | 75s | 15s |\n| macOS client, file:// remote | 76s | 13.5s |\n| macOS client, HTTP remote on a Linux server (Docker, ext4) | 50s | 9s\n|\n\n- The duplicate-file check in the version validator was quadratic. Now\nit is linear. Before, it used 14 seconds of CPU time.\n- The client sends the objects from the filesystem as they are. It does\nnot decompress and compress them again.\n- After export, the client writes only the changed ModelComponents.\nBefore, it wrote all the objects of the version again.\n- The remote writes the Source objects with the received buffer, when\ntheir content agrees with their hash. It does not compress them again.\n- Object files are written with fewer fs calls. The write stays atomic,\nkeeps the mode and owner of an existing file, and ignores the same chown\nerrors as `write-file-atomic`. The group-id is resolved one time for\neach batch, not one time for each object.\n- `ObjectList.addIfNotExist` and `splitByScopeName` are linear now.\n- `ObjectList.fromTar` rejects when the stream fails (for example, a\ntruncated upload). Before, it could hang.\n- On macOS, the bin sets `UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE=16` when it is not set.\nWith 4 threads (the default), the fs calls are almost serial.\n\nThread pool: the bin changes `UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE` only on macOS, and\nonly when it is not set. To use a different value, set the variable (for\nexample, `UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE=4` gives the old behavior). The thread pool\nlimits how many fs calls run at the same time. It does not add work, and\nthe JS code still limits the open files to 100 (`concurrentIOLimit`). In\na test that writes 12,000 small files (tmp file + rename), 16 threads\nare faster on macOS (14.3s → 1.9s) and slower on Linux ext4 (0.6s →\n1.1s), because file creates and renames in the same directory wait for\nthe directory lock. On Windows, before libuv 1.52, a value set from JS\nhas no effect.\n\nThe formats on disk and on the wire do not change. Old and new clients\nand remotes work together.","tree":{"sha":"dfa9565cbcb2cc3546dde6d43784d6e031288071","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/dfa9565cbcb2cc3546dde6d43784d6e031288071"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/4e9267fe52977650d9561b169804d1868c9166da","verification":{"payload":"tree dfa9565cbcb2cc3546dde6d43784d6e031288071\nparent 4d1a750a1156f6c85039c584236012735f1d8f3a\nauthor David First <davidnet@gmail.com> 1790966462 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790966462 +0000\n\nperf(export): speed up export of components with many objects (#10745)\n\nExport of a component with many objects is slow. We measured the export\nof one component with 12,000 objects:\n\n| | old | new |\n|---|---|---|\n| macOS client, HTTP remote (`bit start`) on macOS | 75s | 15s |\n| macOS client, file:// remote | 76s | 13.5s |\n| macOS client, HTTP remote on a Linux server (Docker, ext4) | 50s | 9s\n|\n\n- The duplicate-file check in the version validator was quadratic. Now\nit is linear. Before, it used 14 seconds of CPU time.\n- The client sends the objects from the filesystem as they are. It does\nnot decompress and compress them again.\n- After export, the client writes only the changed ModelComponents.\nBefore, it wrote all the objects of the version again.\n- The remote writes the Source objects with the received buffer, when\ntheir content agrees with their hash. It does not compress them again.\n- Object files are written with fewer fs calls. The write stays atomic,\nkeeps the mode and owner of an existing file, and ignores the same chown\nerrors as `write-file-atomic`. The group-id is resolved one time for\neach batch, not one time for each object.\n- `ObjectList.addIfNotExist` and `splitByScopeName` are linear now.\n- `ObjectList.fromTar` rejects when the stream fails (for example, a\ntruncated upload). Before, it could hang.\n- On macOS, the bin sets `UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE=16` when it is not set.\nWith 4 threads (the default), the fs calls are almost serial.\n\nThread pool: the bin changes `UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE` only on macOS, and\nonly when it is not set. To use a different value, set the variable (for\nexample, `UV_THREADPOOL_SIZE=4` gives the old behavior). The thread pool\nlimits how many fs calls run at the same time. It does not add work, and\nthe JS code still limits the open files to 100 (`concurrentIOLimit`). In\na test that writes 12,000 small files (tmp file + rename), 16 threads\nare faster on macOS (14.3s → 1.9s) and slower on Linux ext4 (0.6s →\n1.1s), because file creates and renames in the same directory wait for\nthe directory lock. On Windows, before libuv 1.52, a value set from JS\nhas no effect.\n\nThe formats on disk and on the wire do not change. Old and new clients\nand remotes work together.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv/q+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAskUQAFfmZ01griANfLwJ/fjmP7nZ\nE2v1sCEDd9FpEfg1Mq2+AF+Knw93LRaLNV7cr7TsKDxSvyZU10NcAOl7Rnm7kwHL\nyZsgHNpNtl8gMHeFe5J4xgGKrHyZjRkVtV60/OJZfNhKCNeT7w56Wqo+u5y+yswl\nx6TlkKadjSo1mjl//5xWT0s78ZTcfR2QRNgc1b02nNoIgYmgbdqQIsLrX6STHzUm\nmFyOVzx7R94b+YKCzRhWOHyU8ZQ9CaDk2GfCIwDVSzXp0Dh+AJe5AerGe34Stohx\nkz6WgRUda4d08yfjoMO/8ihJSDoQtWuZZVwwqqH058Wxu62gImLqOW/AbvghXEim\nuGIUQm37mzTITCXkVpczVv5kOv5tlf+O6Wm5CUo9aEDe60Q2TbqnpREA4flgcYJb\nrMU1Du6Kd2XnvHL5tdephJCcz5e0bTjA2IoVwtThx37YibA6jNw7369WPHPnYq92\n95Pf3ggxtP8j+X2N97IdVXLJ0RwVf2LuV9VXNkjpcMj9Dh267aRwQkeagL1vvk1u\ny6bx/Gg/vEAoFBZ3WZckdvferJQM49/+YEyw7UK8DV/SN2MnkEfNtEJbSPuhcya5\n8+54PFPLnOZfyfk5joY2QaxsYWENkvJ+0kP+k2VRrYbx0LeRzCd3aRPoqtv3AV5F\n4EaGYcXNYPkk5CZtMXjj\n=rv/R\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T18:41:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/4e9267fe52977650d9561b169804d1868c9166da","node_id":"C_kwDOBMB9P9oAKDRlOTI2N2ZlNTI5Nzc2NTBkOTU2MWIxNjk4MDRkMTg2OGM5MTY2ZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/4d1a750a1156f6c85039c584236012735f1d8f3a","sha":"4d1a750a1156f6c85039c584236012735f1d8f3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/4d1a750a1156f6c85039c584236012735f1d8f3a"}],"sha":"4e9267fe52977650d9561b169804d1868c9166da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/4e9267fe52977650d9561b169804d1868c9166da"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/4d1a750a1156f6c85039c584236012735f1d8f3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:08:53Z","email":"bit-ci[bot]@bit.cloud","name":"Bit CI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:08:53Z","email":"bit-ci[bot]@bit.cloud","name":"Bit CI"},"message":"bump teambit version to 2.2.80 [skip ci]","tree":{"sha":"0dca970eac46a729351a8b70c489682af218301b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/0dca970eac46a729351a8b70c489682af218301b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/4d1a750a1156f6c85039c584236012735f1d8f3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/4d1a750a1156f6c85039c584236012735f1d8f3a","node_id":"C_kwDOBMB9P9oAKDRkMWE3NTBhMTE1NmY2Yzg1MDM5YzU4NDIzNjAxMjczNWYxZDhmM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/b9e803826f854bc3d05fcd5dbceadeb328dae169","sha":"b9e803826f854bc3d05fcd5dbceadeb328dae169","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/b9e803826f854bc3d05fcd5dbceadeb328dae169"}],"sha":"4d1a750a1156f6c85039c584236012735f1d8f3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/4d1a750a1156f6c85039c584236012735f1d8f3a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963573?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidfirst","id":1963573,"login":"davidfirst","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1NzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/b9e803826f854bc3d05fcd5dbceadeb328dae169/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:32:45Z","email":"davidnet@gmail.com","name":"David First"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:32:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: cut the objects→graph and component→deprecation edges (#10755)\n\nLowers the circular-deps baseline from 76 to 74 components (473 → 454\nedges); `host-initializer` and `objects` leave the cycle.\n\n- `objects` used `@teambit/graph`''s `Dependency` class only as edge data\nof `IdGraph`. It''s now a plain string type.\n- `DeprecationInfo` is part of the component model, so it moves to\n`@teambit/component`. `@teambit/deprecation` still re-exports it.","tree":{"sha":"9f5d04201aa76d0a1edb0de2f9641eecdf344945","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/9f5d04201aa76d0a1edb0de2f9641eecdf344945"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/b9e803826f854bc3d05fcd5dbceadeb328dae169","verification":{"payload":"tree 9f5d04201aa76d0a1edb0de2f9641eecdf344945\nparent 46b45c114f5b04ef3382009a1ad39d808234fdb5\nauthor David First <davidnet@gmail.com> 1790962365 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790962365 +0000\n\nrefactor: cut the objects→graph and component→deprecation edges (#10755)\n\nLowers the circular-deps baseline from 76 to 74 components (473 → 454\nedges); `host-initializer` and `objects` leave the cycle.\n\n- `objects` used `@teambit/graph`''s `Dependency` class only as edge data\nof `IdGraph`. It''s now a plain string type.\n- `DeprecationInfo` is part of the component model, so it moves to\n`@teambit/component`. `@teambit/deprecation` still re-exports it.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv+q9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAv8kQAEzuSBDrOcn0MS2DmbrQk9oT\nnmOPouscG+TlTA26iatUpk+4vDCYBvd1T0/ntavkwZ7CWHWCR5jJjDBgHXJ73UHJ\ng8DGoX/WQMUUba4TlybsWStFMzCvjzM30azIsIUkIO8wXqD49dJBVgrz50BjlnBR\n7V2baqpECUqlj/PLJT2ngHzyzV6JhE4tWlUubCvzE3j8YnthuEkyq1CR1LeEQSXo\nKbFeuLUE7bbjsZeJsz5s1JyzUxaHCXT0Nolf3PTeo0Tg0751Q2iJX9YlCdXWeuWv\nET46td+wxK3lu0P0egvdBTxmkB9IEcQXMPVMcJmXmDd/XJrazRCVWIFnCfwa+SRs\nSUA8KKYwLtaVZArRtllB1onlrO4dwJGXJSjIzpMW6CrLxdNPcD7aarTKm172nA4N\nEPVmylcdiB