","email":"bit-ci[bot]@bit.cloud","name":"Bit CI"},"message":"bump teambit version to 2.2.74 [skip ci]","tree":{"sha":"4a337d09ceb119b1a8e24a492a6b5ba478e321aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/4a337d09ceb119b1a8e24a492a6b5ba478e321aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/3de5ffe96282c95cc3b4d1a861e3ff90bcaa9447","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/3de5ffe96282c95cc3b4d1a861e3ff90bcaa9447","node_id":"C_kwDOBMB9P9oAKDNkZTVmZmU5NjI4MmM5NWNjM2I0ZDFhODYxZTNmZjkwYmNhYTk0NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/8fa7a16025eabc77857ee8362ff1d425bcbe62b8","sha":"8fa7a16025eabc77857ee8362ff1d425bcbe62b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/8fa7a16025eabc77857ee8362ff1d425bcbe62b8"}],"sha":"3de5ffe96282c95cc3b4d1a861e3ff90bcaa9447","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/3de5ffe96282c95cc3b4d1a861e3ff90bcaa9447"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963573?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidfirst","id":1963573,"login":"davidfirst","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1NzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/8fa7a16025eabc77857ee8362ff1d425bcbe62b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:57:20Z","email":"davidnet@gmail.com","name":"David First"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:57:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(workspace): stop the status line from flickering on single component loads (#10749)\n\nSince #10660, a single `workspace.get()` that is not in the cache goes\nthrough `getMany`. `getMany` sets the status line when it starts and\nclears it when it ends. Commands that load components one at a time (for\nexample `bit lane merge main --no-snap -x`) restart and clear the\nspinner for each component. The \"loading 1 component(s)\" line disappears\nand comes back.\n\nThis change makes `getMany` skip the status line when it runs on behalf\nof a single `get`. A single `get` did not show a status line before\n#10660.","tree":{"sha":"9745d6e7e7e463fd8a527af10deffbae9305b057","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/9745d6e7e7e463fd8a527af10deffbae9305b057"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/8fa7a16025eabc77857ee8362ff1d425bcbe62b8","verification":{"payload":"tree 9745d6e7e7e463fd8a527af10deffbae9305b057\nparent b2d45654440263df82dbfe37440a7b01f4b4186b\nauthor David First <davidnet@gmail.com> 1790863040 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790863040 +0000\n\nfix(workspace): stop the status line from flickering on single component loads (#10749)\n\nSince #10660, a single `workspace.get()` that is not in the cache goes\nthrough `getMany`. `getMany` sets the status line when it starts and\nclears it when it ends. Commands that load components one at a time (for\nexample `bit lane merge main --no-snap -x`) restart and clear the\nspinner for each component. The \"loading 1 component(s)\" line disappears\nand comes back.\n\nThis change makes `getMany` skip the status line 