hub.com/users/davidfirst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/c031a610d4ac4bcea186e040042f8ac4b6d60472/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:17:41Z","email":"davidnet@gmail.com","name":"David First"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:17:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: move the merge-lane spec to merge-lanes to break the lanes cycle (#10744)\n\nStacked on #10743.\n\n`lanes.spec.ts` loaded `MergeLanesAspect` for a single scenario (merge a\nlane on another workspace, then switch to main), and that was the only\nthing forming the `lanes ↔ merge-lanes` cycle. The scenario now lives in\n`merge-lanes.spec.ts`, since merge-lanes already depends on lanes.\nCycles: 78 → 76 components, down to 2 groups.","tree":{"sha":"0dcaee19df23111e1d9363648323847296261168","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/0dcaee19df23111e1d9363648323847296261168"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/c031a610d4ac4bcea186e040042f8ac4b6d60472","verification":{"payload":"tree 0dcaee19df23111e1d9363648323847296261168\nparent 5c5bd4804b89f3fb0bb41f7587716b3737fea08b\nauthor David First <davidnet@gmail.com> 1790792261 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790792261 +0000\n\ntest: move the merge-lane spec to merge-lanes to break the lanes cycle (#10744)\n\nStacked on #10743.\n\n`lanes.spec.ts` loaded `MergeLanesAspect` for a single scenario (merge a\nlane on another workspace, then switch to main), and that was the only\nthing forming the `lanes ↔ merge-lanes` cycle. The scenario now lives in\n`merge-lanes.spec.ts`, since merge-lanes already depends on lanes.\nCycles: 78 → 76 components, down to 2 groups.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABC