ation":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/a1ba26ed0d3d47047a410636212b328c5875654f","node_id":"C_kwDOBMB9P9oAKGExYmEyNmVkMGQzZDQ3MDQ3YTQxMDYzNjIxMmIzMjhjNTg3NTY1NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/28fd32a068a3ceb757170044108a63ac2be4f3b0","sha":"28fd32a068a3ceb757170044108a63ac2be4f3b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/28fd32a068a3ceb757170044108a63ac2be4f3b0"}],"sha":"a1ba26ed0d3d47047a410636212b328c5875654f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/a1ba26ed0d3d47047a410636212b328c5875654f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963573?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidfirst","id":1963573,"login":"davidfirst","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1NzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/28fd32a068a3ceb757170044108a63ac2be4f3b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:23:31Z","email":"davidnet@gmail.com","name":"David First"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:23:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(scope): fetch a missing Version object on load instead of failing until a manual import (#10707)\n\nA fetch that completes while the remote is mid-export (e.g. a CI run\nloading an env while another `bit ci merge` is exporting) can persist\nthe component object with its new head but no Version object for it.\nFrom then on, every load of that component failed with `version \"x\" ...\nwas not found on the filesystem` until `bit import <id> --objects` was\nrun by hand: the loader read the Version object straight from the local\nscope and never asked the remote for it.\n\n- The scope component loader now detects the missing Version object of\nan exported component, imports it once per process (with the current\nlane, so a lane snap is fetched from the lane''s scope) and retries. If\nthe remote still lacks it, the original error is thrown.\n- `bit envs` no longer loads core envs from the scope only to check\nwhether they are deleted; a core env cannot be deleted, and the lookup\nfetched it from the remote for nothing.\n\nTests: e2e in `local-head-not-found.e2e.ts` reproduce both (deleting the\nhead Version object of an objects-only component, and `bit envs` on a\ncore env); all fail without the fix.","tree":{"sha":"6278c7610d12aeed20ba87b8f8bf7938c012f959","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/6278c7610d12aeed20ba87b8f8bf7938c012f959"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/28fd32a068a3ceb757170044108a63ac2be4f3b0","verification":{"payload":"tree 6278c7610d12aeed20ba87b8f8bf7938c012f959\nparent 5f874253471526211830797f3f15d82b80a3089d\nauthor David First <davidnet@gmail.com> 1789496611 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789496611 +0000\n\nfix(scope): fetch a missing Version object on load instead of failing until a manual import (#10707)\n\nA fetch that completes while the remote is mid-export (e.g. a CI run\nloading an env while another `bit ci merge` is exporting) can persist\nthe component object with its new head but no Version object for it.\nFrom then on, every load of that component failed with `version \"x\" ...\nwas not found on the filesystem` until `bit import <id> --objects` was\nrun by hand: the loader read the Version object straight from the local\nscope and never asked the remote for it.\n\n- The scope component loader now detects the missing Version object of\nan exported component, imports it once per process (with the current\nlane, so a lane snap is fetched from the lane''s scope) and retries. If\nthe remote still lacks it, the original error is thrown.\n- `bit envs` no longer loads core envs from the scope only to check\nwhether they are deleted; a core env cannot be deleted, and the lookup\nfetched it from the remote for nothing.\n\nTests: e2e in `local-head-not-found.e2e.ts` reproduce both (deleting the\nhead Version object of an objects-only component, and `bit envs` on a\ncore env); all fail without the fix.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqY0jCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAT9IQAJMpHFuswR36km/q1gsLvYr0\nmP1qvrj/yAj6n/LyeBYetjT6w2xndxPerHEc8EThMjmwORoYiZkJYG7sbZSdpQoP\nFtqRZN8vwrDOoQgpr9GSQn884tx2F/RWRH1WgLIj1W0NUC+SaArT8mIicIMMFIWH\nUJeOf5ENM6BOKxnvm33qtIZjwQe5IL8PkYqGrKXf2WocMzw/Dm/xVwRTMX3pI9zv\nyCTkGTMq3kda+ycAC8SJRKCrXkeXQ1wmt1Yc/qO3M7MDAQfJtJIACHz+oi4gmCai\nnHwp0Czpf3BKgCYD/AmoNO6OJYhljuFSxEVtOx2BMY04NiGw7qX9oBogxK1RTR0l\nzI+Tn11nvpscenNSHaaXsBASxLc4hhQGVpfN33gHX+ilyjKTBxcVhSRRO7SoyPdh\n2R3XIZjRru+NFmZsgIKG/1a/kMRQHFbT2BTgkr5lOIEQ588TSnzf2V62abgmikaq\nyc7CT+hH62b+0XNwjPkIvPoHuPaRamCkEDO949/eX/C+YiqTEr4fP8Bl64JfBVEq\na4X0nf2Nzn4XioIH9/XdMSfNp0MaW8xNUSizGCmNXlQjR6oA6DcZGkCA8NXv8XL6\nnLmXceuLckd8aLC4fM8M1BXHuj3wQKUd2rAS9skJ1Vn/JFrrNKN2qtOk4yTkTbOc\n4Tv9N26LropHummvoe1L\n=d0j1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-15T18:23:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"