"5f874253471526211830797f3f15d82b80a3089d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/5f874253471526211830797f3f15d82b80a3089d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/b584082d0629f998bd0c3793bc484df71b0d7299/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T21:30:04Z","email":"bit-ci[bot]@bit.cloud","name":"Bit CI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T21:30:04Z","email":"bit-ci[bot]@bit.cloud","name":"Bit CI"},"message":"bump teambit version to 2.2.49 [skip ci]","tree":{"sha":"6aae594139642d5da69979cfedb6492f6d56f73b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/6aae594139642d5da69979cfedb6492f6d56f73b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/b584082d0629f998bd0c3793bc484df71b0d7299","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/b584082d0629f998bd0c3793bc484df71b0d7299","node_id":"C_kwDOBMB9P9oAKGI1ODQwODJkMDYyOWY5OThiZDBjMzc5M2JjNDg0ZGY3MWIwZDcyOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/ce8ede268366e7e9f25139900a4f1e46a13cefda","sha":"ce8ede268366e7e9f25139900a4f1e46a13cefda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/ce8ede268366e7e9f25139900a4f1e46a13cefda"}],"sha":"b584082d0629f998bd0c3793bc484df71b0d7299","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/b584082d0629f998bd0c3793bc484df71b0d7299"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963573?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidfirst","id":1963573,"login":"davidfirst","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1NzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/ce8ede268366e7e9f25139900a4f1e46a13cefda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T20:52:35Z","email":"davidnet@gmail.com","name":"David First"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T20:52:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(component-issues): strip ANSI codes from the json output of issues (#10706)\n\n## Problem\n\nThe VS Code extension shows component issues with raw ANSI escape codes\nin the text, e.g. the yellow color codes around the file path inside an\n`untracked file dependencies` diagnostic.\n\n## Cause\n\n`dataToString()` of the issues colors parts of the output for the CLI.\n`UntrackedDependencies` colors existing files yellow and `RenderCycles`\ncolors the whole graph. `toObjectIncludeDataAsString()` puts that same\nstring into the json output of `bit status` and `bit mini-status`, which\nthe extension reads. Chalk colors are process-global, and `bit server`\nruns inside a pseudo-terminal and enables them for terminal commands, so\nthe json output gets colored as well.\n\n## Solution\n\nStrip the ANSI codes in `toObjectIncludeDataAsString()` and in its\nGraphQL sibling `toObjectWithDataAsString()`. The CLI output is\nunchanged.\n\nWith #10705 this covers both problems reported in the issue.\n\nCloses #10697","tree":{"sha":"2cb8e74c0ddf497912da674ffea1180a6b6bac9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/2cb8e74c0ddf497912da674ffea1180a6b6bac9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/ce8ede268366e7e9f25139900a4f1e46a13cefda","verification":{"payload":"tree 2cb8e74c0ddf497912da674ffea1180a6b6bac9e\nparent 50bcd872f7b7e14dd30d3eff3787b5421a134e29\nauthor David First <davidnet@gmail.com> 1789419155 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789419155 +0000\n\nfix(component-issues): strip ANSI codes from the json output of issues (#10706)\n\n## Problem\n\nThe VS Code extension shows component issues with raw ANSI escape codes\nin the text, e.g. the yellow color codes around the file path inside an\n`untracked file dependencies` diagnostic.\n\n## Cause\n\n`dataToString()` of the issues colors parts of the output for the CLI.\n`UntrackedDependencies` colors existing files yellow and `RenderCycles`\ncolors the whole graph. `toObjectIncludeDataAsString()` puts that same\nstring into the json output of `bit status` and `bit mini-status`, which\nthe extension reads. Chalk colors are process-global, and `bit server`\nruns inside a pseudo-terminal and enables them for terminal commands, so\nthe json output gets colored as well.\n\n## Solution\n\nStrip the ANSI codes in `toObjectIncludeDataAsString()` and in its\nGraphQL sibling `toObjectWithDataAsString()`. The CLI output is\nunchanged.\n\nWith #10705 this covers both problems reported in the issue.\n\nCloses #10697","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqF6TCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6toQADn/t1S6MhH1HUA+Y5SNcNoi\n39iaVYsbbwmaFH4WIwvuqLuUbPlSz3Asbbg+wgnSNNz6zi2MOrA8JE/lorw0XlvS\nKHWit6LbluFcWMZGnNGL3rp4H7Ea7ktVJH/9rW97Ab+S0hiTwXVhKJDRdTWhqrjk\n9jVBswEY1kBZP2uW1JrUsF3bYVLkBzEa9w2EqzM72ubLYVrach2tvIGZSCwSPDJZ\nbYtLoNoCRTr1BM3lTnC+XtEkI9m8QTBaljd1F1xYnCBJWDrf+4r0gFeIzXKU8Z3T\nEgXOuWGqP6BmcSOKb+OpvU8PgSfV8uTNpcw+Laae/oz5sp02+97XBAuAyeYbppBi\nrhzJKUWlC1oLKoPMoGtoR/3OGI2LF/1aV8Z78+JghU/Uv953QZwa0UskbfKvV2VT\n4OyqTpdeoZRexFAZ/vKcs2UFr77DJPoiw1OHsVtmaNHxpp0NxjbMXy2oYnnOJQ03\nMyHtb8YVZkXDh4vjZIbc1AabJ49ebmrahhoKUOtEBdIE5wjXeriJB6kNE+5HP6rO\nIjAG6Ao+eFFn