":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T19:46:48Z","email":"bit-ci[bot]@bit.cloud","name":"Bit CI"},"message":"bump teambit version to 2.2.48 [skip ci]","tree":{"sha":"f23904bc1769a50817f250376d5b358dcc0b8257","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/f23904bc1769a50817f250376d5b358dcc0b8257"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/50bcd872f7b7e14dd30d3eff3787b5421a134e29","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/50bcd872f7b7e14dd30d3eff3787b5421a134e29","node_id":"C_kwDOBMB9P9oAKDUwYmNkODcyZjdiN2UxNGRkMzBkM2VmZjM3ODdiNTQyMWExMzRlMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/e9bd467419aed8293c0d7c3ae132f5042b6fa5ba","sha":"e9bd467419aed8293c0d7c3ae132f5042b6fa5ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/e9bd467419aed8293c0d7c3ae132f5042b6fa5ba"}],"sha":"50bcd872f7b7e14dd30d3eff3787b5421a134e29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/50bcd872f7b7e14dd30d3eff3787b5421a134e29"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963573?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidfirst","id":1963573,"login":"davidfirst","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1NzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfirst","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/e9bd467419aed8293c0d7c3ae132f5042b6fa5ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T19:09:19Z","email":"davidnet@gmail.com","name":"David First"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T19:09:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(watcher): avoid false untracked-dependencies issue for a new file (#10705)\n\n## Problem\n\nA long-lived `bit server` reports a false `untracked file dependencies`\nissue after a new file is added to a tracked component and imported from\nit. The issue stays until the workspace is reloaded.\n\n## Cause\n\n`BitMap.paths`, the file-to-component index the dependency resolver\nreads, is built once and only invalidated on `.bitmap` changes. Loading\na component re-scans its `rootDir` into `componentMap.files` but never\nreconciles that index. A file added inside an existing `rootDir` does\nnot touch `.bitmap`, so the resolver keeps reading the stale index,\nreports the new file as untracked, and the result is cached with the\ncomponent.\n\n## Solution\n\n`BitMap` now owns the re-scan. `trackDirectoryChanges(componentMap)`\nrefreshes the files and patches the paths index with the added and\nremoved files. The component load path calls it before dependencies are\nresolved, so every `workspace.get` self-heals rather than only the\nwatcher, and the watcher no longer patches the index itself. Patching is\nskipped while the index has not been built yet, so it is still built in\nfull from the fresh file list on the next lookup.\n\n## Tests\n\nUnit tests for `trackDirectoryChanges` cover an added file, a removed\nfile, and an index that was not built yet.\n\nPart of #10697","tree":{"sha":"ef2a4fa744fc5a0db838073e13801f747ff8a424","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/trees/ef2a4fa744fc5a0db838073e13801f747ff8a424"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/git/commits/e9bd467419aed8293c0d7c3ae132f5042b6fa5ba","verification":{"payload":"tree ef2a4fa744fc5a0db838073e13801f747ff8a424\nparent d08a638041b9d4981f35e0d9f16dd675c302e7de\nauthor David First <davidnet@gmail.com> 1789412959 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789412959 +0000\n\nfix(watcher): avoid false untracked-dependencies issue for a new file (#10705)\n\n## Problem\n\nA long-lived `bit server` reports a false `untracked file dependencies`\nissue after a new file is added to a tracked component and imported from\nit. The issue stays until the workspace is reloaded.\n\n## Cause\n\n`BitMap.paths`, the file-to-component index the dependency resolver\nreads, is built once and only invalidated on `.bitmap` changes. Loading\na component re-scans its `rootDir` into `componentMap.files` but never\nreconciles that index. A file added inside an existing `rootDir` does\nnot touch `.bitmap`, so the resolver keeps reading the stale index,\nreports the new file as untracked, and the result is cached with the\ncomponent.\n\n## Solution\n\n`BitMap` now owns the re-scan. `trackDirectoryChanges(componentMap)`\nrefreshes the files and patches the paths index with the added and\nremoved files. The component load path calls it before dependencies are\nresolved, so every `workspace.get` self-heals rather than only the\nwatcher, and the watcher no longer patches the index itself. Patching is\nskipped while the index has not been built yet, so it is still built in\nfull from the fresh file list on the next lookup.\n\n## Tests\n\nUnit tests for `trackDirectoryChanges` cover an added file, a removed\nfile, and an index that was not built yet.\n\nPart of #10697","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqEZfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyjkQAB7BdYKtQiVSeqxMD3eZx1bb\njbipdnoB6Tc0ymHqoN1seMm0X8Y0XM7F14bPGzDhy39MuaONB+wJYwMTEqlFdXIZ\nHn2WaE5oy9IsSSKF7P8ZawVJqZJuxpM/pgkwWR129fvzqAzCWqaax7UBzDeU09qr\nI/k8kGTo1SnVBUo9tc8O1xRrsEmQrCwy96UTgZWMP+F1Kd2iPggOAdWgLk47SJu9\nHJCizjbG02QvA0N3c61+WUm16NF71B5YeeTNZxihS4gaAKTLgJPBsomdSW1+z2NZ\nnlbAbT2nYpw0UYfK0u3uHSaAMCjf+leyzDvKBl99EAYbRX5XTVAMlKf7KR8XTv4y\nOFztBoEGDrlkaS45A2d0qm9l16OxExdohbLQF4rwNxB9zzM9TEoxMet8DaAY+Udl\nCOXxIbhCqLC58G459ymmzb9QHtbx2M9Re+Q6FiMM3aM6pHl/v2PFoCIPfi3VO5oo\nUAADFthafpicpT2lAY/1SGut+LnFeos7qehpzeGUdp0R15dSSr47wHjHEjRPmpEl\nd3Ci+xfuTxTSzem8dqYohKpsgWa2uOEtixgrAVbtNXZpYV4CvQ183QwBD1UIE9ja\nEpFPmdTk4m8+tnons+ivtQb71KHJFCOhk8+Z8ZF2esoHbhm3YXHKbbdVy/fu/XXf\naEQOaX8Dc8DLML/0Ueod\n=Ik7U\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-14T19:09:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/e9bd467419aed8293c0d7c3ae132f5042b6fa5ba","node_id":"C_kwDOBMB9P9oAKGU5YmQ0Njc0MTlhZWQ4MjkzYzBkN2MzYWUxMzJmNTA0MmI2ZmE1YmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teambit/bit/commit/d08a638041b9d4981f35e0d9f16dd675c302e7de","sha":"d08a638041b9d4981f35e0d9f16dd675c302e7de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teambit/bit/commits/d08a638041b9d4981f35e0d9f16dd675c302e7de"}],"sha":"e9bd467419aed8293c0d7c3ae132f5042