x(redwood): leaving a foldout screen in-app no longer leaves the next screen blank\n\nNavigating in-app from a booking detail (a @FoldoutDetail) to the journey rendered only the\nheader: onMateuNavigate assigned mateuFoldout = null and then read it back in the same chain,\nand a VB ''any'' variable that held an object reads back there as a truthy proxy over the\nprimitive (bindings do see the null). sinOtrasRamas stayed false and the host content was never\nprojected. Both chains (onMateuNavigate, runMateuAction) now use the values they just computed\n(foldout, wizard, task queue) instead of reading the variables back. Contract test added;\nbundles regenerated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ce7bb22634214edd94953629300a29d2b5df10c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/trees/6ce7bb22634214edd94953629300a29d2b5df10c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/commits/e8d628ed8ec571728360b95a2ccb345e13254427","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom","id":20686545,"login":"miguelperezcolom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjg2NTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_ur