ml_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commit/a9b2f41d3c25e8242398484f087a0fcef55ef2ee","sha":"a9b2f41d3c25e8242398484f087a0fcef55ef2ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/a9b2f41d3c25e8242398484f087a0fcef55ef2ee"}],"sha":"0af39eea9983530823fe23265238ba7a6d34cf5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/0af39eea9983530823fe23265238ba7a6d34cf5c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom","id":20686545,"login":"miguelperezcolom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjg2NTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/a9b2f41d3c25e8242398484f087a0fcef55ef2ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:55:02Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"miguelperezcolom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:55:02Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"miguelperezcolom"},"message":"fix(ux): an answer that arrives for a view no longer on screen dies silently\n\nFollow-up to #711 (which drops ACTIONS fired by a view no longer on screen). A\nrequest sent while its view was on screen and answered after the user moved on\n— another route, or another remote through the same reused mateu-ux — was still\napplied: its fragments/commands/appState, its toasts, its error toast, even a\nre-authentication for a 401.\n\nVaadin (libs/mateu):\n- mateu-ux counts its views: a navigation to another identity (id|baseUrl) or\n  route bumps a generation (a reload of the same view does not). Every request\n  carries RunActionOptions.isStale, true once the ux moved on; a route load is\n  also stale once a newer route load (callback token) superseded it.\n- AxiosMateuApiClient: a stale answer, success or failure, releases the\n  initiator (backend-cancelled-event) and rejects with StaleResponse — no\n  backend-failed-event (no toast), no automatic retry, no re-auth on a 401.\n- HttpService/SSEService drop it with a console.debug line: nothing applied, no\n  messages, no OnSuccess/OnError chain. SSE checks every chunk.\n\nRedwood (apps/redwood):\n- resilience.mjs: beginView()/currentView(); fetchWithPolicy({view}) drops the\n  answer of a view no longer current (onSettle without failure: no error band,\n  no re-auth, no retry) and rejects with an isStaleResponse error.\n- transport.callMateu stamps the current view on every page request (not on\n  quiet/isolated ones: header widgets, remote menus); SSE checks per increment.\n- onMateuNavigate starts a view, returns silently on a stale rejection and does\n  not write the registry if a newer navigation started meanwhile;\n  runMateuAction does not register a retry for a stale answer.\n\nTests: staleViewGuard.test.ts (answer / 500 / 401 after navigating, same-ux\nroute change and back, superseded route loads, current view untouched) and\nRedwood poc/test.mjs (same cases through the real transport).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31317a8af2d10be758f1b5a0a186ffd546c721ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/trees/31317a8af2d10be758f1b5a0a186ffd546c721ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/commits/a9b2f41d3c25e8242398484f087a0fcef55ef2ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom","id":20686545,"login":"miguelperezcolom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjg2NTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commit/a9b2f41d3c25e8242398484f087a0fcef55ef2ee","node_id":"C_kwDOBNevYdoAKGE5YjJmNDFkM2MyNWU4MjQyMzk4NDg0ZjA4N2EwZmNlZjU1ZWYyZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commit/e5eef8f4645bfbaab1cb2e8b61dc973e7f2fb868","sha":"e5eef8f4645bfbaab1cb2e8b61dc973e7f2fb868","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/e5eef8f4645bfbaab1cb2e8b61dc973e7f2fb868"}],"sha":"a9b2f41d3c25e8242398484f087a0fcef55ef2ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/a9b2f41d3c25e8242398484f087a0fcef55ef2ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4",