blic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/35c1ca5f2b081c539e5d83e0f3aac096d24a702d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:32:27Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"miguelperezcolom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:32:27Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"miguelperezcolom"},"message":"fix(ux): a reused mateu-ux no longer sends the previous page''s actions to the next page''s server; a 403 is not an expired session\n\nNavigating Integrations -> a front-office integration''s detail -> Registro on a\nfederated shell sent the integrations listing''s OnLoad search\n(serverSideType FrontOfficeIntegrationCrud) to /_registration-rules: Lit reuses\nthe content mateu-ux and re-binds its id/baseUrl/route before the new page\nlands, and the outgoing listing (seeded from the structure cache) still fired\nthrough it. The remote refused the unknown type (WireTypePolicy, 403) and the\nclient said ''Your session is no longer valid''.\n\n- mateu-ux records the identity (id + baseUrl) its content was produced for\n  and drops (cancels on the initiator) any non-load action fired by content of\n  a previous identity (staleViewGuard.ts).\n- requestPolicy: 403 is its own kind, ''forbidden'', with a localized message\n  (chromeTexts: ''You are not allowed to do this.'' / ''No tienes permiso para\n  esta acción.''); 401 stays ''unauthorized'' (re-auth flow unchanged).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b7008ff96fab98935c0be8a1a3277a5dc629966","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/trees/8b7008ff96fab98935c0be8a1a3277a5dc629966"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/commits/35c1ca5f2b081c539e5d83e0f3aac096d24a702d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4","events