TQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/abf2e188c6deddcea22f7b5e48790f9524b58c3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:11:25Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"miguelperezcolom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:11:25Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"miguelperezcolom"},"message":"feat(chat): Ctrl+Shift+M toggles the AI chat''s microphone (Vaadin + Redwood)\n\nWhile the chat panel is open — with the focus anywhere, the message field\nincluded — Ctrl+Shift+M starts/stops dictation exactly like a click on the mic\nbutton (same state and indicator). Ctrl on every platform: on macOS Cmd+Shift+M\nswitches Chrome profiles and Option+M types «µ». Nothing happens with the panel\nclosed or where the browser has no speech recognition.\n\n- Vaadin (libs/mateu): chatShortcut.ts (isChatMicShortcut, chatMicTitle), a\n  window keydown listener in mateu-chat (ignored when slotted detail-hidden);\n  mic button title/aria-label «Dictar (Ctrl+Shift+M)» / «Detener dictado (…)»\n  (localised), aria-keyshortcuts, aria-pressed. vitest for both.\n- Redwood: isChatMicShortcut in poc/chat.mjs (+ test.mjs); shell-page.js\n  presses #mateuChatMic on the shortcut and marks its inner <button> with\n  aria-keyshortcuts; one oj-button per state, since an oj-button''s text (its\n  tooltip and accessible name) does not follow an oj-bind-text.\n- Regenerated the Vaadin and Redwood bundles.\n\nCo-Authored-B