thored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47afaeb05be5bffbfd2d39987a31a2a0f7e43d60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/trees/47afaeb05be5bffbfd2d39987a31a2a0f7e43d60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/commits/bfe37efc07b8e25c7096ccfed300ccc6a45ae1ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom","id":20686545,"login":"miguelperezcolom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjg2NTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commit/bfe37efc07b8e25c7096ccfed300ccc6a45ae1ad","node_id":"C_kwDOBNevYdoAKGJmZTM3ZWZjMDdiOGUyNWM3MDk2Y2NmZWQzMDBjY2M2YTQ1YWUxYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commit/ce7c29217ab86c6d0ad20daf1bc298d6b4d73bb6","sha":"ce7c29217ab86c6d0ad20daf1bc298d6b4d73bb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/ce7c29217ab86c6d0ad20daf1bc298d6b4d73bb6"}],"sha":"bfe37efc07b8e25c7096ccfed300ccc6a45ae1ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/bfe37efc07b8e25c7096ccfed300ccc6a45ae1ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom","id":20686545,"login":"miguelperezcolom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjg2NTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/ce7c29217ab86c6d0ad20daf1bc298d6b4d73bb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:47:29Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"Miguel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:47:29Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"Miguel"},"message":"feat: renderers report the errors they show to POST <baseUrl>/mateu/v3/client-log\n\nOn ec-demo1 a «Tu sesión ya no es válida» seen by the user left no trace server-side: the ingress\nshowed no 401/403 for it, and nothing else recorded what the browser saw. Now both renderers post\nthe errors they hit or show, and the backend writes one structured line per report.\n\nBackend (shared/core ClientErrorLog + a Spring MVC Filter and a WebFlux WebFilter):\n- POST <any baseUrl>/mateu/v3/client-log, ordered after Spring Security''s chain so it is secured\n  like the other /mateu/v3 calls; one report or a batch (array, max 25).\n- Logger \"mateu.client\", WARN, `client-error {\"level\":\"error\",\"kind\":...}`: known fields only,\n  message ≤ 1000, stack ≤ 4000, plus the principal''s name as \"user\".\n- 204; 400 for malformed input (never throws); 413 above 16 KB; 404 when\n  mateu.client-log.enabled=false. On by default, no configuration.\n\nClients (apps/redwood/poc/clientLog.mjs, libs/mateu clientErrorReporter.ts — same contract):\n- Redwood: every classified failure from fetchWithPolicy; Vaadin: every failure toasted by\n  mateu-api-caller, plus the request-loop breaker; both: window error / unhandledrejection.\n- De-dupe within a minute (count, firstAt/lastAt, summary line when the window closes), 20\n  lines/minute per page (overflow counted in `dropped`), batched under 16 KB.\n- fetch keepalive with the Bearer token; sendBeacon only on pagehide without a token.\n- No loops: the report call bypasses the transport, its failures are swallowed, reports about the\n  endpoint are ignored, ''cancelled'' is never reported; an answer meaning \"no endpoint here\" (404,\n  405, 400, 500, non-204 2xx) turns reporting off for the page.\n\nDocs: ux-patterns/client-error-log (what is sent, Loki query `{namespace=\"<ns>\"} |= \"client-error\"`).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d5ef131ba9519941d77fe6ef05b54a9e7e36e89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/trees/2d5ef131ba9519941d77fe6ef05b54a9e7e36e89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/commits/ce7c29217ab86c6d0ad20daf1bc298d6b4d73bb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.githu