ard)\n\nnpm run build && npm run copy in apps/redwood, after the shared-refresh / 403 change. The bundle''s\ncontent diff is that change alone; the rest is the usual version_* directory rename.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4dba5d6f11ff970349bdb47f2aba89b1c56e075a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/trees/4dba5d6f11ff970349bdb47f2aba89b1c56e075a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/commits/de7535ef765e8729fc5c91bd09038bed073c2544","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom","id":20686545,"login":"miguelperezcolom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjg2NTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commit/de7535ef765e8729fc5c91bd09038bed073c2544","node_id":"C_kwDOBNevYdoAKGRlNzUzNWVmNzY1ZTg3MjlmYzVjOTFiZDA5MDM4YmVkMDczYzI1NDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commit/22fde551e43c5d74c27c81516386d6d94f9dca24","sha":"22fde551e43c5d74c27c81516386d6d94f9dca24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/22fde551e43c5d74c27c81516386d6d94f9dca24"}],"sha":"de7535ef765e8729fc5c91bd09038bed073c2544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/de7535ef765e8729fc5c91bd09038bed073c2544"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom","id":20686545,"login":"miguelperezcolom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjg2NTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/22fde551e43c5d74c27c81516386d6d94f9dca24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:20:26Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"Miguel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:20:26Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"Miguel"},"message":"fix(redwood): concurrent 401s share one token refresh; a 403 is not \"your session is no longer valid\"\n\nA Redwood console back from a background tab showed «Tu sesión ya no es válida. Vuelve a iniciar\nsesión.» while the Keycloak session was alive. The guard from 9266f523d was there, but:\n\n- Every 401 raised its own ''mateu-session-expired''. A tab waking up fires the inbox badge, the\n  banner sync and the user''s action with the same expired token, so N forced refreshes ran in\n  parallel (and N keycloak.login() when one failed). askForReauthentication is now single-flight:\n  401s that arrive while a refresh is under way wait for it and share its answer.\n- A request that left with the old token while the visibilitychange refresh was landing came back\n  401 and forced yet another refresh. fetchWithPolicy now remembers the token it sent; if\n  localStorage already holds a different one, it just resends with it.\n- A 403 was classified as ''unauthorized'', so a real refusal (an action the view does not declare,\n  a missing role) read as an expired session and sent the user to a login that fixes nothing. It\n  is now ''forbidden'' — «No tienes permiso para hacer esto.» — and never raises the event.\n\nThe agent chat''s stream goes through the same askForReauthentication, so it shares the refresh.\nBridge regenerated (node poc/make-amd.mjs). Four new contract tests in poc/test.mjs (263 green):\ntwo concurrent 401s → one refresh, both retried with the new token; a token refreshed in flight →\nresent without a refresh; refresh fails → ''unauthorized'', no resend; 403 → ''forbidden'', no event.\nDocs: ux-patterns/session-expiry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e4e944109612cff5e3bbd525184ff65fa26255c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/trees/e4e944109612cff5e3bbd525184ff65fa26255c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/commits/22fde551e43c5d74c27c81516386d6d94f9dca24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom","id":20686545,"login":"miguelperezcolom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjg2NTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commit/22fde551e43c5d74c27c81516386d6d94f9dca24","node_id":"C_kwDOBNevYdoAKDIyZmRlNTUxZTQzYzVkNzRjMjdjODE1MTYzODZkNmQ5NGY5ZGNhMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commit/46595ddcc02a48af1966f7f65a90312e3d591414","sha":"46595ddcc02a48af1966f7f65a90312e3d591414","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/46595ddcc02a48af1966f7f65a90312e3d591414"}],"sha":"22fde551e43c5d74c27c81516386d6d94f9dca24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/22fde551e43c5d74c27c81516386d6d94f9dca24"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom","id":20686545,"login":"miguelperezcolom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjg2NTQ