outside or picking a section,\n  and slides in (no animation with prefers-reduced-motion). Focus goes into the panel and back.\n- The sub-header collapses when it has nothing to show (sections mode on the home) instead of\n  leaving an empty white band, with a short height/opacity transition (reduced-motion aware).\n- Listing search: the unapplied filters go back to a dropdown opened by focusing the field\n  (oj-sp-smart-filters `suggestions`) instead of the row of buttons under it (`suggestionFilters`,\n  since 8af850e63); picking one applies it and opens its editor. Typing filters the rows.\n- Page forms and both wizards: oj-form-layout full width, with the wire''s columns or two when none\n  are declared (Vaadin''s default); the page form no longer sits in a half-width column.\n- The Ask Oracle FAB no longer covers the wizard''s Next / the guided process footer: footers keep\n  out of the FAB''s column and the content leaves room for it at the end.\n- Row editor: an empty read-only field («Line», «Total» of a new room) is its label and «—», not a\n  tiny focused box; the dialog focuses the first editable field. Empty cells of an editable list\n  say «—».\n- Confirmation dialog defaults follow the UI language (es → «Sí» / «No»).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22f3ef829eb10de681f9713fec01f223479a5e19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/trees/22f3ef829eb10de681f9713fec01f223479a5e19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/commits/68444762234d81dcb6f7421b2e3d4bfb96fe7d72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/follo