ithub.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/996acdabf902ed24ecc0982f430937ebc7925c2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T10:47:57Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"miguelperezcolom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T10:47:57Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"miguelperezcolom"},"message":"vaadin: UX batch — thin hamburger, folding sub-header, Redwood-style accent strip and hero, localized confirmation\n\n- the HAMBURGER_SECTIONS hamburger is one more header icon button (tertiary icon vaadin-button,\n  Lumo''s thin menu glyph, the header''s icon colour and size); it turns into a close icon while the\n  sections are open, with aria-expanded/aria-controls\n- the section band (sub-header) folds away when there is no section on screen (the home),\n  sliding/fading in and out; no motion with prefers-reduced-motion\n- the fixed 3px accent line under the band is gone: the accent is a STRIP drawn where Redwood\n  draws its colour strip — under a page''s header, on top of a listing''s results, at the foot of\n  the welcome hero. New @App(accentStrip = \"/images/…\") names its image (AppDto.accentStrip);\n  blank = a plain accent band\n- the hero is drawn as Redwood''s welcome banner: a deep tone of the accent, header type on the\n  start side, the app''s heroImage() on the end side (no dark veil), the strip at its foot\n- the confirmation dialog''s generic texts follow the page language (chromeTexts):\n  «Un momento» / «¿Seguro?» / «Sí» / «No» on a Spanish UI, English otherwise\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c62edf551aaf2e6634a0a308bf0277334df1d8f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/trees/c62edf551aaf2e6634a0a308bf0277334df1d8f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/commits/996acdabf902ed24ecc0982f430937ebc7925c2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"