:"2026-10-04T09:32:22Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"miguelperezcolom"},"message":"redwood: listing columns honor the wire width / flexGrow / tooltipPath (@ColumnWidth)\n\nA GridColumn with width \"420px\" + flexGrow \"0\" (Mateu #703) now gets that width in oj-table\n(width = minWidth = maxWidth), its text cut with an ellipsis on one line and the full text\n(or the tooltipPath field) in the title, like Vaadin''s gridRenderer. Columns without a width\nkeep their behaviour; a tooltipPath alone only adds the title. The cell reads a precomputed\n<id>__clipCell {text, title, cls} (VB CSP), stripped from sort keys and selected rows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"88d3481bcd004f1243e3270b3a8c6a43ec8a0ec5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/trees/88d3481bcd004f1243e3270b3a8c6a43ec8a0ec5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/commits/3f90a6d7d94e14a22a230fbd6686f25c1ecf55ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom","id":20686545,"login":"miguelperezcolom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjg2NTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gi