s{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom","id":20686545,"login":"miguelperezcolom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjg2NTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/commits/a32882d94354809cd1ad557297a177a9ff582f39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T20:30:13Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"miguelperezcolom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T20:30:13Z","email":"miguelperezcolom@gmail.com","name":"miguelperezcolom"},"message":"feat: AppVariant.HAMBURGER_SECTIONS, Opera Cloud''s navigation (P9 delivery 2)\n\nThe hamburger holds the sections, the menu''s first level and nothing below\nit; the band under the header holds the section on screen, its name (which\ngoes to its home) and its second level, a group of it as a dropdown (M3).\nChoosing a section goes to its first entry that can be opened (M4) and\ncloses the hamburger. The section and the entry on screen come from the\nroute and the same tree as the breadcrumbs: on a cold load a remote section\nthat has not answered yet is already the active one, by its prefix. A remote\nthat is down leaves its section dimmed with its hint; choosing it asks again.\n\n- navTree: activeSection and sectionHome; mergeRemoteMenus can make each\n  remote mounted at the top ONE section, whatever it answers (several\n  entries become the entries of a section named as the shell named it).\n- Vaadin: the HAMBURGER_SECTIONS template in appRenderer (band 1 with the\n  hamburger, band 2, the sections panel over the content), activeSectionOf\n  and selectSection in mateu-app.\n- Redwood: shellNavOf mode ''sections'' (the drawer lists only the sections,\n  each with its home; the sub-header shows the section''s second level, with\n  no accent); asSection in the remote menu expansion. Ports in navTree.mjs.\n- AppVariant.HAMBURGER_MENU, the right spelling of HAMBURGUER_MENU, travels\n  under the old name; AUTO never picks HAMBURGER_SECTIONS (M6, M7).\n- Tests: core, vitest, poc/test.mjs, and a Playwright SUT of its own\n  (fed-sections-app :8087, tests/federation-sections), wired into CI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c16bcaba1440cff5c0be4db5849f49dba23a78a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/trees/c16bcaba1440cff5c0be4db5849f49dba23a78a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miguelperezcolom/mateu/git/commits/a32882d94354809cd1ad557297a177a9ff582f39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20686545?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miguelperezcolom","id":20686545,"login":"miguelperezcolom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjg2NTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miguelperezcolom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gith