43881fbde165493320d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.discovery/commits/ee952cf7a9404c7c5e1777e5d9cb6676c037d639/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:29:02Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:29:02Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"The Zendure proposal sets connectionMode local\n\nAn instance created with an empty native takes the io-package default\n`authKey`. Without a cloud key that mode logs an error and breaks out of\nonReady() before startMdnsDiscovery() - in 5.3.1 (stable) and 6.0.0 alike - so\nthe proposed instance never found the devices it was proposed for. `local`\nstarts the mDNS browser without an MQTT server in both versions; `zenSDK`\nwould only work from 6.0.0 on.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e420299c65dfbc7cac3e1aed059e0bd7c33f36b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroke