"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.discovery/commits/0a93a1f042178c4d6655e2b8e7fabbed374b6426/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T11:06:06Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T11:06:06Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"chore: release v5.1.1\n\n* (bluefox) The ping scan says so when this host may not send ICMP and sweeps the range over TCP instead (#247)\n* (bluefox) The scan can now run on a timer, with a selectable set of methods - mdns, ping, udp and upnp by default\n* (bluefox) Every finished scan writes the devices it found below `discovery.0.devices`\n* (bluefox) The instance has settings again: two tabs with a start button, the live scan state and the device list\n* (bluefox) The device tab is a real table now: sortable, filterable, and it fills itself from `system.discovery`\n* (bluefox) The device table shows the icon of every proposed adapter that is installed on this host\n* (bluefox) A scheduled scan raises a notification when it proposes something that was not proposed before\n* (bluefox) The texts of the settings dialog moved into `admin/i18n`, complete in all eleven languages\n* (bluefox) `adminUI.config` is repaired at start-up, js-controller does not update that field on an upgrade\n* (bluefox) The adapter was refactor