ptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.discovery/commit/0d1e8622d9365fc4638daa1099558aeb69c73396","node_id":"C_kwDOBN9qC9oAKDBkMWU4NjIyZDkzNjVmYzQ2MzhkYWExMDk5NTU4YWViNjljNzMzOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.discovery/commit/08003ff297817fef054fcf0935f761631d30b699","sha":"08003ff297817fef054fcf0935f761631d30b699","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.discovery/commits/08003ff297817fef054fcf0935f761631d30b699"}],"sha":"0d1e8622d9365fc4638daa1099558aeb69c73396","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.discovery/commits/0d1e8622d9365fc4638daa1099558aeb69c73396"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1881217?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Eistee82","id":1881217,"login":"Eistee82","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODEyMTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eistee82","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.discovery/commits/fa5ed1575d4ccac5fd69a50804b012eac1507c64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T16:31:38Z","email":"Eistee82@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eistee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T16:31:38Z","email":"Eistee82@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eistee"},"message":"Fix Hoymiles HMS discovery: require path and native config schema\n\nTwo bugs in the as-merged Hoymiles discovery code (PR #386 + linter\ncleanup ea93fb0):\n\n1. require(''../lib/tools'') resolves to lib/lib/tools — the path is wrong\n   (other adapters use ''../tools.js''). Loading the module on a real\n   discovery scan crashes with MODULE_NOT_FOUND.\n\n2. native config did not match the hoymiles 0.3.x schema. The adapter\n   reads cfg.devices (array of {host, enabled}) and cfg.dataInterval;\n   discovery produced cfg.host and cfg.pollInterval instead. The\n   adapter''s legacy migration only triggers when devices is undefined,\n   but io-package.json sets devices: [] as the default — so the host\n   field is never migrated and the adapter logs \"Local connection\n   enabled but no devices configured\".\n\nFixes:\n- Correct the tools require path to ''../tools.js''.\n- Produce native: { devices: [{ host, enabled: true }], dataInterval: 5,\n  slowPollFactor: 6, enableLocal: true } so the adapter accepts the\n  configuration directly.\n- Update the duplicate-instance check to look inside native.devices\n  while still recognising the legacy flat host field.\n\nVerified end-to-end against a real Hoymiles HMS DTU on the LAN\n(192.168.178.87, SN 4143A01CEDE4) and against a mock DTU running in\n@iobroker/dev-server: the adapter reaches \"Connected to DTU\" and starts\nits poll cycle with the discovery-supplied settings.\n\nAdds test/adapters/hoymiles.test.js (mocha + chai) following the\ntest/adapters/air-q.test.js pattern, covering module loading, the\ndevice-array native shape, and duplicate prevention for both the new\nand legacy config layouts.","tree":{"sha":"d7a845151a4b616a7aa9c2633d91bcaf012acfc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.discovery/git/trees/d7a845151a4b616a7aa9c2633d91bcaf012acfc1"},"url":"https:/