a6863eb1d109992407b4150290ee3495d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/paragon/commits/c7241fca6863eb1d109992407b4150290ee3495d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4388505?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/holaontiveros","id":4388505,"login":"holaontiveros","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODg1MDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/holaontiveros","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/paragon/commits/9b80f38b5f42648fd8e21f6be6880f5f9da88bc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T21:31:29Z","email":"hola@javo.work","name":"Javier Ontiveros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T21:31:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: update Icon to use TypeScript natively (#4136)\n\n* feat: convert Icon component from JS to TypeScript\n\n- Converted from JSX to TSX with native TypeScript types\n- Removed PropTypes in favor of TypeScript interfaces\n- Replaced defaultProps with default parameter values\n- Added proper TypeScript interfaces for IconProps and SvgAttrs\n- Removed obsolete index.d.ts file\n- Fixed TypeScript compilation errors\n\n* refactor: address review on Icon TS migration\n\n- Revert id type to string (drop the null it never had before)\n- Narrow className to string for consistency with other Paragon\n  components; remove the Array.isArray(...).join('' '') handling\n- Update Icon.test.tsx to match the narrowed types (string className,\n  drop the obsolete null-id test)\n\n* fix: widen Icon src prop type to ComponentType<any>\n\nThe strict ComponentType<SVGAttributes<SVGElement>> broke Alert, which\npasses icon?: React.ComponentType<IconProps> to <Icon src=...>. Match\nthe IconButton convention (iconAs?: React.ComponentType<any>) so any\nicon component is accepted while still rejecting non-component values\nlike strings.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4 <claude@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"260b801db0ebe8d1ece9a7c1f096365006abcd23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/paragon/git/trees/260b801db0ebe8d1ece9a7c1f096365006abcd23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/paragon/git/commits/9b80f38b5f42648fd8e21f6be6880f5f9da88bc3","verification":{"payload":"tree 260b801db0ebe8d1ece9a7c1f096365006abcd23\nparent e623f70fa17f22134384cb8e897bcab8757f2ac0\nauthor Javier Ontiveros <hola@javo.work> 1788903089 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788903089 -0700\n\nrefactor: update Icon to use TypeScript natively (#4136)\n\n* feat: convert Icon component from JS to TypeScript\n\n- Converted from JSX to TSX with native TypeScript types\n- Removed PropTypes in favor of TypeScript interfaces\n- Replaced defaultProps with default parameter values\n- Added proper TypeScript interfaces for IconProps and SvgAttrs\n- Removed obsolete index.d.ts file\n- Fixed TypeScript compilation errors\n\n* refactor: address review on Icon TS migration\n\n- Revert id type to string (drop the null it never had before)\n- Narrow className to string for consistency with other Paragon\n  components; remove the Array.isArray(...).join('' '') handling\n- Update Icon.test.tsx to match the narrowed types (string className,\n  drop the obsolete null-id test)\n\n* fix: widen Icon src prop type to ComponentType<any>\n\nThe strict ComponentType<SVGAttributes<SVGElement>> broke Alert, which\npasses icon?: React.ComponentType<IconProps> to <Icon src=...>. Match\nthe IconButton convention (iconAs?: React.ComponentType<any>) so any\nicon component is accepted while still rejecting non-component values\nlike strings.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4 <claude@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoH6xCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPAMQAI682M3CsSZxQrc5t+62Uxi7\nTvtzT2Z5IKXMosgXIWlhFLyjOMHWRNdUSImAlZX55sqxrAfvFDLTT8Xigguxm2TK\n6g3bpeYejYrlHeHkWAgAQTJSPb9KM9ydqdMj1/RaHDOoPUKxyC5LZe7CoXz8zoAD\nl6mdHF/jghdf1ejVPtClu8YuJTksUePWThYokos3WSikrnySUiHYuylYu84piu8G\noEIrEGaM+WwWEnGh1v3Q2cDwz+jCmtB+SolI47MDJiaAQrqsH8mXcCavS+gaLhqc\nrXjgMF9s6kUHwElDFqQ6lqAAfEG0KBmtzsXkIzVswNuScWDobYWEgYxGCG8tcvnw\nmu9QSeIjaUDnqOae3mK3nDOImT5/ThgbEvt52chkLPiyyAPzgAP+55MpnTZLpZ5L\np9uMJWCx9XQUlC62G/pH5lnO23xAOBvMnrkFqrfROFIDZbwoqaIiAduZ/PgBiVOP\nXGZ/ZpkW3wbpLzSVLFmyZ4mkkiwG23NqJCpHuCiPAiIKchdPqN/tOn7z36Co4yVu\nl8GEM56vnb4rk8gE1hb0Nswnr0JOVu+F7PpnHxtAyzv0IGNaUXMhB6AgJJuPNGV0\n0CORivrYFRJMNKhdQVTe/cWXuy9Qv0q9jXjkpd9jqwmsAogNWg5jSAOXFAigd6EB\nJJeIlXwz6KAhiYW1HI8R\n=3RXS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-08T21:31:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site