"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/paragon/commits/91f7621b822cebc18862a301ca1d1b9e0b14640e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T13:17:07Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T13:17:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(www): load default Open edX brand theme from CDN (#4236)\n\nThe @openedx/brand-openedx v1.x package was a placeholder with empty\nSCSS files. With v2.x, it ships pre-compiled theme CSS. This updates\nthe docs site default theme to load brand styles from the jsDelivr CDN\n(core.min.css and light.min.css) instead of using empty URLs.\n\nAdds an `isDefault` flag to ThemeConfig to distinguish the built-in\ndefault from user-added custom themes, and extracts a shared\nDEFAULT_THEME constant. Theme normalization on load ensures backwards\ncompatibility with old shared links and localStorage entries.\n\nRemoves the unused @openedx/brand-openedx dependency from www.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2c85ed0905565cf6678007a80df74a4a0b49637","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/paragon/git/trees/b2c85ed0905565cf6678007a80df74a4a0b49637"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/paragon/git/commits/91f7621b822cebc18862a301ca1d1b9e0b14640e","verification":{"payload":"tree b2c85ed0905565cf6678007a80df74a4a0b49637\nparent 25e99faf9b374a5a702acd53a3ffd7b694a65ee9\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1776259027 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776259027 -0400\n\nfeat(www): load default Open edX brand theme from CDN (#4236)\n\nThe @openedx/brand-openedx v1.x package was a placeholder with empty\nSCSS files. With v2.x, it ships pre-compiled theme CSS. This updates\nthe docs site default theme to load brand styles from the jsDelivr CDN\n(core.min.css and light.min.css) instead of using empty URLs.\n\nAdds an `isDefault` flag to ThemeConfig to distinguish the built-in\ndefault from user-added custom themes, and extracts a shared\nDEFAULT_THEME constant. Theme normalization on load ensures backwards\ncompatibility with old shared links and localStorage entries.\n\nRemoves the unused @openedx/brand-openedx dependency from www.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp34/TCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANGsQABdTtDgSNHIa8jqdo7D5CPXu\nq7fRCaAZ4NbUiii2z85QRf+yLTlTzr/9geSRoS0YjwzdaWQAiZNpQ2E6eI1rWsxC\n2iCwWCAH97yOHwg4eRb8/wT5Amc6WKVHpfZCHT96dXNzv68KN4FC3CnGu0JeeDgp\nrcKY5Yf4u/WSYZmgSsrTShp3dGAEQf6oPKGo7rEJCOKwMt36P38Y54aM8yDKIoXH\nfBpIYmBaDFu3bMhks+UIfaez1GPI5DecRGGWL/xXkvGpTxDjueptSWzyFTh+mYoa\n9JryswDrsEUzGlzs+hQjVpZpI0nJBLFV1L6OidrlBfOGnMUVZac8QrFABzIAE4bk\nUWCbdMDHV1NC6eXjOl8e1hOFfe0bP1yF6J6p8QAEr8GXnOkEuFfEPnK39EputFu4\nCRrcA751i9wl+MR4C8in2EN1IQqoZLihtj+NL2MGQlGRf6dJ+WNVDRhG3e1YsKtl\nEyUXAgW8Ct2/0pZuuEQ8Q4KEceOKpG+kU+5Fo3Y7XiQhG9xcrPMMs72AHPMZUIoN\n2FvzxjPMRYXFPMnEU9XsnzBeuD+4Rqf/52B2ThyeatlCO22YJfLcv907huRqdY57\n4jPtxHBJlvgtj4KsDRvOC8l1kGZIQMmQxRp8aA6TY3u0n6E1U0AEMriNK9iH6PNt\nSp2oyM7iI21z1CYvryit\n=k981\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-15T13:17:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.co