a5a702acd53a3ffd7b694a65ee9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T15:43:14Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T15:43:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: remove husky and lint-staged (#4232)\n\nHusky forces git pre-commit hooks for all contributors, which can\nblock commits when npm isn''t in the system path. CI already handles\nlinting on push. lint-staged was only invoked by the husky hook and\nhad no standalone script.\n\nRef: openedx/frontend-app-learning#1622\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f757712b27b0429da459cdc4dd1df10e06b45e2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/paragon/git/trees/f757712b27b0429da459cdc4dd1df10e06b45e2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/paragon/git/commits/25e99faf9b374a5a702acd53a3ffd7b694a65ee9","verification":{"payload":"tree f757712b27b0429da459cdc4dd1df10e06b45e2f\nparent a1ecf15c1ae5fd78df0b9c5b9cd02082321ec3a3\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1776181394 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776181394 -0400\n\nchore: remove husky and lint-staged (#4232)\n\nHusky forces git pre-commit hooks for all contributors, which can\nblock commits when npm isn''t in the system path. CI already handles\nlinting on push. lint-staged was only invoked by the husky hook and\nhad no standalone script.\n\nRef: openedx/frontend-app-learning#1622\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp3mCSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUpkQAHRv9H2oi873YykPH+yONoyT\nMUaPJdF0SdC9f5o4HvQy+M8hOztyhpsLUapLnKTTBKqcCH8vpqkMn2LIuC8VGyZv\nRRGdp+D48z5ZrDBJjQTs80pUK1Rwa4Zl1EuNgUZbCRt1vcvHssUE8DXTO3EgjcSd\ns38TynQcTJyBW+Rb+r6zbNtnrqoHGsdiXmyMkTAlUpPh85HMCFDAaYS4FFND3M4h\nAhpqb/AZC456QcEvIPmB5OAGbcFdX1OHtWhzWVKASoSBUU0crzJ