7fdb60255428e377402d556","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/paragon/commits/1982507f3ae2d1ca87fdb60255428e377402d556"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112954497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brian-smith-tcril","id":112954497,"login":"brian-smith-tcril","node_id":"U_kgDOBruMgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/paragon/commits/e633288dbef5236230bddb7c0366dc8ca1ba7156/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T13:43:27Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T13:43:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: drop `:preserveSemverRanges` from renovate config (#4224)\n\nThe `preserveSemverRanges` preset sets `rangeStrategy: \"replace\"`,\nwhich skips in-range updates entirely — no PR, no lockfile update.\nThis causes dependencies to go stale and break on lockfile regen.\n\nRemoving it falls back to `rangeStrategy: \"auto\"`, which updates\nthe lockfile for in-range versions and replaces the range for\nout-of-range updates.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e82b9ea99561b49478982f04cd3630290a518ed4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/paragon/git/trees/e82b9ea99561b49478982f04cd3630290a518ed4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/paragon/git/commits/e633288dbef5236230bddb7c0366dc8ca1ba7156","verification":{"payload":"tree e82b9ea99561b49478982f04cd3630290a518ed4\nparent 05432497de7a0f20ee289acd1125b358996c6f87\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1776174207 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776174207 +0000\n\nfix: drop `:preserveSemverRanges` from renovate config (#4224)\n\nThe `preserveSemverRanges` preset sets `rangeStrategy: \"replace\"`,\nwhich skips in-range updates entirely — no PR, no lockfile update.\nThis causes dependencies to go stale and break on lockfile regen.\n\nRemoving it falls back to `rangeStrategy: \"auto\"`, which updates\nthe lockfile for in-range versions and replaces the range for\nout-of-range updates.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp3kR/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFdIQAJ6SF+/snhngG2KM4jeubkIw\ng+H8lBIC+/XRJZuJhX+bbmTXhhR+ukeNm2X+tEnZio/OBana+2E0zt+3OQ/koMFv\npp3/z9BrL/pMoAlowa9nVLgUyBVxJVBipdw6BTzBvCujGjEyT72bHeEXnt9C8eOP\nBz4aWuKbSJd1CUao6Z0Ca7LfEzanUVBD4BIK4eJ8KfuP2tuNseg6xRI2rCLSP868\n7aUet+UBZ3IN3Nu48e6s9VAyFng9swnK3zbtdUnxsCOtYslX/tjDoq6emm+D6AYO\noRjokX/1cYAg6Zk162KxQw2BMMHP9+tskKCRVpPEZCjAw8bYuL+/HyHPLigmjFaJ\nirmMKXv5GUhisLGxRbEsHKt4MRwmfawGCaPSo28AaCzfa8ilYE6wlxjFCBlcSAwX\ngAs98qh/kZ8xUt/FzSdQpg1LtVcC91NA5ZdKEz6oNl4Zo6mZcwXWIklQh5/FPS8G\nFloGqSL3amdTME24PbyJKoHYc6HQTTG74ZDTc5hgBbTOPWuzvBthvtyJiOSR/2qV\nUvzNVEbGPwIUbwzWHh+pF8dfK4tvm1brOD+eY8G3aFHg29vfcebbqh1fNulnFRRZ\nNBeto8FPgM8oH274eEiQh5jgctPbYxOHBvDuZDVRHAq/ib9XxTWdSU3ItY1pIOpY\ndiGJ9LtnbtbdlG3W2E6s\n=z7qa\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-14T13:43:28Z"}},"committer