6 on performance, SSR, architecture, and challenges\n\n- Introduced README, challenges, and Q&A for Level 5 focusing on performance optimization, SSR with Nuxt 3, and advanced reactivity.\n- Added detailed challenges for Level 5, including virtualized lists, bundle optimization, and Lighthouse performance.\n- Created a comprehensive Q&A section for Level 5 addressing advanced Vue concepts and performance metrics.\n- Developed README, challenges, and Q&A for Level 6 emphasizing Clean Architecture, design systems, Vue internals, micro-frontends, and observability.\n- Included challenges for Level 6 related to refactoring, creating a design system, custom renderers, and open source contributions.","tree":{"sha":"3493af23c2ebb171eab73fb61501cf8c9bf237d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FranciscoWallison/Estudos--Vue.js/git/trees/3493af23c2ebb171eab73fb61501cf8c9bf237d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FranciscoWallison/Estudos--Vue.js/git/commits/81dc7100c31857b0e8724fbc7cf0c1052ab928df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/FranciscoWallison/Estudos--Vue.js/commit/81dc7100c31857b0e8724fbc7cf0c1052ab928df","node_id":"C_kwDOBYERtdoAKDgxZGM3MTAwYzMxODU3YjBlODcyNGZiYzdjZjBjMTA1MmFiOTI4ZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FranciscoWallison/Estudos--Vue.js/commit/bfd0240c1012f43367472062c5745c883dd23d37","sha":"bfd0240c1012f43367472062c5745c883dd23d37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FranciscoWallison/Estudos--Vue.js/commits/bfd0240c1012f43367472062c5745c883dd23d37"}],"sha":"81dc7100c31857b0e8724fbc7cf0c1052ab928df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FranciscoWallison/Estudos--Vue.js/commits/81dc7100c31857b0e8724fbc7cf0c1052ab928df"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/FranciscoWallison/Estudos--Vue.js/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=802e4489ff140b076eb5c4f335cddce9a270b0a2&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%