ianWielga/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianWielga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianWielga/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianWielga","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TouK/nussknacker/commits/7bf74adb0169c2f8815880e5614570c9eb142c13/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T11:55:19Z","email":"j@touk.pl","name":"JulianWielga"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T11:55:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Prefix GitHub CI docker branch image tags with gh- (#9424)\n\nGitHub CI shares the touk/nussknacker registry with another pipeline, so its branch \"-latest\" aliases (staging-latest, master-latest, ...) overwrote images built by that other pipeline. Publish and consume them under a gh- prefix instead. The real branch name is kept for the Cypress snapshot PR base; only the docker image tag is prefixed.","tree":{"sha":"a4d483e166596bece3b4970d8d994a790af2cd60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TouK/nussknacker/git/trees/a4d483e166596bece3b4970d8d994a790af2cd60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TouK/nussknacker/git/commits/7bf74adb0169c2f8815880e5614570c9eb142c13","verification":{"payload":"tree a4d483e166596bece3b4970d8d994a790af2cd60\nparent 16f5190e3c95a8b5f239ef29481d06695c088494\nauthor JulianWielga <j@touk.pl> 1784894119 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784894119 +0200\n\nPrefix GitHub CI docker branch image tags with gh- (#9424)\n\nGitHub CI shares the touk/nussknacker registry with another pipeline, so its branch \"-latest\" aliases (staging-latest, master-latest, ...) overwrote images built by that other pipeline. Publish and consume them under a gh- prefix instead. The real branch name is kept for the Cypress snapshot PR base; only the docker image tag is prefixed.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBA