8ea7a94034cf7ccb18a512c6be7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:56:25Z","email":"99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"berfinyuksel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:56:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Pass SYNC_TOKEN to the studio frontend build (#141)\n\nPart of pimcore/DevOps-Tasks#65. The studio frontend build pushes its automatic commits as pimcore-deployments and only on pushes to version branches; PR runs upload the build as an artifact instead (pimcore/workflows-collection-public#168). The push run no longer cancels an in-progress run; the head-commit check in the reusable prevents a commit loop.\n\nUntil #168 is merged the \"Studio Frontend Build\" check fails at startup with \"secret SYNC_TOKEN is not defined in the referenced workflow\". That is expected; the check gets re-run after the merge, before this PR is marked ready.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"991529126a80a9a1873fe4c2077fd248d67f6a13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/frontend-permission-toolkit/git/trees/991529126a80a9a1873fe4c2077fd248d67f6a13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/frontend-permission-toolkit/git/commits/3be8a63844cdc8ea7a94034cf7ccb18a512c6be7","verification":{"payload":"tree 991529126a80a9a1873fe4c2077fd248d67f6a13\nparent 26a6994aa1efbd09a6a1a5c12f875eec0e9f6420\nauthor berfinyuksel <99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com> 1791395785 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791395785 +0200\n\nPass SYNC_TOKEN to the studio frontend build (#141)\n\nPart of pimcore/DevOps-Tasks#65. The studio frontend build pushes its automatic commits as pimcore-deployments and only on pushes to version branches; PR runs upload the build as an artifact instead (pimcore/workflows-collection-public#168). The push run no longer cancels an in-progress run; the head-commit check in the reusable prevents a commit loop.\n\nUntil #168 is merged the \"Studio Frontend Build\" check fails at startup with \"secret SYNC_TOKEN is not defined in the referenced workflow\". That is expected; the check gets re-run after the merge, before this PR is marked ready.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxofKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOx8QADmxNW0Ma1VZYGIwISYlWWOn\nK9Sk7SmsytpUOYcLRT2bPZXoxmjqSB3FGQqcXlKSMC22YwOQDfancZ+2bC8Biopm\nDW0EAPTmkfvKo7KnFycvVEfblqZfTmjiveAHxr7OArTs+VCUa+sSQB8pgn4rY3xQ\nze/qsPc8792F7MmNrf1PCb4wkqXLx8QYiRX3M/fxFRPuc2L7agqqNQ5fKtHnk+1N\nkIeyx3UvyMNh5KlNbF+qz2WwsPuK+ZCFRU3B+RohIuUcPhU900dgt9J5bXtN+BIN\ngvuycSK/HQhG8QbkzxcPDtfXUBMONxmSrPX7UZAL+JrtlyU48+Df9HFgO/f31lTw\ntYWNtLNsExfSpNB9j6N2bwxdznbe5+GJzDc7lfHNLV8TLDEKdHi4OpSYSMtiPN2R\nP1g77FCCnOQjDJkHVBo8oK4jwg0IkQnWiUmLaAJF90EVPxYLg/56BiV+MXbUQCER\nr3Nv4ZqXGZM2e2qd7ryJquPHfS6m82BjNm+/+lMx3C8+kHqnZzIozw2CTONvt3wo\ns3a6L52R1zZC6MJO5L9yXAdPJGsSj+yAbLRUWv2rmUGZUnG5IykNdttHMg0M8VSP\npfdnAVqhQBqJ4lPrghwPvBpQoH6KD6acKX5IjAJchYD9XbSDu/aX622WmqOa+r5k\nOUW9xYtL8SZyGH68/NOk\n=F86Y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T17:56:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gi