"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ValeriaMaltseva","id":11871778,"login":"ValeriaMaltseva","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODcxNzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/frontend-permission-toolkit/commits/e8120c935c9e0cab4b36987556a2847f41cb3c5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T18:57:36Z","email":"valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com","name":"Valeriia Maltseva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T18:57:36Z","email":"valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com","name":"Valeriia Maltseva"},"message":"Merge remote-tracking branch ''origin/2026.2'' into 2026.x\n\nBrings the packaged Studio frontend build (#138) forward: the expanded\nsrc/Resources/public/studio/build tree is no longer committed, only\nbuild-dist/build-<id>.zip, which is extracted at cache warmup.\n\nConflict resolution:\n- src/Resources/public/studio/build/**: took 2026.2''s deletion; superseded by\n  the packaged archive. CI regenerates it.\n- .php-cs-fixer.cache: took 2026.2''s side; regenerated by the tool.\n\ncomposer.json auto-merged to the higher bound on each line: studio-ui-bundle\n^2026.2.1 (from 2026.2, required by the new BuildArchive-based provider, and\n2026.x had left it at the merge-base ^2026.1) and pimcore/pimcore ^2026.3 (from\n2026.x). package.json/package-lock.json keep 2026.x''s newer 2026.3.0-canary,\nwhose lock provides the studio-package-build binary.\n\nThe inherited archive was built against 2026.2''s studio-ui-bundle, so CI will\nrepackage it against 2026.x''s canary even though the JS sources are identical.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8fa178596764dd833566aee757dcbfa3aaf734d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/frontend-permission-toolkit/git/trees/8fa178596764dd833566aee757dcbfa3aaf734d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/frontend-permission-toolkit/git/commits/e8120c935c9e0cab4b36987556a2847f41cb3c5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11871778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ValeriaMaltseva","id":11871778,"login":"ValeriaMaltseva","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODcxNzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/frontend-permission-toolkit/commit/e8120c935c9e0cab4b36987556a2847f41cb3c5d","no