 with the studio i18n skill validator.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Localize the permission-resource terminology\n\nde and fr both translate these labels (Berechtigungsressource /\nRessource de permission); only the provider service name stays English\nin every locale, so that one is left as is.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a847ac8ab983d2594edf0bfcd2d92c702b6b664","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/frontend-permission-toolkit/git/trees/0a847ac8ab983d2594edf0bfcd2d92c702b6b664"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/frontend-permission-toolkit/git/commits/ef0d56a82ca5b4e6978aa5da25938a6276bde9ca","verification":{"payload":"tree 0a847ac8ab983d2594edf0bfcd2d92c702b6b664\nparent 481c8223df2fec148d7ea7d25d6e8ffd803ab722\nauthor Tine <42359615+xIrusux@users.noreply.github.com> 1789565637 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789565637 +0200\n\n3207 - [Frontend Permission Toolkit] - Translations (nl, pl) (#134)\n\n* Add Dutch (nl) and Polish (pl) Studio UI translations\n\nFull translation of studio.en.yaml into nl and pl, consistent with the\nreviewed studio-ui-bundle translations (shared keys and common UI terms\nreuse those exact values; product names kept English: Asset, Object\nBrick, Field Collection, Custom Layout, Layout, Workspace,\nClassification Store). Validated with the studio i18n skill validator.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Localize the permission-resource terminology\n\nde and fr both translate these labels (Berechtigungsressource /\nRessource de permission); only the provider service name stays English\nin every locale, so that one is left as is.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason