tent.com/u/99557970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/berfinyuksel","id":99557970,"login":"berfinyuksel","node_id":"U_kgDOBe8iUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/frontend-permission-toolkit/commits/5328b630a3d4e7f1119592c4a6e122baf7a16f53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:20:27Z","email":"99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"berfinyuksel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:20:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Align workflow filenames with 2026.x (#130)\n\n* Align workflow filenames with 2026.x; remove dead duplicates\n\nMigration-named new-* workflows take the default branch''s filenames so\nupstream merges map file-to-file; old copies are removed only where\nverifiably dead (retired centralized reference or retired ubuntu-20.04\nrunners). Content is the branch''s own, era-correct version - deliberately\nnot synced from 2026.x (matrix differences).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Align 2025-line workflows with 2026.x (non-matrix families)\n\nPer review of the drift map: .bak files removed, obsolete frontend/npm\nworkflows removed, cla/docs/poeditor/cs-fixer/copilot-setup/stale synced\nto the 2026.x content and filenames, and static analysis gets the uniform\npaths-ignore (assets, assets-customized, doc, install, src/Resources/public,\n**.md). Matrix-bearing workflows keep their era-specific content.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Restore trigger scoping (canary-verified pattern)\n\nSame fix as copilot-bundle 0bd53b1: static analysis scoped on push and\npull_request to version branches, matching the 2026.x canonical; other\nsuites scoped on push only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Consistency batch: agreed knobs and trigger polish\n\nPer the consistency audit and the decisions of 2026-09-03: markdown-only\nchanges skip the suites; feature-* leaves the push filters (epics get CI\nvia their PRs); static analysis pull_request aligned to version branches;\nconcurrency uniformly keyed by PR number; setup jobs at 10 minutes with an\nempty-matrix error guard; the studio frontend build no longer re-runs on\nevery PR push (its committed output directory left the pull_request paths\nwhile the push-side stale-merge detection stays exactly as designed).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc2930bf1e8860f3babcdda51746205dad8e1ea2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/frontend-permission-toolkit/git/trees/dc2930bf1e8860f3babcdda51746205dad8e1ea2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/frontend-permission-toolkit/git/commits/5328b630a3d4e7f1119592c4a6e122baf7a16f53","verification":{"payload":"tree dc2930bf1e8860f3babcdda51746205dad8e1ea2\nparent d22ba7b5828d836da735b682b06cbda3fb7c641f\nauthor berfinyuksel <99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com> 1788452427 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788452427 +0200\n\nAlign workflow filenames with 2026.x (#130)\n\n* Align workflow filenames with 2026.x; remove dead duplicates\n\nMigration-named new-* workflows take the default branch''s filenames so\nupstream merges map file-to-file; old copies are removed only where\nverifiably dead (retired centralized reference or retired ubuntu-20.04\nrunners). Content is the branch''s own, era-correct version - deliberately\nnot synced from 2026.x (matrix differences).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Align 2025-line workflows with 2026.x (non-matrix families)\n\nPer review of the drift map: .bak files removed, obsolete frontend/npm\nworkflows removed, cla/docs/poeditor/cs-fixer/copilot-setup/stale synced\nto the 2026.x content and filenames, and static analysis gets the uniform\npaths-ignore (assets, assets-customized, doc, install, src/Resources/public,\n**.md). Matrix-bearing workflows keep their era-specific content.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Restore trigger scoping (canary-verified pattern)\n\nSame fix as copilot-bundle 0bd53b1: static analysis scoped on push and\npull_request to version branches, matching the 2026.x canonical; other\nsuites scoped on push only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Consistency batch: agreed knobs and trigger polish\n\nPer the consistency audit and the decisions of 2026-09-03: markdown-only\nchanges skip the suites; feature-* leaves the push filters (epics get CI\nvia their PRs); static analysis pull_request aligned to version branches;\nconcurrency uniformly keyed by PR number; setup jobs at 10 minutes with an\nempty-matrix error guard; the studio frontend build no longer re-runs on\nevery PR push (its committed output directory left the pull_request paths\nwhile the push-side stale-merge detection stays exactly as designed).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","r