view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/9ef52d1629162cf2b486d35f172195a9fb1d02e7","node_id":"C_kwDOBfbSFNoAKDllZjUyZDE2MjkxNjJjZjJiNDg2ZDM1ZjE3MjE5NWE5ZmIxZDAyZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/0fb5683c8b17ca05a686e3ea3850fed49d43e9a8","sha":"0fb5683c8b17ca05a686e3ea3850fed49d43e9a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/commits/0fb5683c8b17ca05a686e3ea3850fed49d43e9a8"}],"sha":"9ef52d1629162cf2b486d35f172195a9fb1d02e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/commits/9ef52d1629162cf2b486d35f172195a9fb1d02e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8104246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FrozenPandaz","id":8104246,"login":"FrozenPandaz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDQyNDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/commits/0fb5683c8b17ca05a686e3ea3850fed49d43e9a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:51:38Z","email":"jasonjean1993@gmail.com","name":"Jason Jean"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:51:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(maven): split class files from resources in shared output folders (#37286)\n\n## Current Behavior\n\n`maven-resources-plugin:resources` and `maven-compiler-plugin:compile`\nboth declare the whole `target/classes` folder as their output. The same\ngoes for `testResources` / `testCompile` and `target/test-classes`.\n\nIn a batch, Nx stores outputs after the batch ends, so a resources\ntask''s cache entry captures the compiled classes too. When a module is\npartly restored from cache and partly run:\n\n- **Stale compile:** restoring a resources task writes old `.class`\nfiles with fresh timestamps. A `compile` that missed the cache then\nreports \"Nothing to compile - all classes are up to date\", because\nmaven-compiler-plugin decides by timestamps, and the stale classes are\nkept. This is what fails `should fail when unit test fails` on #37264:\nthe new failing test is never compiled.\n- **Stale resources:** a `compile` cache hit restores the whole folder\nand can overwrite newer resources.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\nCompile goals declare only `**/*.class` in their output folder, and\nresources goals declare the folder minus `**/*.class`. To support that,\n`Parameter` gains an optional `excludeGlob`, emitted as a `!` output.\n\n## Known limitation (why this is a draft)\n\n- **The compile half works today:** compile cache entries hold only\n`.class` files.\n- **The resources half does not, yet.** Nx does not honour `!`\nexclusions when the positive output pattern matches folders. Output\nexpansion returns the matched sub-folders (`com/`, `com/example/`, …),\nand the cache copies each of them whole, both when storing and when\nrestoring. So `{projectRoot}/target/classes` with\n`!{projectRoot}/target/classes/**/*.class` still stores and restores\n`A.class`. This reproduces on 23.3.0-beta.5, beta.7 and master. It needs\nan Nx core fix: expand to files only when exclusions are present, or\ndon''t copy matched folders whole.\n\nThe stale compile is reproduced end to end through Nx with the published\nplugin (`--batch=false`, cache restore of `process-resources`, then\n`compile` prints \"Nothing to compile\" and `javap` shows the old class).\nWith this change it still reproduces, because of the limitation above.\n\nAnother consideration: with compile outputs limited to `**/*.class`,\nnon-class files that annotation processors write into `target/classes`\n(for example `META-INF/services`) are no longer part of compile''s cache\nentry.\n\nTests: new `MojoAnalyzerTest` (2 cases) checks the emitted outputs.\nPlugin unit tests: 19 run, 0 failures.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n\nN/A. Part of NXC-5062. Blocks #37264, whose Maven batch e2e test fails\non this stale compile.\n\n<!-- polygraph-session-start -->\n---\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://app.trypolygraph.com/orgs/6a061dcb561c062131116eca/sessions/Fix-stale-batch-cache-hits-for-tasks-hashed-after-their-deps-22871a53\">View\nPolygraph session ↗</a></p>\n<!-- polygraph-session-end -->","tree":{"sha":"2e0196eb92164e2887bbce9ed954723c029a06bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/trees/2e0196eb92164e2887bbce9ed954723c029a06bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/commits/0fb5683c8b17ca05a686e3ea3850fed49d43e9a8","verification":{"payload":"tree 2e0196eb92164e2887bbce9ed954723c029a06bb\nparent a310000d37959e078fabed859566adc547b08fde\nauthor Jason Jean <jasonjean1993@gmail.com> 1791399098 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791399098 -0400\n\nfix(maven): split class files from resources in shared output folders (#37286)\n\n## Current Behavior\n\n`maven-resources-plugin:resources` and `maven-compiler-plugin:compile`\nboth declare the whole `target/classes` folder as their output. The same\ngoes for `testResources` / `testCompile` and `target/test-classes`.\n\nIn a batch, Nx stores outputs after the batch ends, so a resources\ntask''s cache entry captures the compiled classes too. When a module is\npartly restored from cache and partly run:\n\n- **Stale compile:** restoring a resources task writes old `.class`\nfiles with fresh timestamps. A `compile` that missed the cache then\nreports \"Nothing to compile - all classes are up to date\", because\nmaven-compiler-plugin decides by timestamps, and the stale classes are\nkept. This is what fails `should fail when unit test fails` on #37264:\nthe new failing test is never compiled.\n- **Stale resources:** a `compile` cache hit restores the whole folder\nand can overwrite newer resources.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\nCompile goals declare only `**/*.class` in their output folder, and\nresources goals declare the folder minus `**/*.class`. To support that,\n`Parameter` gains an optional `excludeGlob`, emitted as a `!` output.\n\n## Known limitation (why this is a draft)\n\n- **The compile half works today:** compile cache entries hold only\n`.class` files.\n- **The resources half does not, yet.** Nx does not honour `!`\nexclusions when the positive output pattern matches folders. Output\nexpansion returns the matched sub-folders (`com/`, `com/example/`, …),\nand the cache copies each of them whole, both when storing and when\nrestoring. So `{projectRoot}/target/classes` with\n`!{projectRoot}/target/classes/**/*.class` still stores and restores\n`A.class`. This reproduces on 23.3.0-beta.5, beta.7 and master. It needs\nan Nx core fix: expand to files only when exclusions are present, or\ndon''t copy matched folders whole.\n\nThe stale compile is reproduced end to end through Nx with the published\nplugin (`--batch=false`, cache restore of `process-resources`, then\n`compile` prints \"Nothing to compile\" and `javap` shows the old class).\nWith this change it still reproduces, because of the limitation above.\n\nAnother consideration: with compile outputs limited to `**/*.class`,\nnon-class files that annotation processors write into `target/classes`\n(for example `META-INF/services`) are no longer part of compile''s cache\nentry.\n\nTests: new `MojoAnalyzerTest` (2 cases) checks the emitted outputs.\nPlugin unit tests: 19 run, 0 failures.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n\nN/A. Part of NXC-5062. Blocks #37264, whose Maven batch e2e test fails\non this stale compile.\n\n<!-- polygraph-session-start -->\n---\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://app.trypolygraph.com/orgs/6a061dcb561c062131116eca/sessions/Fix-stale-batch-cache-hits-for-tasks-hashed-after-their-deps-22871a53\">View\nPolygraph session ↗</a></p>\n<!-- polygraph-session-end -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxpS7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAShYQAJSGu0dlVir7gAlRkEeVJExl\nvDgvYxJpapOuO6ZOEaKsVrleEqVq2325eTHFTrEYNcHhPkuHuRw+9GRUk9lBS1Fu\nH25SP3TW8rq4BCYpbAORzfJzjp2uxfkLkTEcXgpeldro3gI43uTCEkFxEaxoTutL\nSONlt7DSTzkqanMxJOxN8c45abJwW2fQVeh305CGe2gZrqZDg2k9anM6lmRocAqc\nakTYkNwAIZTWOY8v7inJwjzgwb9xHW4LZN2xLAkw447D/vv7c/BXGCrsyRC+tvdL\nWfYupM10WcALL9LFv2qjzo6DqoioZxSWXggb1z7A8ztCMvghpqyDmYsbh06UY4uT\nMqiWgFxXrAq4h6YQYKZ7Zf3hEJduZS7GKr+VZaQRXGEmxMzgxTxgUltBG+E72eqO\naXpdspVAIoMgBS1HVEi9x/RF1uVBiSzubfUDX2PH6alw53XHCJiHldgnO3RhTXPz\nSo/vRMRovsv6Aj8jNNK2fecnLis7WPqeCHDzTq21OKhBdFjPLdLqIqtWstIlcEJt\nyTV3Z2SX+XHpJKY85JDqIjiiETqVDIOxdLSq9zhXhqDNtN5kGBqFIizaDxvY3WTF\nuNLdWEn9LXiUxdPRxvXff0jAmI6sTMZ2fJWNq29t058zV2bmFgwhY1F4jos6xnqj\nGWMlF2SmiDWxmLl2qkrA\n=dpvM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T18:51:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-fl