ner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AgentEnder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AgentEnder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/commits/e09f772148e6a4c67d7ae1c4b8da4f38eefbedc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T02:01:11Z","email":"craigorycoppola@gmail.com","name":"Craigory Coppola"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T02:01:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(core): stop merging declared negations into ultracache file groups (#37304)\n\n<!-- Please make sure you have read the submission guidelines before\nposting an PR -->\n<!--\nhttps://github.com/nrwl/nx/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#-submitting-a-pr\n-->\n\n<!-- Please make sure that your commit message follows our format -->\n<!-- Example: `fix(nx): must begin with lowercase` -->\n\n<!-- If this is a particularly complex change or feature addition, you\ncan request a dedicated Nx release for this pull request branch. Mention\nsomeone from the Nx team or the `@nrwl/nx-pipelines-reviewers` and they\nwill confirm if the PR warrants its own release for testing purposes,\nand generate it for you if appropriate. -->\n\n## Current Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we have today -->\n\nWhen a task hashes from its Ultracache configuration, we replace its\ndeclared filesets with the observed reads, but still append the project\ngraph''s declared negations to each read group. A file the task actually\nread, like a `*.spec.ts` excluded by `production`, gets dropped from the\nhash.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we should expect with the changes in this PR\n-->\n\nObserved reads are the only file inputs for those tasks. Externals, env,\nruntime and the other non-file inputs still merge.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n<!-- Please link the issue being fixed so it gets closed when this is\nmerged. -->\n\nFixes #\n\n<!-- polygraph-session-start -->\n---\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://app.trypolygraph.com/orgs/6a061dcb561c062131116eca/sessions/disable-inputs-merge-c224ee62\">View\nPolygraph session ↗</a></p>\n<!-- polygraph-session-end -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nx-cloud[bot] <71083854+nx-cloud[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c502aa3da38ebad1fa13da89f6350ec1647381d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/trees/c502aa3da38ebad1fa13da89f6350ec1647381d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/commits/e09f772148e6a4c67d7ae1c4b8da4f38eefbedc6","verification":{"payload":"tree c502aa3da38ebad1fa13da89f6350ec1647381d5\nparent 21ecbd35a980db73f37c33ca7cdbcac6c9db9c7b\nauthor Craigory Coppola <craigorycoppola@gmail.com> 1791338471 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791338471 +0000\n\nfix(core): stop merging declared negations into ultracache file groups (#37304)\n\n<!-- Please make sure you have read the submission guidelines before\nposting an PR -->\n<!--\nhttps://github.com/nrwl/nx/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#-submitting-a-pr\n-->\n\n<!-- Please make sure that your commit message follows our format -->\n<!-- Example: `fix(nx): must begin with lowercase` -->\n\n<!-- If this is a particularly complex change or feature addition, you\ncan request a dedicated Nx release for this pull request branch. Mention\nsomeone from the Nx team or the `@nrwl/nx-pipelines-reviewers` and they\nwill confirm if the PR warrants its own release for testing purposes,\nand generate it for you if appropriate. -->\n\n## Current Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we have today -->\n\nWhen a task hashes from its Ultracache configuration, we replace its\ndeclared filesets with the observed reads, but still append the project\ngraph''s declared negations to each read group. A file the task actually\nread, like a `*.spec.ts` excluded by `production`, gets dropped from the\nhash.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n<!-- This is the behavior we should expect with the changes in this PR\n-->\n\nObserved reads are the only file inputs for those tasks. Externals, env,\nruntime and the other non-file inputs still merge.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n<!-- Please link the issue being fixed so it gets closed when this is\nmerged. -->\n\nFixes #\n\n<!-- polygraph-session-start -->\n---\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://app.trypolygraph.com/orgs/6a061dcb561c062131116eca/sessions/disable-inputs-merge-c224ee62\">View\nPolygraph session ↗</a></p>\n<!-- polygraph-session-end -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nx-cloud[bot] <71083854+nx-cloud[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxafnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1PoQAFqWvK3Itdl1lr6FMcc0HzhC\nfAk0UUIcnMk42O7YCs5gWgPuZsi8uqkRhjbUeG21GEO7CpCtG0bO1SUeuMefBQpD\nVWBNiqiAExCLUC589iJlGhcIb1m/iccNgRur8sxFvG6PA/x8ZKB4gq1X5wr5ynGA\nT2CoiCSfdQQ/LuqSSyr2FAGlNLGu99N1C8kPh7r7FGc5aqW+wbFcKiNVlpgmYaqh\nKaCBfW0DB2EJ4XFB0+xIWsrkW8YrRDZcdV8+lyglachsG6fuPatoNxDSs3GM55FQ\nRl44Bp6h3+i6Fg+yg5FAYtFIY/UA8AWJA5ucs4IqzMxJekFWRGYAgGfZswj7FWZ1\niHn3/hK8m144E8yTW1h5rfzeQsnuhi/k94PBxCqtQApqZIICxJokObdcjhFO5QAK\n9Nxn1JIuW2WsoeHTqNLrMUksDbZY0gM1KmS5Zd+x1IeBOU6VTcoBr7q8/7Ne94Y4\nhTiu1dItW9yDIn+r/GcbtNKoMMLiFRNmItwkPMNDAl0Usy743OCJz1Ek4PM/sYxp\nWZBOv/x/sc+wjaYhCXH2+URbceOQrH6/haKTvKMbApao9ItOS3EW2knHj93qeoyq\ntX4JLYXwvpW7K5cd/ALKsghADjlVgu5r2xI1xCwlMmiAh3taxHWcti2n0pbxSgV0\nT7JCfIMI/IyVFoFocWUq\n=lZ7H\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T02:01:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/e09f772148e6a4c67d7ae1c4b8da4f38eefbedc6","node_id":"C_kwDOBfbSFNoAKGUwOWY3NzIxNDhlNmE0YzY3ZDdhZTFjNGI4ZGE0ZjM4ZWVmYmVkYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nrwl/nx/commit/21ecbd35a980db73f37c33ca7cdbcac6c9db9c7b","sha":"21ecbd35a980db73f37c33ca7cdbcac6c9db9c7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/commits/21ecbd35a980db73f37c33ca7cdbcac6c9db9c7b"}],"sha":"e09f772148e6a4c67d7ae1c4b8da4f38eefbedc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/commits/e09f772148e6a4c67d7ae1c4b8da4f38eefbedc6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8104246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FrozenPandaz","id":8104246,"login":"FrozenPandaz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDQyNDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/commits/21ecbd35a980db73f37c33ca7cdbcac6c9db9c7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:36:26Z","email":"jasonjean1993@gmail.com","name":"Jason Jean"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:36:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(repo): hash local registry storage from sources again (#37303)\n\n## Current Behavior\n\nSince #37256, `@nx/nx-source:populate-local-registry-storage` hashes its\ndependencies'' built outputs transitively (`{\n\"dependentTasksOutputFiles\": \"**/*\", \"transitive\": true }`). That walk\nreaches `maven-batch-runner:_package`, which is not cacheable. Its\n`target/*.jar` files only exist on agents that ran it.\n\nNx Cloud can start the storage task while `_package` is re-running on\nthe same agent. `./mvnw clean package` wipes `target/` first, so the\njars hash as \"no files matched\". The storage task misses the cache, and\nso does `populate-e2e-base-workspace` downstream.\n\nExample (#37301, same commit run twice): on Agent 0 · linux-extra-large,\n`_package` started at +20m32s and the storage task at +20m37s. The jar\ninput hashed as `3244421341483603138` (empty) instead of\n`4345167478345995378`.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\n`populate-local-registry-storage` hashes sources again: `production` of\n`tag:npm:public` plus `native`, as it did before #37256. Those are the\nsame on every agent, so the storage task and\n`populate-e2e-base-workspace` stop missing the cache because of agent\ntiming.\n\nThe rest of #37256 is unchanged: `ultracache` settings,\n`populate-e2e-base-workspace` inputs, `--exclude-task-dependencies`.\n\nTrade-off: a source change that doesn''t change any built file rebuilds\nthe registry again, as before #37256.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n\nN/A\n\nThe root cause is in the Nx Cloud scheduler: it can run a task alongside\na non-cacheable prerequisite the task needs on the same agent, when\ncacheable tasks sit in between. That''s tracked in CLOUD-5658, which this\nPR does **not** resolve. It only stops this repo from hashing files that\nrace.\n\n<!-- polygraph-session-start -->\n---\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://app.trypolygraph.com/orgs/6a061dcb561c062131116eca/sessions/Hash-local-registry-storage-from-sources-again-11d44cdc\">View\nPolygraph session ↗</a></p>\n<!-- polygraph-session-end -->","tree":{"sha":"1fd89018a0db77757fbe47fb27f542eaa28192f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/trees/1fd89018a0db77757fbe47fb27f542eaa28192f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/commits/21ecbd35a980db73f37c33ca7cdbcac6c9db9c7b","verification":{"payload":"tree 1fd89018a0db77757fbe47fb27f542eaa28192f1\nparent a37b5ca4c6630bb9ea5df9ac0546edc3a186bc2f\nauthor Jason Jean <jasonjean1993@gmail.com> 1791326186 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791326186 -0400\n\nfix(repo): hash local registry storage from sources again (#37303)\n\n## Current Behavior\n\nSince #37256, `@nx/nx-source:populate-local-registry-storage` hashes its\ndependencies'' built outputs transitively (`{\n\"dependentTasksOutputFiles\": \"**/*\", \"transitive\": true }`). That walk\nreaches `maven-batch-runner:_package`, which is not cacheable. Its\n`target/*.jar` files only exist on agents that ran it.\n\nNx Cloud can start the storage task while `_package` is re-running on\nthe same agent. `./mvnw clean package` wipes `target/` first, so the\njars hash as \"no files matched\". The storage task misses the cache, and\nso does `populate-e2e-base-workspace` downstream.\n\nExample (#37301, same commit run twice): on Agent 0 · linux-extra-large,\n`_package` started at +20m32s and the storage task at +20m37s. The jar\ninput hashed as `3244421341483603138` (empty) instead of\n`4345167478345995378`.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\n`populate-local-registry-storage` hashes sources again: `production` of\n`tag:npm:public` plus `native`, as it did before #37256. Those are the\nsame on every agent, so the storage task and\n`populate-e2e-base-workspace` stop missing the cache because of agent\ntiming.\n\nThe rest of #37256 is unchanged: `ultracache` settings,\n`populate-e2e-base-workspace` inputs, `--exclude-task-dependencies`.\n\nTrade-off: a source change that doesn''t change any built file rebuilds\nthe registry again, as before #37256.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n\nN/A\n\nThe root cause is in the Nx Cloud scheduler: it can run a task alongside\na non-cacheable prerequisite the task needs on the same agent, when\ncacheable tasks sit in between. That''s tracked in CLOUD-5658, which this\nPR does **not** resolve. It only stops this repo from hashing files that\nrace.\n\n<!-- polygraph-session-start -->\n---\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://app.trypolygraph.com/orgs/6a061dcb561c062131116eca/sessions/Hash-local-registry-storage-from-sources-again-11d44cdc\">View\nPolygraph session ↗</a></p>\n<!-- polygraph-session-end -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxXfqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3fcQAK5Zb84PJ1nJ1vLXpi8ibRUW\n65OcMR048oMxT1PO0HnRIUVIiqssoIevziGJHLndpWk4AFuqTxjg7n1zno03VnBC\n+N36e8B71e9RBgfu92XHiNaPd+ErRTtAfNK5mbIKNrS6piADf56ptCHTxcHT/gZz\nPGVLRANmDiDJ7eZMsSPIP1Zg/97Mhy6wVw+JTkG7PgSghBcCDz5F5B017KFJaoZx\nc0zZ1BVgUUyQT2kwDJUzAlf+a5L2HywrSBmP8v7AavaHwMmA424fygT/AhD1UKbG\nDv4YejqktXbTHWD/pUxf4yD5k9mEyXLIN286W02PCAqzTL/ad/0TSz85fQmU3agS\nYmOPktXeJTsTLVWDWjbf/rgwIFGEu808ahwKDyJR4tJSQGHWUcktlKIEfgv+4POt\nd6yn9/F/Ww7ml0Lo+ewItfsDhiGC1HZF0HS0o1lrRBB41uN1cSmiHgTgxN1lXjIj\nxptQm3lIqiFF1rxAke0T3nWBxnuIU1TKsrVk4p/ZVHbcqdKkiw/QAkzv1h+F8wM9\nn+vN9PRD7iRUYt5PZS8OBU3BTRwYI2e2zU34YER66iSOnWk9A079nliG+Uwssscu\ntuopz9powzJF1BIIrkHyrKlSb65Fz+qNQjmADXK1AGT1WxaALvLlc+wTvIXSs6Do\nwgZ7/gwYfCNmRw0YyrUI\n=1bSD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T22:36:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/we