gration guide runs `node\ndist/apps/<app>/server/server.js` from the workspace root. On Rspack,\nthe generated `server.ts` resolves `dist` from the working directory, so\nthe server fails with `ENOENT .../browser/index.html`.\n\n## Expected Behavior\nThe guide and its LLM prompt tell Rspack apps to run the server from\n`apps/<app>`. Webpack is unchanged.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\nNXC-4993\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","tree":{"sha":"20158c0d9a0bb83e29c66a6f11cf09a700ee243d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/trees/20158c0d9a0bb83e29c66a6f11cf09a700ee243d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/commits/2be98fb331359150a9e7042310be992b52d7e0cf","verification":{"payload":"tree 20158c0d9a0bb83e29c66a6f11cf09a700ee243d\nparent dca2aecb8fea4978390f94ca9eefdb91b56452a2\nauthor Jack Hsu <jack.hsu@gmail.com> 1791307171 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791307171 -0400\n\ndocs(misc): run rspack ssr static server from the app directory (#37300)\n\n## Current Behavior\nThe React SSR migration guide runs `node\ndist/apps/<app>/server/server.js` from the workspace root. On Rspack,\nthe generated `server.ts` resolves `dist` from the working directory, so\nthe server fails with `ENOENT .../browser/index.html`.\n\n## Expected Behavior\nThe guide and its LLM prompt tell Rspack apps to run the server from\n`apps/<app>`. Webpack is unchanged.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\nNXC-4993\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxS2kCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJWUQADoISyh/FvOYr9joEOCDvJG+\nRXfQ0xP4oBkszUaJeMtOoWd6/81SfS+ixOuJpXVIy3jxdUFLUMX0wia7Ez75xCUA\nOVq6/BdYC7HpXifu+TInAqttbKv7sk7vC24qtBqaJpfkylH/vlkvUyuizTVeMTpa\nzVFsZO/96IOwp/sKQ4KTnx0i7djESjaq7SznC+yg1lY8AktQbqY8dziITpO6YZQH\nv9f6EO70meyMra1h/zFWOtYjS2+R0cz0jk7+PUl6uYOrkloK2y4rRsVUGgFMFmQ/\nj3EY6bE4DY+r3IGEYluZj7opmrr+AwpzBUHb/990xUNdgONKhPDZ8PMkCOAM7IRN\nQGq/Y0O9RuFqcQwoL8lzBJODQ7