wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FrozenPandaz","id":8104246,"login":"FrozenPandaz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDQyNDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/commits/ab845a8298971eeed8752b2f41b06bbbf13cce82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T18:25:47Z","email":"jasonjean1993@gmail.com","name":"Jason Jean"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T18:25:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(repo): migrate to nx 23.3.0-beta.9 (#37256)\n\n## Current Behavior\n\nThe repo is on nx `23.3.0-beta.5`. CI selects affected work by whole\nproject and hashes tasks from declared inputs only: no CI env sets\n`NX_CLOUD_USE_ULTRACACHE`, so Nx Cloud neither records nor applies\nUltracache configurations even though the workspace has Ultracache\nenabled.\n\n`.nx/workflows/sandboxing-config.yaml` excludes every read and write of\n`@nx/nx-source:populate-local-registry-storage`, so a recording of it\nwould have no reads and every branch would hash the same.\n\n`populate-local-registry-storage` and `populate-e2e-base-workspace` hash\nthe `production` sources of every `npm:public` project plus `native`,\nnot the built files they actually publish.\n`populate-local-registry-storage` also re-runs the whole build graph\ninside itself through `nx nx-release`, which can rewrite `dist` files\nmid-task.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\n- nx and all `@nx/*` packages are on `23.3.0-beta.9`. The four\n`@nx/cypress` Cypress 16 migrations in this range are no-ops here:\n`graph/client-e2e` uses none of the removed APIs. There are no\nmigrations from beta.8 to beta.9.\n- Restores the non-version changes from #37202 (reverted in #37236):\n- `NX_LEGACY_AFFECTED=false` in the root `.env`, so `nx affected`\nselects tasks whose inputs changed. `.gitignore` gets a `!/.env`\nexception.\n- `NX_CLOUD_USE_ULTRACACHE: ''true''` in the CI workflow env and the Nx\nAgents env (the beta.8+ name; #37242 dropped\n`NX_CLOUD_USE_IO_SNAPSHOTS`), so CI records and hashes tasks from\nUltracache configurations.\n- From #37235: the `''**''` sandboxing exclusions for\n`populate-local-registry-storage` are removed.\n- The local registry targets hash what they publish:\n- `populate-local-registry-storage`: `{ \"dependentTasksOutputFiles\":\n\"**/*\", \"transitive\": true }` replaces `production` for `npm:public` and\n`native`. `transitive` is needed because `nx:build` only outputs\n`dist/bin/nx.js` and the README; the rest comes from `build-base`,\n`copy-assets` and `build-native`. Maven `production` stays, since\nnx-release builds the jars itself.\n- `populate-e2e-base-workspace`: drops `production` (`npm:public`) and\n`native`; its dependency''s output (the registry storage) already holds\nthe built packages.\n- `populate-local-registry-storage` runs its inner `nx nx-release` with\n`--exclude-task-dependencies`. The target already depends on every\nbuild, so the task no longer rebuilds or restores `dist` itself. The e2e\nglobal setup path and `pnpm nx-release` still build first.\n- Both local registry targets use `ultracache.mode: \"warn\"`: they hash\nfrom the declared inputs above and keep recording.\n- `populate-e2e-base-workspace` installs packages from verdaccio over\nHTTP, so a recording never sees the registry storage; under `on` a\nrepublished registry kept its hash and restored a base workspace whose\nlockfiles failed the integrity check.\n- `populate-local-registry-storage` reads what it publishes from disk,\nbut its recording was still changing between runs; `warn` keeps its hash\nstable for the e2e tasks downstream until the recordings settle.\n- Bumps the `nx.json` cache bust.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n\nSupersedes #37235. Restores the reverted parts of #37202.\n\n<!-- polygraph-session-start -->\n---\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://app.trypolygraph.com/orgs/6a061dcb561c062131116eca/sessions/Migrate-repos-to-nx-23.3.0-beta.8-cae726fc\">View\nPolygraph session ↗</a></p>\n<!-- polygraph-session-end -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nx-cloud[bot] <71083854+nx-cloud[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc154651040992b3d0dc8962c2f0aaba00e5b104","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/trees/dc154651040992b3d0dc8962c2f0aaba00e5b104"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/commits/ab845a8298971eeed8752b2f41b06bbbf13cce82","verification":{"payload":"tree dc154651040992b3d0dc8962c2f0aaba00e5b104\nparent c241c3c5d5c0b241fe24f1817bc8aa7f10962818\nauthor Jason Jean <jasonjean1993@gmail.com> 1791224747 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791224747 +0000\n\nchore(repo): migrate to nx 23.3.0-beta.9 (#37256)\n\n## Current Behavior\n\nThe repo is on nx `23.3.0-beta.5`. CI selects affected work by whole\nproject and hashes tasks from declared inputs only: no CI env sets\n`NX_CLOUD_USE_ULTRACACHE`, so Nx Cloud neither records nor applies\nUltracache configurations even though the workspace has Ultracache\nenabled.\n\n`.nx/workflows/sandboxing-config.yaml` excludes every read and write of\n`@nx/nx-source:populate-local-registry-storage`, so a recording of it\nwould have no reads and every branch would hash the same.\n\n`populate-local-registry-storage` and `populate-e2e-base-workspace` hash\nthe `production` sources of every `npm:public` project plus `native`,\nnot the built files they actually publish.\n`populate-local-registry-storage` also re-runs the whole build graph\ninside itself through `nx nx-release`, which can rewrite `dist` files\nmid-task.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\n- nx and all `@nx/*` packages are on `23.3.0-beta.9`. The four\n`@nx/cypress` Cypress 16 migrations in this range are no-ops here:\n`graph/client-e2e` uses none of the removed APIs. There are no\nmigrations from beta.8 to beta.9.\n- Restores the non-version changes from #37202 (reverted in #37236):\n- `NX_LEGACY_AFFECTED=false` in the root `.env`, so `nx affected`\nselects tasks whose inputs changed. `.gitignore` gets a `!/.env`\nexception.\n- `NX_CLOUD_USE_ULTRACACHE: ''true''` in the CI workflow env and the Nx\nAgents env (the beta.8+ name; #37242 dropped\n`NX_CLOUD_USE_IO_SNAPSHOTS`), so CI records and hashes tasks from\nUltracache configurations.\n- From #37235: the `''**''` sandboxing exclusions for\n`populate-local-registry-storage` are removed.\n- The local registry targets hash what they publish:\n- `populate-local-registry-storage`: `{ \"dependentTasksOutputFiles\":\n\"**/*\", \"transitive\": true }` replaces `production` for `npm:public` and\n`native`. `transitive` is needed because `nx:build` only outputs\n`dist/bin/nx.js` and the README; the rest comes from `build-base`,\n`copy-assets` and `build-native`. Maven `production` stays, since\nnx-release builds the jars itself.\n- `populate-e2e-base-workspace`: drops `production` (`npm:public`) and\n`native`; its dependency''s output (the registry storage) already holds\nthe built packages.\n- `populate-local-registry-storage` runs its inner `nx nx-release` with\n`--exclude-task-dependencies`. The target already depends on every\nbuild, so the task no longer rebuilds or restores `dist` itself. The e2e\nglobal setup path and `pnpm nx-release` still build first.\n- Both local registry targets use `ultracache.mode: \"warn\"`: they hash\nfrom the declared inputs above and keep recording.\n- `populate-e2e-base-workspace` installs packages from verdaccio over\nHTTP, so a recording never sees the registry storage; under `on` a\nrepublished registry kept its hash and restored a base workspace whose\nlockfiles failed the integrity check.\n- `populate-local-registry-storage` reads what it publishes from disk,\nbut its recording was still changing between runs; `warn` keeps its hash\nstable for the e2e tasks downstream until the recordings settle.\n- Bumps the `nx.json` cache bust.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n\nSupersedes #37235. Restores the reverted parts of #37202.\n\n<!-- polygraph-session-start -->\n---\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://app.trypolygraph.com/orgs/6a061dcb561c062131116eca/sessions/Migrate-repos-to-nx-23.3.0-beta.8-cae726fc\">View\nPolygraph session ↗</a></p>\n<!-- polygraph-session-end -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nx-cloud[bot] <71083854+nx-cloud[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw+urCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyFMQACItQFSOvuNyRfRgQ+Ap/DOg\nf8dO1d6jYP14Lrn/LXnhAkbaz1q3z4dw52uIizepAH0Xpv39HdNmOzsEWUcE1mcv\nKh3GqJLrifVeVYPj9Gg51ieKdX9ySZsY4Au1ZvAST/IitPRh7Gik/k622UY9em8O\nY2A3iMzcrxlyY2ina6Yv67lJizcp14CtrgS+FLC1EBuZsuPCJ9D2L8rnCbTjBC+0\nnMZO3fXM+RbT+uYSNY+Xao93PLpDoSvA9xxD4ZmHSEocGWgpeEpKtpChLHTzgHpK\n4T4qo3lwulLAJm+5g/zeOBdI7tLUiQSWWf7DP3gQKYf2QbbiCi/DeuvI8V+/ek0z\niGU2KC16oyRNimoLBvPHGHKorswy9CBvxNhQK80EFaJvDqqu1N41zg2QLhxaJr1s\nTDfDQsoLPbgl1kH8PeRjeIRf1gylIV9igCCN+Eh5Y8JVp/xOB3Xc1eXuVTAPGuWg\nMQh0hrYjYo2FLwAwDazgtAONmSxUvs0rgCgBhjNiUyC1KmUu4fDsQuSCkviuzMao\ndjExkctlYUjE0kK9fU9+h7/SSKVzgF/gq80Oz9dADU23rIr0IzZCW0dF/CAyImv1\n7clIjEu8u9mczElvU62IM/v9wx0uwNR0rUJzpqwZyXI5DfQJ08UoFQyvwVo1nH6R\nYPpv7D1KGBrsPxnnQH2F\n=/vgz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T18:25:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/u