rl":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FrozenPandaz","id":8104246,"login":"FrozenPandaz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDQyNDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrozenPandaz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/commits/d5b5b55053e279172132aaa8d0215ac3c264e211/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T18:35:05Z","email":"jasonjean1993@gmail.com","name":"Jason Jean"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T18:35:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(core): turn ultracache on with NX_CLOUD_USE_ULTRACACHE (#37242)\n\n## Current Behavior\n\nnx hashes tasks from Ultracache recordings when a CI run sets\n`NX_IO_SNAPSHOTS=true` or `NX_CLOUD_USE_IO_SNAPSHOTS=true`. The Nx Cloud\nclient has since renamed its switch to `NX_CLOUD_USE_ULTRACACHE`\n(keeping `NX_CLOUD_USE_IO_SNAPSHOTS` as a fallback), so a workspace\nusing the new name gets recordings made but nx never hashes from them.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\n`NX_CLOUD_USE_ULTRACACHE=true` is the one switch, the same name the\nclient uses. The pre-release names `NX_IO_SNAPSHOTS` and\n`NX_CLOUD_USE_IO_SNAPSHOTS` are dropped; neither shipped in a stable\nrelease (nx 23.2.1 has no snapshot hashing).\n\n- `io-snapshots/config.ts`: `isIoSnapshotFetchEnabled` and\n`ioSnapshotEnv` read only `NX_CLOUD_USE_ULTRACACHE`; still CI only, in a\nworkspace that uses Nx Cloud.\n- Specs use the new name, plus a case that the old names no longer turn\nit on.\n- Docs: the environment-variables entry moves from `NX_IO_SNAPSHOTS` in\nthe Nx table to `NX_CLOUD_USE_ULTRACACHE` in the Nx Cloud table, and the\nlinks in `inputs`, `configure-inputs` and `project-configuration`\nfollow.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n\nN/A\n\n<!-- polygraph-session-start -->\n---\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://app.trypolygraph.com/orgs/6a061dcb561c062131116eca/sessions/NXC-4846-snapshot-resolution-in-Nx-core-618d13d8\">View\nPolygraph session ↗</a></p>\n<!-- polygraph-session-end -->","tree":{"sha":"c7711a14f4c2826aea7b32b0b2294a81c0804602","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/trees/c7711a14f4c2826aea7b32b0b2294a81c0804602"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/commits/d5b5b55053e279172132aaa8d0215ac3c264e211","verification":{"payload":"tree c7711a14f4c2826aea7b32b0b2294a81c0804602\nparent 312adb6b1abc4c29e8076e82258c8f4b88900099\nauthor Jason Jean <jasonjean1993@gmail.com> 1790879705 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790879705 -0400\n\nfeat(core): turn ultracache on with NX_CLOUD_USE_ULTRACACHE (#37242)\n\n## Current Behavior\n\nnx hashes tasks from Ultracache recordings when a CI run sets\n`NX_IO_SNAPSHOTS=true` or `NX_CLOUD_USE_IO_SNAPSHOTS=true`. The Nx Cloud\nclient has since renamed its switch to `NX_CLOUD_USE_ULTRACACHE`\n(keeping `NX_CLOUD_USE_IO_SNAPSHOTS` as a fallback), so a workspace\nusing the new name gets recordings made but nx never hashes from them.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\n`NX_CLOUD_USE_ULTRACACHE=true` is the one switch, the same name the\nclient uses. The pre-release names `NX_IO_SNAPSHOTS` and\n`NX_CLOUD_USE_IO_SNAPSHOTS` are dropped; neither shipped in a stable\nrelease (nx 23.2.1 has no snapshot hashing).\n\n- `io-snapshots/config.ts`: `isIoSnapshotFetchEnabled` and\n`ioSnapshotEnv` read only `NX_CLOUD_USE_ULTRACACHE`; still CI only, in a\nworkspace that uses Nx Cloud.\n- Specs use the new name, plus a case that the old names no longer turn\nit on.\n- Docs: the environment-variables entry moves from `NX_IO_SNAPSHOTS` in\nthe Nx table to `NX_CLOUD_USE_ULTRACACHE` in the Nx Cloud table, and the\nlinks in `inputs`, `configure-inputs` and `project-configuration`\nfollow.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n\nN/A\n\n<!-- polygraph-session-start -->\n---\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://app.trypolygraph.com/orgs/6a061dcb561c062131116eca/sessions/NXC-4846-snapshot-resolution-in-Nx-core-618d13d8\">View\nPolygraph session ↗</a></p>\n<!-- polygraph-session-end -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvqfZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAN5AQAKGwMWRB9z/XHrfuEpjlSZDB\nl2sg02h1R7MX+rhTGRycLk2wOzw0Dh+FJVgZtZ/00VUcnMBOg+06gPxjeqPw5Dh9\nhtfC1XSyPq1A+FNxbVtI2mfPy6ju9olXFyo+FPiN7BRx0sLW7yIELtcUv20P/Pv7\nrkpf6ellBOjm9zeGlR62oTSz3ejkgvnyOOPGSVtHiiQhoyt9g9Bcz71Dmg2lF0j7\nrUEXIYvLI2N/LsJ0X9Uk4v2Eoe21dnNe0opRg4hCWTPQZgZZgaAPsbNEOlo5POl+\nS0BC8B18okPHjkDranmAEKWrXhDBvoXuvVvja1+rXtOjnqeUxajI4FHCYLGSSsaE\naBM5EvJUPcbaRG++/ImgD9maVF57hkgxXh/hWWeTWk+dIJERmGYa/+WKZPIrYQ++\nGVbzAXDe8ZCc6p/4VDqz6xvDt5UrLNj5x7gviasZCqiOSdZzg4npiEJzyN4zaGJi\nEKEO1PAe8xXyBvpNekY8ooYTFcuCGmWSLNs+VUrFqCPznCmsR3QbRm2vzZ8P4tU8\nlYTNT2kBAW8tvKGKjUWddhQNEAIl5AOdjx0bBkuxSVv/wHRYWJLDdap9UGRK/L+p\n/lAGWK/6QTlLQAwcJ4NtpCnPpP+xA6TPFJTXapp7MS7WAR73Sy6TdGHfXeVVlWch\neSuM9wM7BmQW/PNQIErF\n=bOXX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T18:35:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos",