},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:29:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(core): nx plugin submission [@seriouslag/nx-openapi-ts-plugin] (#36251)\n\n## Plugin submission: `@seriouslag/nx-openapi-ts-plugin`\n\nNx plugin for\n[`@hey-api/openapi-ts`](https://github.com/hey-api/openapi-ts) —\nprovides generators and executors for OpenAPI TypeScript client code\ngeneration, plus inferred targets via a project graph plugin.\n\n- **npm:**\nhttps://www.npmjs.com/package/@seriouslag/nx-openapi-ts-plugin\n- **Repository:** https://github.com/seriouslag/openapi-ts-nx-plugin\n\n### Listing criteria\n\n- ✅ Automated e2e tests run in CI on every push\n([ci.yml](https://github.com/seriouslag/openapi-ts-nx-plugin/blob/main/.github/workflows/ci.yml))\n— the e2e suite runs real codegen against the built plugin output\n- ✅ `@nx/devkit` is a direct dependency (`^23.0.0`)\n- ✅ `nx` is not a direct or peer dependency\n- ✅ `repository.url` is set in `package.json`\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","tree":{"sha":"b576fa56900a571f5510977d095f6cd988dd5307","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/trees/b576fa56900a571f5510977d095f6cd988dd5307"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/commits/312adb6b1abc4c29e8076e82258c8f4b88900099","verification":{"payload":"tree b576fa56900a571f5510977d095f6cd988dd5307\nparent 5c91c94976a02595f1c61bbf2fd45117a21a93fb\nauthor Landon Gavin <landon.gavin@gmail.com> 1790861373 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790861373 -0400\n\nchore(core): nx plugin submission [@seriouslag/nx-openapi-ts-plugin] (#36251)\n\n## Plugin submission: `@seriouslag/nx-openapi-ts-plugin`\n\nNx plugin for\n[`@hey-api/openapi-ts`](https://github.com/hey-api/openapi-ts) —\nprovides generators and executors for OpenAPI TypeScript client code\ngeneration, plus inferred targets via a project graph plugin.\n\n- **npm:**\nhttps://www.npmjs.com/package/@seriouslag/nx-openapi-ts-plugin\n- **Repository:** https://github.com/seriouslag/openapi-ts-nx-plugin\n\n### Listing criteria\n\n- ✅ Automated e2e tests run in CI on every push\n([ci.yml](https://github.com/seriouslag/openapi-ts-nx-plugin/blob/main/.github/workflows/ci.yml))\n— the e2e suite runs real codegen against the built plugin output\n- ✅ `@nx/devkit` is a direct dependency (`^23.0.0`)\n- ✅ `nx` is not a direct or peer dependency\n- ✅ `repository.url` is set in `package.json`\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvmA9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4VIQAJMBBDXjJXilKQ5WuajepWhP\nnDGhJPH6z+NyR8JJQ/Tnkw/PYa4FsP64XNwWbNFvrgqSlULtlrrcDYMn/d9CN5D5\nmVhKq5THbPj2I/FWqSQwZoQ0zST2UDiMuJ28U3adNUPGSsuMPpsQY2uhwYwk+Qqe\nrzLJ/CBC9KVKFW4BKUhfcZTxCsskFnPHRuaTUg8SzIoNY1+I9adD4Ri4xZgwAuM1\nki6uC7vTbvLDkiio8IcoZ8xjhNeFhTf8DrmA3ASMaVt8zr2cUResKxAQVvKsEwVj\n3ezLqLUF88vNPUkCfsoKnt/KFN4J+wIRWQgZe691v4Ck6tK8S9AxTU7/88co59a3\noNDcp+WBgJfWv9eenuYZ2hJLUYtQsQXhWZUAjqhDP7T1n/j3wmOhe2jt3ZEmYPQl\nol6lj9wH0Lbc9/HDGOjnnCKmvBewBzrsFwLVQjtdSF4GXaFcyFesWMrjdh7PjYWK\nbUPfOhaDWZlDjmSmVaosM7rNyCe2oNDhF1V4lgBwYPa6PfwpPX+jVGR7inh2Kxz8\npp/zC6cgc5aWbpE41DuZ1xKH82w+Mwan2GXXsn2SbEy4cRXWKfFzE/BPVjoH7Vji\nemhc67+q7+Cj0BLvpCA6Nlk/Ouy5dJl7mzx8wedllHaGa79syQcUn9fJzK3SHsmm\nmi1lw/b2f+ENcry5AlkY\n=M33w\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T13:29:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_