beside the package''s `package.json`.\n`@angular-devkit/schematics/tools` resolves normally under node (the\npackage has no exports map).\n\n### Hand fixes\n\n- **Missing exports mocked as `undefined`** (`format-files-nx-skew`,\n`ignore-nx-skew`, `e2e-web-server-info-utils`,\n`find-plugin-for-config-file`). Vitest throws when code reads an export\nthat a mock factory did not return. An older nx''s CJS module reads that\nexport as `undefined`, so the factories now list those names as\n`undefined`. The skew specs'' \"guards the simulation itself\" checks read\nthe mocked module through `await import` rather than `require` (which\nbypasses `vi.mock`). The jest-only `{ virtual: true }` mock option is\ngone.\n- **`jest.isolateModules`** in `config-utils.spec.ts` →\n`vi.resetModules()` + `vi.doMock` + dynamic `import()`, with `doUnmock`\nin `finally`.\n- **Real `ensurePackage` under test** (`ensure-package.spec.ts`,\n`package-json.spec.ts`). The shared setup stubs `ensurePackage` at its\nsource path, and these specs test that function directly, so they\n`vi.unmock(''./package-json'')`. Jest''s setup only mocked the `@nx/devkit`\nspecifier, so these specs always ran the real code.\n- **Unit-test workspace root is an empty scratch dir**\n(`installed-version`, `version-floor`). The resolvable-package case now\nresolves `semver` from the spec''s directory. The two\n`FsTree(workspaceRoot)` cases seed an in-memory `package.json` (nothing\nis written to disk).\n- **Latent test bug** in `add-plugin.spec.ts`: `fail(''Should have thrown\nan error'')` sat inside a `try { } catch {}`. `fail` is not defined, so\nthe `ReferenceError` was swallowed, and the test would have passed even\nif nothing threw. It now asserts `.rejects.toThrow()` (and passes).\n- `vi.fn<Promise<string>, []>()` → `vi.fn<() => Promise<string>>()` in\n`require-esm-race.spec.ts`. Jest''s generic arity was left behind by the\ncodemod.\n- Stale jest-specific comments were updated (`format-files.spec.ts`,\n`ignore-nx-skew.spec.ts`, `config-utils.spec.ts`).\n- `update-deep-imports.spec.ts` is untouched: its `jest.*` hits are\nfixture strings for the migration.\n\n### Snapshots\n\n- `generate-files.spec.ts.snap`: the only change is the `// Vitest\nSnapshot` header. Snapshot values match (6/6 keys, 0 value diffs).\n- Inline `toThrowErrorMatchingInlineSnapshot`: format-only (`\"msg\"` →\n`[Error: msg]`).\n- `aggregate-log-util.spec.ts` inline snapshots: the bold ANSI codes\n(`[1m`/`[22m`) Jest recorded are gone. The shared setup pins\n`NO_COLOR=1`, and the text is otherwise identical.\n\n### Verification\n\n- `nx run-many -t test,build,lint,oxlint,build-base,copy-assets -p\ndevkit jest --skip-nx-cache` passes. `jest` (packages/jest) is the\nstill-on-jest canary: 437 tests.\n- `nx sync:check` is clean. Two repeat `nx test devkit --skip-nx-cache`\nruns are green (601/601).\n- `CONTRIBUTING.md` vitest note lists `packages/devkit`.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n\nN/A\n\n<!-- polygraph-session-start -->\n---\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://app.trypolygraph.com/orgs/6a061dcb561c062131116eca/sessions/Run-rspack-and-rsbuild-unit-tests-with-vitest-4a161f55\">View\nPolygraph session ↗</a></p>\n<!-- polygraph-session-end -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nx-cloud[bot] <71083854+nx-cloud[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqt93JCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGX8QAIlBFU4ZWZNOTtuX7n/KTo3c\nwIjWLnT7BkM3F/GpqCzDKgsodFBPSBh4/IrMe/0kfMEWxbvkHmobAj/GPqgoj3rR\niPmcDlDyaZ3WjG3WfqBb8sYb8clvKWO5LjtE6C936pG+7gi1RyEgW9CpL/XijsyV\nP1g0KB06irRLV+87rzC6KPnQNsMcwG00Z/vq4DLZsn6Oez/5n5KDXWpKoH0KRLIL\nibQFh09CuuWtwJ9O7EeZ5xVgzdrkBW8EYRk9MgUyBdy1m8m/aMRYix/RNtdoNB5A\n3OsHRtIUfm4aiqlmo1S3AJ63jYd1CiS86T3JdkzgHCUywCB0vYXVqhVivLB3ZfSI\n7XGZU8xY1Qra1TPrd05CklHykpMqAh52B/zUeVjYwWoc/lnwbd7GeEtxzaN6CWCn\nx+wifM2k544bSWmYGhtPEBcUdycgIq9GIZV3doi8hX/i36VSS6SFhowVbTl668QC\nnEixCo0S6Eo41eNtQyztcljUpNRCVjAFRDujU9PTLIqv59PMwbZFv4f1debA595J\n8lGtexVVF5/1K47RgvHUQdu3+rv6rxN/8GdFXZNlGbQg