docs/getting-started/setup-ci\n-\nhttps://deploy-preview-37161--nx-docs.netlify.app/docs/features/ci-features/distribute-task-execution\n(before/after diagrams, dynamic task packing)\n-\nhttps://deploy-preview-37161--nx-docs.netlify.app/docs/features/ci-features\n-\nhttps://deploy-preview-37161--nx-docs.netlify.app/docs/concepts/ci-concepts/building-blocks-fast-ci\n(parallelization page folded in, static partitioning)\n\nSecondary (new KB articles, reference entries, link and minor text\nupdates):\n\n-\nhttps://deploy-preview-37161--nx-docs.netlify.app/docs/kb/ci-workflow-examples\n(new, non-GitHub providers from the old kb/setup-ci)\n-\nhttps://deploy-preview-37161--nx-docs.netlify.app/docs/kb/affected-base-commit\n(new, base commit per provider from the old kb/setup-ci)\n-\nhttps://deploy-preview-37161--nx-docs.netlify.app/docs/features/ci-features/remote-cache\n(cost line, related guides)\n-\nhttps://deploy-preview-37161--nx-docs.netlify.app/docs/features/ci-features/affected\n(related guides)\n-\nhttps://deploy-preview-37161--nx-docs.netlify.app/docs/features/ci-features/self-healing-ci\n(related guides)\n-\nhttps://deploy-preview-37161--nx-docs.netlify.app/docs/kb/assignment-rules\n(parallelism scoped to own compute)\n-\nhttps://deploy-preview-37161--nx-docs.netlify.app/docs/reference/nx-cloud/ci-config#dtescheduling-constraints\n-\nhttps://deploy-preview-37161--nx-docs.netlify.app/docs/reference/nx-cloud-cli#--scheduling-constraints\n-\nhttps://deploy-preview-37161--nx-docs.netlify.app/docs/reference/glossary#dynamic-task-packing\n(new term, `Nx.FeatureNames` vale rule)\n- 14 pages moved to `/docs/kb/` with redirects and unchanged content,\ne.g.\nhttps://deploy-preview-37161--nx-docs.netlify.app/docs/kb/sandboxing\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n\nDOC-713\nDOC-714\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","tree":{"sha":"e7af1dd4ca9699e2316d3811686a956128c552d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/trees/e7af1dd4ca9699e2316d3811686a9