xpected Behavior\n\n`@nx/plugin` runs its unit tests on Vitest 4, inferred by `@nx/vitest`\nand loading the shared `tools/vitest/setup.mts`. Test count is\nunchanged.\n\n| package | tests (jest → vitest) | `nx test` wall time |\nrunner-reported time |\n| ------- | --------------------- | ------------------- |\n-------------------- |\n| plugin  | 92 → 92 (9 files) | 403.4s → 10.5s | 401.7s → 9.1s |\n\nTimings are medians of 3 rounds of `nx test plugin --skip-nx-cache\n--excludeTaskDependencies` with a warm Nx daemon, alternating jest and\nvitest within each round, on an 8-core machine with some other load.\nRunner time is jest''s `Time` / vitest''s `Duration`.\n\nThis one is config-only:\n\n- `vitest.config.mts` in the same shape as the other migrated packages,\n`jest.config.cts` removed, `tsconfig.spec.json` on `vitest/globals`, and\nthe shared `test.inputs` block in `project.json`.\n- No spec changes were needed. Every `jest` reference in the specs is a\nstring asserting generated `jest.config.cts` content, not a Jest API\ncall.\n- No `.snap` files; all inline snapshots match unchanged.\n- `CONTRIBUTING.md`''s vitest note now lists `packages/plugin`.\n\n### Verification\n\n- `nx run-many -t test,build,lint,oxlint -p plugin --skip-nx-cache` —\ngreen (92 tests, same as Jest)\n- `nx sync:check` — clean\n- Two further repeat runs, plus the three timing rounds — green\n\n## Related Issue(s)\n\nN/A\n\n<!-- polygraph-session-start -->\n---\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://app.trypolygraph.com/orgs/6a061dcb561c062131116eca/sessions/Run-rspack-and-rsbuild-unit-tests-with-vitest-4a161f55\">View\nPolygraph session ↗</a></p>\n<!-- polygraph-session-end -->","tree":{"sha":"d317ace181646b2434632d7b0ad7963671ca6e6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/trees/d317ace181646b2434632d7b0ad7963671ca6e6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/nx/git/commits/9f1046e14c0e9a53ab6e7200d89b900a4b9a6bed","verification":{"payload":"tree d317ace181646b2434632d7b0ad7963671ca6e6a\nparent 3f