"2026-10-08T17:21:43.131Z","repositoryId":103269086,"sha":"13d6a8cdb2a0ebf8ca1058412c5031d7861f0072"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T17:21:43.131Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11595956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shubham-shrivastava","id":11595956,"login":"shubham-shrivastava","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTk1OTU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shubham-shrivastava/shubham-shrivastava.github.io/commits/1e33ab446b8b2f6e94f00f66703202a84e98f2ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T06:14:04Z","email":"shrivastava.shubham219@gmail.com","name":"Shubham Shrivastav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T06:14:04Z","email":"shrivastava.shubham219@gmail.com","name":"Shubham Shrivastav"},"message":"fix: unfreeze the page after closing the image lightbox\n\nThe scroll lock hung off transitionstart/transitionend on the lightbox.\nThe redesigned overlay toggles `display`, which cannot transition, so\ntransitionstart still fired from a child''s transition bubbling up while\ntransitionend never fired on close. The body was left with\n`overflow: hidden` and the page could not be scrolled again.\n\nLock and release directly in openGallery/closeLightbox instead, and have\nthe lightbox and terminal each check whether the other is still open\nbefore releasing, since they share one lock.\n\nAlso stop hard-coding `display: flex` inline on the prev/next controls.\nThat inline value beat the stylesheet''s `display: grid`, so `place-items`\nonly centred vertically and both chevrons sat 12.75px left of centre in\ntheir own backgrounds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018fMrCoAKtbdMdGh1pHj5qU","tree":{"sha":"94f5619a6069feb86acfce08ae65a1c767e5717a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shubham-shrivastava/shubham-shrivastava.github.io/git/trees/94f5619a6069feb86acfce08ae65a1c767e5717a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shubham-shrivastava/shubham-shrivastava.github.io/git/commits/1e33ab446b8b2f6e94f00f66703202a84e98f2ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11595956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shubham-shrivastava","id":11595956,"login":"shubham-shrivastava","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTk1OTU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shubham-shrivastava/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gi